ry string\n- Finalization 必须按固定顺序：历史保存 → checkpoint → 释放 active_run → Memory Formation\n\n---\n\n当前 [`todolist.md`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/docs/todolist.md) 显示：\n- ✅ `query_data` 和 `analyze_data` 均已完成真实 HTTP 验收\n- ⏳ D8 (`build_report`) 待接入\n- ⏳ 跨基础设施一致性验收待完成\n\n这个项目采用**纵向切片**开发策略，每个切片独立验收后再进入下一个，确保系统稳定演进。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789442229616},{"id":"c72277fb-d4e7-4331-8887-34f9fb876e9e","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"现在整体api应该已经是修改完毕了，但是普通聊天应该是不展示侧边的执行过程的弹窗的","payload":{"query":"现在整体api应该已经是修改完毕了，但是普通聊天应该是不展示侧边的执行过程的弹窗的","rawMessage":"现在整体api应该已经是修改完毕了，但是普通聊天应该是不展示侧边的执行过程的弹窗的","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"frontend/next.config.ts","name":"next.config.ts","type":"CURRENT_FILE"},{"id":"616934","name":"image.png","content":"https://comate.baidu.com/api/aidevops/autocomate/rest/autowork/v1/file/stream/616934?authorization=NjFjYWEwODUtMGY0Ni00YTYyLTg1NjEtN2Y0MmJlYWJlNzYx","type":"IMAGE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"eeb973bb-e0ff-4bc6-b295-e3d4ddbf5f1b","requestedAt":1789443133539,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"c72277fb-d4e7-4331-8887-34f9fb876e9e"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"bcc9ce000688653c6d7465fa24c98828a8335cc1","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]}},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1789443133627},{"id":"a9046d63-b27e-45b2-8723-b735532bcaf8","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"c72277fb-d4e7-4331-8887-34f9fb876e9e","reportedId":"0d24bbb4-13fd-455a-9e0b-ae25e3cacd1a",