ncelled and finalized (no traceback spam; FinalizationFailure would be a problem).\n   - curl status: `curl \"http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/harness/run/status?run_id=<run_id>&user_id=dev-user\"` → expect `status: cancelled`, `phase: finalization`. How does the user get run_id? The backend log prints run_id on start; or query DB: `SELECT run_id, status, phase FROM harness_runs ORDER BY updated_at DESC LIMIT 3;` — need the exact table/columns. Actually the run store model is harness_runs. Let me give a psql query. The user has been using psql presumably (I gave them DB checks earlier). Table name: harness_runs; columns include run_id, user_id, status, phase, state_version... I should double check column names quickly? I know HarnessRunModel exists; likely columns: run_id, conversation_id, user_id, status, phase, terminal_intent, state_version, deadline_at, last_error... I'm fairly confident about run_id/status/phase. I could verify quickly with a grep on the model. Let me do that to be safe.\n\n   - Frontend: refresh page, in the SAME conversation ask a new question → it should start normally (this proves active_run_id released). That's the user-visible acceptance.\n   - Optional DB: conversation row's active_run_id should be NULL.\n\n6. Expected final: run cancelled/finalization, ledger completed (formation skipped since status != COMPLETED). Check harness_finalizations: stage=completed.\n\nNote: after cancelled, will the turn's history contain a final assistant message \"任务已取消，未继续执行后续分析。\"? Yes — _finalize saves history with final_answer=\"任务已取消，未继续执行后续分析。\" So the conversation will show that message. Good to tell the user what they'll see.\n\n**用例 4：deadline → timeout**\n\nMechanism: `run_timeout_seconds` (config.yaml line 18, currently 1800). deadline_at persisted at start; `_check_deadline` before each stage + `_await_with_deadline` wraps external calls; on exceed → `HarnessDeadlineExceeded` → `_finalize` with terminal_status=TIMEOUT → run ends `timeout/finalization`? Actually HarnessStatus.TIMEOUT — value likely \"timeout\". Final answer: \"任务执行超过时间限制，已停止继续处理。\"\n\nSteps:\n1. Edit config.yaml: `run_timeout_seconds: 1800` → `run_timeout_seconds: 20`. Save.\n2. Restart the backend (config is loaded at startup — settings loaded once; uvicorn --reload would also reload on .py changes, but config.yaml change may not trigger reload, so manual restart).\n3. In frontend, ask a question that takes > 20s: \"分析近6个月销售趋势和环比变化，给出结论\" (took ~167s before, so 20s will definitely be exceeded). Even a query question works (~1 min).\n4. Expected: about 20 seconds in, the run stops. The SSE stream will deliver `run.result` with status=timeout, phase=finalization, last_error code=run_deadline_exceeded. Frontend shows the final message \"任务执行超过时间限制，已停止继续处理。\"\n5. Verify via status curl or DB: status=timeout, last_error code run_deadline_exceeded; active_run_id released (can ask new question in same conversation).\n6. IMPORTANT: restore config.yaml to 1800 and restart backend again.\n\nTiming nuance: the deadline check happens between stages and on external awaits — with `_await_with_deadline` wrapping each external call (planner LLM call, tool execution), the timeout triggers at the next await boundary after deadline passes. So it should hit within a few seconds after 20s. Note: tool execution is wrapped in _await_with_deadline? Tool dispatch — likely. The planner call definitely. So expect stop at ~20-30s.\n\nAlso note: when deadline hits, the in-flight tool work is aborted mid-execution (asyncio.wait_for cancels the awaitable). Fine.\n\nOne caveat for 用例 4: there was a recorded \"aware/naive timezone risk\" from earlier (D 真实 PostgreSQL 的运行级 deadline 验收待完成 in todolist). In real PG, deadline_at is stored as ISO string with tz; `datetime.now(UTC)` vs stored aware datetime — if stored naive, subtraction raises TypeError. This is exactly what this acceptance is meant to verify. So I should warn: if backend errors with \"can't subtract offset-naive and offset-aware datetimes\" or similar, that's the known risk this test is designed to expose — report back and I'll fix. Good to set expectations.\n\nAlso for 用例 3, one nuance: if the user just refreshes the page, does the frontend abort the fetch? Most browsers abort in-flight fetch on page unload — yes. Closing tab definitely. Alternatively they can use curl to start a run and Ctrl+C the curl — that's the most deterministic: `curl -N -X POST .../api/harness/run -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{...}'` then Ctrl+C after ~15s. Ctrl+C closes connection → same path. But frontend way is more realistic and the user is doing frontend acceptance. I'll offer both: primary = close tab/refresh during a long analysis; alternative = curl -N + Ctrl+C.\n\nLet me double check the run start endpoint path and required body so my curl example is right. From summary: POST /api/harness/run with body including question/conversation/user fields. I don't have the exact schema. Rather than risk a wrong curl body, I can give the frontend way as primary and for curl just say \"用你之前跑通的方式发起\". Or quickly grep the router for the start endpoint body model. Let me check quickly — it's cheap. Actually, I gave the user curl commands before (they ran reconcile curls), so they know. But a ready-to-paste curl would be nice. Let me grep the HarnessRunRequest model quickly.","startTime":1791428023742,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023742},{"id":"call_765cfb7920274e2ba345d77a","type":"TOOL","toolName":"grep_content","params":{"-A":"14","-n":"true","output_mode":"content","path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/api/routers/harness.py","pattern":"class HarnessRunRequest|class HarnessStatusRequest"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Found 1 matches\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/api/routers/harness.py:\n  Line 91: class HarnessRunRequest(BaseModel):\n  Line 92:     \"\"\"创建 Harness 运行的请求；用户认证完成前暂时携带 user_id。\"\"\"\n  Line 93: \n  Line 94:     input_text: str = Field(min_length=1, max_length=20_000)\n  Line 95:     # 当前前端尚未接入登录；后续由认证依赖替换，而不是修改 Harness 状态模型。\n  Line 96:     user_id: str = Field(\n  Line 97:         default=settings.app.default_user_id,\n  Line 98:         min_length=1,\n  Line 99:         max_length=128,\n  Line 100:     )\n  Line 101:     conversation_id: str | None = Field(default=None, min_length=1, max_length=128)\n  Line 102:     asset_ids: list[str] = Field(default_factory=list, max_length=32)\n  Line 103: \n  Line 104: \n  Line 105: class HarnessResumeRequest(BaseModel):","metadata":{"pattern":"class HarnessRunRequest|class HarnessStatusRequest","relevantFiles":[{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/api/routers/harness.py","startLine":91,"endLine":105}]}}}]},{"id":"6aa8e1891b824c72da0f347a","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":28040},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"533f2d86-f94e-4ba7-b562-6d5c2b1e3b7a","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"I have everything I need. Now write the answer in Chinese with two concrete test procedures.\n\n用例 3 steps (frontend primary):\n1. 发起一个耗时问题（\"分析近6个月销售趋势和环比变化，给出结论\"）\n2. 流式输出进行到 20-30 秒时，直接关掉浏览器标签页（或刷新页面）\n3. 等 5-10 秒，验证：\n   - DB: harness_runs 该 run 的 status/phase; harness_finalizations stage=completed\n   - conversation.active_run_id = NULL\n   - 同会话再问一个新问题能正常开始\n4. 说明会看到的现象：后端日志取消收口，历史里落一条\"任务已取消，未继续执行后续分析。\"\n\nAlso mention alternative: curl -N + Ctrl+C for deterministic reproduction.\n\n用例 4 steps:\n1. 改 config.yaml line 18: run_timeout_seconds: 1800 → 20\n2. 重启后端（配置在启动时加载）\n3. 前端问同样耗时的分析问题\n4. 预期 ~20 秒后流返回 run.result，status=timeout, last_error.code=run_deadline_exceeded，最终消息\"任务执行超过时间限制，已停止继续处理。\"\n5. 验证同会话能继续提问（active_run 释放）、账本 completed\n6. 改回 1800 并重启\n\nWarn: deadline 验收正是为了暴露真实 PG 下 aware/naive 时区风险 — 如果后端报 \"can't subtract offset-naive and offset-aware datetimes\" 或 deadline 没触发，把日志贴给我，这是已知风险点。\n\nVerification commands: psql queries. I should give the exact SQL. Table names: harness_runs, harness_finalizations, conversations. Columns: run_id, user_id, status, phase (harness_runs); stage (harness_finalizations); active_run_id (conversations). I'm reasonably confident from earlier session work (I ran such queries: \"SELECT ... FROM harness_finalizations WHERE run_id=...\"). For harness_runs I verified status/phase earlier too. Keep the SQL simple.\n\nFormat: two sections with numbered steps, keep concise. Include expected outcomes. Use code blocks for commands.","startTime":1791428023742,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023742},{"id":"6f222173-9ec1-4a25-b04c-1b860e1f1ad0","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"两个用例的原理先说清楚，步骤就自然了：\n\n- **用例 3（断流）**：SSE 连接断开时，uvicorn 会在下一次写流（心跳间隔内）感知到，取消执行任务；`LoopController` 捕获 `CancelledError` 后用 `terminal_status=cancelled` 走一次完整收口（[`controller.py:204-226`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/loop_controller/controller.py#L204-226)）。预期终态：`cancelled/finalization`，`active_run_id` 释放，账本 `completed`（非 COMPLETED 不提交 Formation）。\n- **用例 4（deadline）**：`config.yaml` 的 `run_timeout_seconds`（当前 1800）在 run 启动时持久化成 `deadline_at`，控制器在每个阶段之间和每次外部调用上都检查（`_check_deadline` / `_await_with_deadline`），超了就抛 `HarnessDeadlineExceeded` → `terminal_status=timeout`（[`controller.py:190-203`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/loop_controller/controller.py#L190-203)）。\n\n---\n\n## 用例 3：断流 → cancelled\n\n1. 前端发起一个耗时问题：`分析近6个月销售趋势和环比变化，给出结论`（上次跑了约 3 分钟，足够）。\n2. 流式输出进行到 **20~30 秒**时，直接**关掉浏览器标签页**（或刷新页面）——关键是断开这条 SSE 连接。\n3. 等 5~10 秒，验证：\n\n```sql\n-- 终态应为 cancelled/finalization\nSELECT run_id, status, phase FROM harness_runs ORDER BY updated_at DESC LIMIT 3;\n-- 账本应为 completed（cancelled 不提交 Formation）\nSELECT run_id, stage, reconcile_attempts FROM harness_finalizations ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 3;\n-- 释放验证\nSELECT active_run_id FROM conversations WHERE conversation_id = '<会话id>';\n```\n\n4. 前端刷新页面，**同一个会话**里再问一个新问题——能正常开始就证明 `active_run_id` 已释放（这是最关键的验收点）。\n\n历史里会落一条 assistant 消息：「任务已取消，未继续执行后续分析。」这是设计行为。\n\n> 备选的确定性做法：用 `curl -N` 发起运行，15 秒后 `Ctrl+C`，效果等同关页面。\n\n## 用例 4：deadline → timeout\n\n1. 改 `config.yaml:18`：`run_timeout_seconds: 1800` → **`run_timeout_seconds: 20`**。\n2. **重启后端**（配置是启动时加载的，改完必须重启才生效）。\n3. 前端问同样的耗时分析问题。\n4. 预期 **约 20 秒**（可能 20~30 秒，取决于检查点位置）流会返回 `run.result`：`status=timeout`、`last_error.code=run_deadline_exceeded`，前端显示最终消息「任务执行超过时间限制，已停止继续处理。」\n5. 验证：DB 里该 run 为 `timeout/finalization`；同会话能继续提问。\n6. **验收完把 `run_timeout_seconds` 改回 `1800`，再重启一次后端。**\n\n---\n\n一个预期提醒：这条 deadline 验收正是 todolist 里挂着的「真实 PostgreSQL 的运行级 deadline 验收」——它要暴露的已知风险是 `deadline_at` 存库后的 aware/naive 时区问题。如果后端报 `can't subtract offset-naive and offset-aware datetimes` 之类的 TypeError，或者 20 秒后运行没停，直接把后端日志贴给我，这是这次测试要抓的东西，不算你操作失误。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789452710014},{"id":"2aec00ee-961e-4526-af42-05bb1e10a6bb","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"SELECT run_id, status, phase FROM harness_runs ORDER BY updated_at DESC LIMIT 3;\n 报错数据库返回了 SQL 错误（阶段：execute）。 ERROR: relation \"harness_runs\" does not exist SQL text omitted from user-facing error; enable debug SQL diagnostics to inspect the original statement.","payload":{"query":"SELECT run_id, status, phase FROM harness_runs ORDER BY updated_at DESC LIMIT 3;\n 报错数据库返回了 SQL 错误（阶段：execute）。 ERROR: relation \"harness_runs\" does not exist SQL text omitted from user-facing error; enable debug SQL diagnostics to inspect the original statement.","rawMessage":"SELECT run_id, status, phase FROM harness_runs ORDER BY updated_at DESC LIMIT 3;\n 报错数据库返回了 SQL 错误（阶段：execute）。 ERROR: relation \"harness_runs\" does not exist SQL text omitted from user-facing error; enable debug SQL diagnostics to inspect the original statement.","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"docs/todolist.md","name":"todolist.md","type":"CURRENT_FI