— right at the 300s tool timeout + retries. So:\n\n- 11:05:00 tool started → 11:10:00 wait_for(300s) fired → tool_timeout → retries consumed (or unrecoverable) → run FAILED → finalization → 11:10:21 done.\n\nSo the system's timeout-and-fail path WORKED as designed. The run is now `failed/finalization`. Let me confirm the final state + last_error (find the right column name — the run model has... let me check quickly: HarnessRunModel columns include error? Earlier model read showed harness_runs columns; there's likely `last_error` JSONB... the query said column doesn't exist. Let me check the model quickly — or just select * limited columns. Actually let me query the ledger and the finalization record, plus the frontend user-visible behavior.\n\nLet me check what the final error was: harness_finalizations error_message column exists (saw in model). Query it.","startTime":1791428023743,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023743},{"id":"8e9e8462-664b-42b8-b9ac-7f71023a5916","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"run 在 **11:10:21 落为 `failed`**——正好是工具 300 秒超时 + 重试耗尽后的收口，超时兜底按设计工作了。看下最终错误记录："},{"id":"call_f3e90689ba1b49d1a1d1680a","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"psql -h 127.0.0.1 -U z523 -d agent_app -c \"SELECT terminal_status, stage, error_message FROM harness_finalizations WHERE run_id='c1dab3bb-7a12-4b2e-9af8-49b5e7e78c52';\" -c \"SELECT active_run_id FROM conversations WHERE conversation_id=(SELECT conversation_id FROM harness_runs WHERE run_id='c1dab3bb-7a12-4b2e-9af8-49b5e7e78c52');\" 2>&1 | head -15","description":"Check finalization error and active run release"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Command executed successfully.\nExit code: 0\nOutput:\n terminal_status |   stage   | error_message \n-----------------+-----------+---------------\n failed          | completed | tool_timeout\n(1 row)\n\n active_run_id \n---------------\n \n(1 row)\n\n","metadata":{"cwd":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis","autoRun":true,"state