e:\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Embedding 客户端管理器。\n\n负责按配置初始化 Embedding 服务客户端，并为字段、指标和用户问题的向量化\n提供统一访问入口。\n\"\"\"\n\nimport asyncio\nimport logging\nfrom typing import Optional\n\nfrom langchain_core.embeddings import Embeddings\nfrom langchain_huggingface import HuggingFaceEndpointEmbeddings\nfrom langchain_openai import OpenAIEmbeddings\n\nfrom app.core.config import EmbeddingConfig, settings\n\nlogger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\n\n\nclass TimeoutHuggingFaceEmbeddings(HuggingFaceEndpointEmbeddings):\n    \"\"\"给 embedding 调用加硬超时；本地推理服务挂起时快速失败而不是无限等待。\"\"\"\n\n    timeout_seconds: float = 30.0\n\n    async def aembed_query(self, text: str) -> list[float]:\n        return await asyncio.wait_for(\n            super().aembed_query(text), timeout=self.timeout_seconds\n        )\n\n    async def aembed_documents(self, texts: list[str]) -> list[list[float]]:\n        return await asyncio.wait_for(\n            super().aembed_documents(texts), timeout=self.timeout_seconds\n        )\n\n\nclass EmbeddingClientManager:\n    \"\"\"管理 Embedding 服务客户端的初始化与复用\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, config: EmbeddingConfig):\n        self.client: Optional[Embeddings] = None\n        self.config = config\n\n    def _build_client(self) -> Embeddings:\n        \"\"\"按 provider 构建对应的 Embedding 客户端。\"\"\"\n        if self.config.provider == \"dashscope\":\n            # check_embedding_ctx_length=False 避免按 OpenAI 词表切分中文文本。\n            return OpenAIEmbeddings(\n                model=self.config.model_name,\n                dimensions=self.config.dimensions,\n                api_key=self.config.api_key,\n                base_url=self.config.base_url,\n                request_timeout=self.config.timeout_seconds,\n                max_retries=0,\n                chunk_size=self.config.batch_size,\n                check_embedding_ctx_length=False,\n            )\n        return TimeoutHuggingFaceEmbeddings(\n            model=f\"http://{self.config.host}:{self.config.port}\",\n            timeout_seconds=self.config.timeout_seconds,\n        )\n\n    def init(self):\n        \"\"\"显式初始化客户端，避免模块导入时立即建立外部连接\"\"\"\n        self.client = self._build_client()\n        logger.info(\n            \"Embedding 客户端已初始化：provider=%s model=%s dimensions=%s\",\n            self.config.provider,\n            self.config.active_model,\n            self.config.dimensions,\n        )\n\n    async def verify_dimension(self, expected: int) -> None:\n        \"\"\"启动期自检：真实调用一次 embedding，校验向量维度与配置一致。\n\n        向量空间不兼容时（例如切换了 embedding 模型）必须重建 Qdrant\n        collection，这里提前失败比运行期写入报错更容易定位。\n        \"\"\"\n        vector = await self.client.aembed_query(\"维度自检\")\n        if len(vector) != expected:\n            raise RuntimeError(\n                f\"Embedding 返回维度 {len(vector)} 与配置维度 {expected} 不一致，\"\n                \"请检查 embedding.provider/model_name 与 qdrant.vector_size 是否匹配。\"\n            )\n```\n\nWait — `_get_url` was a method; I inline it into the local branch. That removes a now-trivial method. Good per \"不做没有必要的抽离\".\n\nAlso the `if __name__ == \"__main__\"` block at the bottom — keep it, update to work with both providers (it calls client.aembed_query; works for both). Keep as-is.\n\nNote: `settings` import in embedding_client.py — currently imports `EmbeddingConfig, settings` but `settings` is only used at module bottom for singleton: `embedding_client_manager = EmbeddingClientManager(settings.embedding)`. Keep.\n\nHmm, wait — OpenAIEmbeddings `request_timeout` accepts float | tuple — fine. `max_retries=0` — langchain-openai OpenAIEmbeddings has max_retries field, default 2. Good.\n\nOne concern: `OpenAIEmbeddings` with `check_embedding_ctx_length=False` uses `_get_len_safe_embeddings`? Actually with check_embedding_ctx_length=False, it calls the API directly in batches of chunk_size without tiktoken tokenization. Good.\n\nAnother concern: does OpenAIEmbeddings pass `dimensions` param to the API? Yes — when dimensions is set and check_embedding_ctx_length=False, it includes dimensions in the request. DashScope text-embedding-v3 supports dimensions param (default 1024, options 1024/768/512). Good.\n\n**Edit 4 — main.py**:\n```python\n    llm_client_manager.init()\n    embedding_client_manager.init()\n    qdrant_client_manager.init()\n    ...\n    await postgres_client_manager.init()\n    # 启动期校验 embedding 维度与 Qdrant collection 一致，避免切换模型后向量空间不兼容。\n    await embedding_client_manager.verify_dimension(settings.qdrant.vector_size)\n    await memory_client_manager.init()\n```\n\nHmm, placement: after qdrant init (doesn't actually need qdrant for the check, but logically after embedding init + before memory init which writes vectors). Put it right before memory_client_manager.init() with the comment. Actually verify_dimension only needs the embedding client. Place it right after embedding_client_manager.init()? But init() is sync and doesn't connect... a real HTTP call at startup — good place is right after qdrant init since it validates the pair conceptually. I'll put it just before memory init as planned.\n\n**Edit 5 — memory/factory.py:86**: `name=settings.embedding.active_model,`\n\nThen verification:\n1. `python -c` load settings, print embedding config fields + active_model\n2. Verify embedding_client_manager.init() constructs OpenAIEmbeddings — need DASHSCOPE_API_KEY; .env may have it (llm uses it). init() itself doesn't call API. Check type.\n3. verify_dimension with real API — this makes a real call; acceptable (one tiny call). Actually yes — that's the true verification that the whole thing works. Do it.\n4. Run focused tests: pytest tests/ (the embedding client tests — check if tests/test_embedding_client.py exists). Also run full suite to confirm 184 passed + 18 pre-existing failures.\n\nAlso check: scripts build_meta_vectors.py / build_dimension_value_indexes.py use embedding_client_manager — they auto-follow. And semantic services use `settings.embedding.batch_size` (now 6 — OpenAIEmbeddings chunk_size also 6 — consistent).\