un_ref — available. Also timeout: _await_with_deadline wraps build — timeout → TimeoutError → deadline path → run.timeout; context.failed not emitted (context group partial via interrupted rule ✓ acceptable).\n   \n   Is adding context.failed worth it? The frontend's family-conclusion rule then shows context items... started → concluded by context.failed → success?? Hmm! My itemStatus: concluded checks `.completed || .failed || .resolved` → context.failed → started shows success — \"开始构建上下文 ✓\" then... the failed item itself shows ✗ ✓. Group shows failed (statusForEvents: context.failed → failed) ✓. OK good.\n   \n   B. Frontend-only: extend interrupted to run.failed → context group shows partial (中断) on failed runs. This covers ALL mid-phase crashes generically (any phase lacking terminal).\n   \n   Optimal: BOTH — B is the generic safety net (one line); A gives precise per-phase failure marking. A is small (one try/except around build). Hmm — but is A \"useless\" given B? With B alone: context group shows 中断 on run failure — user can't tell it was the context that crashed vs anything else. With A: context group shows failed + the failed item visible in drawer. Precise diagnosis wins — the panel's whole purpose is debugging. Add A.\n\n   Wait — also planner failure path: planner.failed emitted (2 sites ✓) — covered. Tool: tool.failed ✓. Confirmation: waiting → pause (run stays running, not failed) ✓. So context is the only phase lacking terminal emission. \n\n11. Also — should `_run_guarded` failure emit an `error`-type event with details? The frontend displayLabel has \"错误信息\" for type \"error\". Is \"error\" emitted anywhere? grep... not in controller inventory. Another dead mapping? statusForEvents checks event.type === \"error\" → failed. displayLabel error → 错误信息. If never emitted → dead. But RunError details — run.failed payload probably includes error info. So \"error\" type is dead too → remove from frontend? Careful — old-graph runs might emit type \"error\" (agent_service line 62: \"step\": \"Agent 服务错误\"...). The panel serves old-graph turns too! Old-graph SSE events: agent_service emits {\"type\": ..., \"step\": ...} — does old graph emit type \"error\"? Possibly (error handling paths). The frontend mappings for old-graph events (question_route, analysis_task_*, reasoning_*, llm_*, report_plan_result, rendered_report) are ALIVE for old-graph/non-harness runs. So \"error\" might be alive via old graph. Don't remove old-graph-facing mappings — only remove mappings for HARNESS event types that are never emitted (observation.recorded, finalization.*, tool.retrying). Let me verify old graph error event usage quickly: grep '\"type\": \"error\"' or \"type\": 'error' in app. Actually — keep \"error\" mapping; it's generic and harmless. Focus.\n\n    Hmm, wait — actually let me reconsider removing finalization.*: is the panel used for old-graph runs where finalization.* emitted? finalization.* is a HARNESS concept (old graph has no finalization). Harness never emits it (grep). Dead → remove mapping (STEP_ORDER 最终收口, mainStep finalization.* branch, moduleNode finalization branch — moduleNode line 165: `if (type.startsWith(\"finalization.\")) return \"finalization\";` → dead → remove). displayLabel has no finalization entries? It has... looking at displayLabel: no finalization branches (run.* only). mainStep line 139: `if (type.startsWith(\"finalization.\")) return \"最终收口\";` → remove. moduleNode line 165 → remove. STEP_ORDER \"最终收口\" → remove. Also statusFromEventType — no finalization-specific entries (generic .completed suffix covers) ✓.\n\n    observation.recorded: STEP_ORDER \"记录观察结果\" remove; mainStep line 137 remove; displayLabel? No displayLabel branch for observation.recorded... wait — statusFromEventType — I added observation.recorded → success — remove. moduleNode line 164: observation.recorded → loop_controller → remove that part (keep action.committed & confirmation.*).\n\n    tool.retrying: displayLabel line 372 remove. statusFromEventType .retrying suffix — planner.retrying alive → keep suffix rule.\n\n12. What about `confirmation.*` — emitted ✓ alive. `question_route` — old graph ✓ alive.\n\nNow assemble the OPTIMAL PLAN (user asked for 方案 first? \"整体链路走查一遍，给我最优方案\" — they want the walkthrough + optimal plan. Should I implement immediately or present? \"给我最优方案\" = give me the optimal plan → present it, wait for confirmation. Given the pattern (they say ok then I implement), I'll present the plan concisely and ask to proceed. Actually — hmm, they might want me to just do it. \"给我最优方案\" — give me the plan. Present, concise, then \"确认就改\". Let me first verify _run_guarded's failure emissions and the pause path to make the walkthrough accurate. Let me read controller lines 180-300 quickly.","startTime":1791428023744,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023744},{"id":"23aa65a6-9224-4ed3-bdbf-268019d80752","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"先把最后几个不确定点核实掉（失败路径到底发什么事件），再给方案："},{"id":"call_32f79c8416f94495bbb58f6b","type":"TOOL","toolName":"read_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/loop_controller/controller.py","limit":"120","offset":"180"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":{"$blob":"sha256:aa76128afbe79f467911619484b5ec9ec7f395ed1618d807df4459b0b0f2100a","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":6326,"compression":"none"},"metadata":{"relativePath":"app/agent/loop_controller/controller.py","absolutePath":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/loop_controller/controller.py","resolution":"absolute","endLine":299,"startLine":180,"totalLines":1185}}}]},{"id":"6aab73f1fe8fcb022bfabd28","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":38269},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"5fb37c88-218f-4a8b-84d0-b325751e99df","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"_run_guarded: exceptions → _finalize with terminal_status FAILED → which emits run.failed (via _finalize). So context build crash → run.failed only; no context.failed. Confirmed the gap.\n\nNow check where run.failed/run.completed are emitted in _finalize to confirm the terminal event carries error details, and check planner failure emits (planner.failed with error payload). Also check whether the run.failed/run.completed emissions include payload with error info — presumably finalization result. Good enough.\n\nOne more verify — the frontend `moduleNode` maps `observation.recorded` to loop_controller; `_emit` in controller never emits it. Also check whether the tool runtime emits \"observation.recorded\"... earlier inventory: only tool.*. Confirmed dead.\n\nAlso verify \"error\" type usage for old graph — quick grep for '\"type\": \"error\"' in app (agent_service or graph error handling) to decide whether error mapping stays. Actually the panel serves old-graph turns; keep \"error\" regardless (harmless).\n\nAlso — one more potential live check: does `_finalize` emit finalization.* events? grep said no finalization strings in controller. run.completed/failed/timeout/cancelled emitted where? Let me just grep for \"run.completed\" context lines to see the payload and confirm no other events. Minor — skip, the grep inventory was complete.\n\nNow compose the walkthrough + optimal plan.\n\n## 链路走查结果\n\n**后端事件清单（全量盘点）：**\n\n| 阶段 | 成功路径 | 失败/中断路径 | 结论 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| run | run.started | run.completed / run.failed / run.timeout / run.cancelled + run.result(API 层) | ✓ 完整 |\n| context | started / memory_retrieved / knowledge_retrieved / context_compiled / completed | **缺 context.failed** — 构建失败时异常直接冒泡到 _run_guarded → 只有 run.failed | ✗ 缺口 |\n| planner | started / completed | retrying ✓ / failed ✓(2处) | ✓ 完整 |\n| action | action.committed | — | ✓ |\n| tool | started / progress / completed | failed ✓（retrying 前端有映射但后端从不发） | 前端有死映射 |\n| confirmation | required / resolved | — | ✓ |\n| observation | **后端从不发** observation.recorded | — | 前端死映射 |\n| finalization | **后端从不发** finalization.* | — | 前端死映射 |\n\n**前端问题：**\n1. 已修：条目状态推导（itemStatus）\n2. 未修 A：run.failed 的 run 中，没有终态事件的分组永远转圈——interrupted 判定只覆盖 run.cancelled/run.timeout，不含 run.failed\n3. 未修 B：死映射——observation.recorded、finalization.*、tool.retrying 后端从不发，前端却有 STEP_ORDER/mainStep/displayLabel/statusFromEventType/moduleNode 的对应分支\n\n**关于\"后端要不要加 status 字段\"**：不加。理由：事件类型本身就是状态机的规范编码（started/completed/failed 配对），加 status 是冗余编码；而且 started 条目的展示状态取决于\"之后是否来了终态事件\"，这是渲染时才知道的事，后端在 emit 时刻写 status 也写不出正确值。前端按类型推导不是\"兼容\"，是唯一正确的位置。真正要做的是后端保证生命周期配对完整。\n\n## 最优方案\n\n**后端（1 处）：**\n- `_build_context` 失败时补发 `context.failed`（try/except 包住构建，emit 后 re-raise）——这是唯一缺终态的阶段。planner/tool 都有。\n\n**前端（2 处）：**\n1. `statusForEvents` 的 interrupted 判定加入 `run.failed`：运行失败时仍在 running 的分组显示 partial（被中断），不再永远转圈——这是通用兜底，覆盖任何阶段的意外崩溃\n2. 删掉死映射：\n   - STEP_ORDER：`记录观察结果`、`最终收口`\n   - mainStep：`observation.recorded`、`finalization.*` 分支\n   - moduleNode：`observation.recorded`、`finalization.*` 分支\n   - displayLabel：`tool.retrying`\n   - statusFromEventType：`observation.recorded`（我上一轮加的，一并撤销）\n\n改完的语义：后端保证\"每个 started 族必有 completed/failed 或 run 级终态\"，前端按类型推导 + 族内配对，无冗余字段、无死代码。\n\nWait — one thing to double check before presenting: `_build_context` 失败补发 context.failed — where exactly? _build_context body: after context.started emit, `await self.context_builder.build(request)` can throw; also _emit calls themselves are try/except'd. The wrap: try: build... except Exception: emit context.failed; raise. But also the `_await_with_deadline` timeout raises HarnessDeadlineExceeded BEFORE/at the call site (line 525-527), not inside _build_context — timeout → no context.failed (group shows partial via frontend fix) — acceptable, deadline is a run-level interruption, not a context failure. Good.\n\nAlso — should planner failed carry enough payload? Existing ✓.\n\nShould I also mention run.result payload carries loop_result (final answer etc.) ✓ alive.\n\nPresent the plan. The user said \"给我最优方案\" — present and ask for confirmation. Keep it tight. Maybe also create task list? The reminder suggests tasks. I'll present the plan first; on ok, implement (could create tasks then). Keep response focused.","startTime":1791428023744,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023744},{"id":"e6e75ffc-7d22-4f1e-ad2d-5cf73288755c","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"核实完了。先给走查结论，再给方案。\n\n## 全链路事件盘点\n\n**后端实际发出的（controller + runtime + API 层）：**\n\n| 阶段 | 成功路径 | 失败/中断路径 | 结论 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| run | `run.started` | `run.completed` / `run.failed` / `run.timeout` / `run.cancelled` / `run.result` | ✓ 完整 |\n| context | `started` → `memory_retrieved` → `knowledge_retrieved` → `context_compiled` → `completed` | **缺 `context.failed`**——构建抛异常直接冒泡到 `_run_guarded`，只发 `run.failed`（controller.py:232-246） | ✗ 唯一缺口 |\n| planner | `started` / `completed` | `retrying` ✓、`failed` ✓ | ✓ 完整 |\n| tool | `started` / `progress` / `completed` | `failed` ✓ | ✓ 完整 |\n| action / confirmation | `committed` / `required`+`resolved` | — | ✓ 完整 |\n| observation / finalization | **后端从不发** `observation.recorded` 和 `finalization.*` | — | 纯前端死映射 |\n\n## 回答你的三个问题\n\n**1. 后端要不要加 status 字段？不加。** 事件类型本身就是状态机的规范编码（started/completed/failed 配对），加 status 是同一信息的冗余编码。更本质的：`started` 条目该显示什么状态取决于“之后有没有来终态事件”——这是渲染时才知道的事，后端在 emit 那一刻写不出正确值。前端按类型推导不是兼容层，是唯一正确的位置。\n\n**2. 后端状态全对吗？差一处。** context 是唯一“started 后可能永远没有终态”的阶段（planner/tool 失败都有对应 failed 事件）。后果：context 构建崩溃的 run，前端“构建上下文”分组永远转圈。\n\n**3. 有没有做兼容？有一处不该有的。** 前端为 `observation.recorded`、`finalization.*`、`tool.retrying` 写了一整套映射（STEP_ORDER、mainStep、displayLabel、moduleNode），但后端从不发这些事件——这是死代码，该删。\n\n## 最优方案\n\n**后端（1 处）**：`_build_context` 加 try/except，失败时补发 `context.failed` 后 re-raise。补齐生命周期配对，前端分组就能显示失败而不是靠兜底。\n\n**前端（2 处）**：\n1. `statusForEvents` 的 interrupted 判定加 `run.failed`：运行失败时还没有终态事件的分组显示“中断”（partial），和 cancel/timeout 同语义——这是通用兜底，覆盖任何阶段的意外崩溃\n2. 删死映射：STEP_ORDER 的 `记录观察结果`/`最终收口`、mainStep/moduleNode 的 `observation.recorded`/`finalization.*` 分支、displayLabel 的 `tool.retrying`、statusFromEventType 里我上一轮误加的 `observation.recorded`\n\n改完的不变量：**每个 started 族必有同族终态事件，或必有 run 级终态事件兜底**——前后端各守一半，无冗余字段、无死代码。\n\n确认就改。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789621267671},{"id":"6285258a-8922-4ed5-8603-1ebd665415e4","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"可以修改","payload":{"query":"可以修改","rawMessage":"可以修改","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx","name":"execution-panel.tsx","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"1dc31f18-da64-4c1a-aac6-b99a98f239ad","requestedAt":1789621825987,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"6285258a-8922-4ed5-8603-1ebd665415e4"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"bcc9ce000688653c6d7465fa24c98828a8335cc1","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]}},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1789621826009},{"id":"b9749dd1-35c0-469b-896b-94b207b7ad8b","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"6285258a-8922-4ed5-8603-1ebd665415e4","reportedId":"7c48e231-ca82-44c4-9c28-a8b7671033dd","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Comate"},"role":"assistant","status":"cancelled","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":67.98,"contextUsed":174034,"contextLimit":256000,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"performanceMetrics":{"firstTokenLatency":862,"totalDuration":124203},"appliedRuleNames":[],"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"6aab7646cdf0c54e27320e5e","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":37601},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"887ad8b8-43a1-4baa-8164-1372ead59bc6","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"User approved. Implement the plan:\n\n**Backend (1 change