ate/commit → InvokeTool → RecordObservation → loop\n- ContextEngine, Planner, ActionNormalizer/ActionCommitter, ToolRuntime (registry: query_data, analyze_data, build_report), EventWriter (HarnessEventWriter → QueueEventSink → SSE + trace 落库), FinalizationService (PostgresFinalizationLedger), Memory/Formation\n- 存储: PostgreSQL (harness_runs, conversations, checkpointer), MySQL (dw/meta), Qdrant, Neo4j, ES\n- query_data 内部图 (query_graph nodes: retrieve_columns → filter... → execute_sql → enrich) bridged via tool.progress\n\nMermaid flowchart:\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    subgraph 前端\n        UI[insight-agent 聊天 + 执行面板]\n    end\n    subgraph API层[FastAPI app/api]\n        R1[agent 路由：旧图 SSE]\n        R2[harness 路由：run/resume/confirm/reconcile]\n    end\n    subgraph 引擎\n        OLD[旧图 AgentGraph\\n分析/问数/日常聊天]\n        HC[LoopController\\nHarness 循环]\n    end\n    ...\n```\n\nKeep it moderately simple — architecture overview, not every box. Let me write:\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n    UI[前端 insight-agent<br/>聊天 + 执行面板] -->|SSE| API[FastAPI 路由<br/>app/api/routers]\n    API --> OLD[旧图 AgentGraph<br/>问数 / 分析 / 日常聊天]\n    API --> HC[Harness LoopController<br/>受控循环]\n    subgraph Harness 内核\n        HC --> CE[ContextEngine]\n        HC --> PL[Planner]\n        HC --> AC[ActionNormalizer / Committer]\n        HC --> TR[ToolRuntime]\n        TR --> QD[query_data 内部图]\n        TR --> AD[analyze_data]\n        TR --> BR[build_report]\n        HC --> FS[FinalizationService<br/>Ledger + reconcile]\n    end\n    HC --> EW[HarnessEventWriter<br/>事件流]\n    OLD --> EW\n    EW --> SSE[QueueEventSink → SSE + trace 落库]\n    subgraph 存储\n        PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>runs/checkpointer/会话)]\n        MY[(MySQL<br/>dw / meta)]\n        QD2[(Qdrant)]\n        ES[(Elasticsearch)]\n        N4[(Neo4j)]\n    end\n```\n\nHmm — mermaid subgraph with Chinese names ok. Note: `QD` and `QD2` — avoid confusion. Fine.\n\n**Diagram 2: 正常完成时序图 (sequenceDiagram)**\n\nParticipants: 用户/前端, API 路由, LoopController, ContextEngine, Planner, ToolRuntime, FinalizationService, 事件流/SSE\n\nSequence for normal run (from the audited code):\n1. 前端 → API: POST /harness/run (user question)\n2. API: 创建 turn + harness_runs 现场（iteration=0, deadline_at）→ run.started 事件\n3. LoopController._build_context: context.started → ContextEngine build（记忆/知识/证据）→ memory_retrieved/knowledge_retrieved/context_compiled → context.completed\n4. Planner: planner.started → LLM 产出 NextAction → planner.completed\n5. action.committed（normalizer + committer, action_seq 递增）\n6. ToolRuntime.execute: tool.started → query_data 内部图（桥接 tool.progress）→ tool.completed\n7. observation 记录 → iteration += 1\n8. 回到 3（第二轮 context...）\n9. Planner 决定 finish → _finalize: ledger: prepared → history_saved → checkpoint_saved → released → formation_submitted → completed；run.completed + run.result\n10. SSE 关闭\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant FE as 前端\n    participant API as harness 路由\n    participant LC as LoopController\n    participant CE as ContextEngine\n    participant PL as Planner\n    participant TR as ToolRuntime\n    participant FZ as Finalization\n    participant EV as 事件流(SSE+落库)\n\n    FE->>API: POST /run（问题）\n    API->>EV: run.started（iteration=0，deadline_at 落库）\n    loop 循环（最多 max_iterations）\n        API->>LC: start / 续跑\n        LC->>EV: context.started\n        LC->>CE: build(记忆/知识/证据)\n        CE-->>LC: CompiledContext\n        LC->>EV: memory_retrieved / knowledge_retrieved / context_compiled / context.completed\n        LC->>EV: planner.started\n        LC->>PL: 产出 NextAction\n        PL-->>LC: action（tool_call / ask_user / finish）\n        LC->>EV: planner.completed\n        LC->>EV: action.committed（action_seq 递增）\n        LC->>TR: execute（attempt、timeout 包装）\n        TR->>EV: tool.started\n        TR->>EV: tool.progress（query_data 内部图桥接）\n        TR-->>LC: ToolResult（不伪造结果）\n        TR->>EV: tool.completed\n        Note over LC: 记录观察 → iteration += 1\n    end\n    LC->>FZ