t (medium-thorough).\n2. Controller main path: start() → _run() happy path — every _emit call with line numbers and payloads, transitions, save_running_state points (very thorough).\n3. Finalization: _finalize + FinalizationService stages order with line numbers, what each stage does, failure handling; plus run.completed/run.result emission points.\n\nAnd 4: ContextEngine + Planner + ActionCommitter + ToolRuntime event emissions (context.* events, planner.* events, action.committed, tool.*) — where exactly emitted, payloads.\n\nActually agents 2 and 4 overlap. Let me structure:\n- Agent A: harness router + SSE pipeline (2.1 触发入口 + 6.2-adjacent facts)\n- Agent B: LoopController happy path with all _emit calls (start, _run, _build_context, planner phases) — file:line + payload for each event\n- Agent C: _finalize + FinalizationService ledger stages (2.5 收口方式)\n- Agent D: ToolRuntime + tools (tool.started/progress/completed emission points, writer.bind bridging) — needed for 2.2/2.4\n\nThat's 4 Explore agents in parallel. Then I write chapter 2 into the doc.\n\nAlso for the user's reading route, I should give them the \"主线\" reading order. Let me draft it:\n\n主线（路径一：正常完成）的阅读路线，与文档 2.x 章节一一对应：\n1. 入口：app/api/routers/harness.py — POST run 端点：请求模型 → run 现场创建（active_run 互斥）→ SSE 响应装配 → 后台任务启动 LoopController.start\n2. 主循环：app/agent/loop_controller/controller.py — start() → _run_guarded → _run()：读这段时对着 1.3 状态图，注意每轮循环\"重建上下文\"这个特点\n3. 上下文构建：_build_context → ContextEngine.build（app/agent/context_engine/...）\n4. 规划：_plan_action → planning_agent → ActionNormalizer/Committer（action_seq、fencing_token）\n5. 工具执行：_execute_tool → ToolRuntime.execute（runtime.py，writer.bind 桥接）\n6. 收口：_finalize（controller.py:1006）→ FinalizationService.finalize 固定顺序\n7. 前端消费：execution-panel.tsx（进度/步骤返回/全部事件三个 tab）\n\nAnd reading method suggestions: 每读完一步，在文档 2.2 事件序列里核对事件是否对得上（用「全部事件」tab 实跑一次对照）; 带着 1.3 状态图读 _run()；用 grep \"_emit(\" 把所有事件发点列出来当索引。\n\nNow — the doc writing. I'll launch the 4 agents, wait 