on.iteration` (L1124) | `status` (L1126, = `finalization.status.value` = `\"completed\"`), `final_answer` (L1127), `final_output_type` (L1128), `final_output_ref` (L1129), `error_code` (L1130-1134, = `None` when `finalization.last_error is None`) |\n\nThen `_finalize` returns `LoopRunResult` (L1050-1057) — the value `start()` ultimately returns.\n\nNot on the start()-happy path: `confirmation.resolved` emits (L145-151 idempotent, L159-165 accepted) are in `resume()` only; `confirmation.required` (L581-593) fires only in `_pause_for_confirmation` (ASK_USER / `NEEDS_USER` pause path); `context.failed` (L862-868), `planner.failed` (L762-772 PlannerFailure, L775-784 unexpected) are failure-only.\n\n---\n\n## 1. `_transition(...)` calls in `start()` and `_run()`\n\n- `start()`: **none** — it only builds state (`_new_state`, L121), calls `run_store.create` (L122), emits, and delegates to `_run_guarded` (L135). (Initial state: `phase=start_run`, `iteration=0` from `new_harness_control_state` defaults — state.py@55-56, built at controller.py@1087-1106.)\n- `_run()` — all set `status=HarnessStatus.RUNNING`:\n  - L336-338: `phase=LoopPhase.BUILD_CONTEXT`\n  - L343-345: `phase=LoopPhase.PLAN`\n  - L373-375: `phase=LoopPhase.VALIDATE_ACTION`\n  - L451-453: `phase=LoopPhase.EXECUTE_TOOL`\n  - L463-465: `phase=LoopPhase.HANDLE_TOOL_RESULT`\n  - L507-509: `phase=LoopPhase.RECORD_OBSERVATION`\n  - L521-523: `phase=LoopPhase.BUILD_CONTEXT` (loop rebuild)\n  - L528-530: `phase=LoopPhase.PLAN` (loop re-plan)\n- Adjacent on the COMPLETED path (outside `_run` proper): `_finalize` L1018-1023: `status=RUNNING, phase=LoopPhase.FINALIZATION, terminal_intent=\"completed\"` — the only transition carrying `terminal_intent`. Each transition bumps `state_version` by 1 (state.py@182). `_transition` itself: controller.py@1178-1192, delegating to `transition_harness_state` (state.py@149-186).\n\n## 2. `_save_running_state` call sites in `_run` + persistence\n\nCall sites (all `await self._save_running_state(command, state)`): **L339, L346, L376, L454, L466, L511, L524, L531**.\nDefinition: controller.py@1059-1066 — wraps **`self.run_store.save(command.run_ref, state)`** (the `HarnessRunStore.save` protocol method, contracts.py@187) in `self._await_with_deadline(...)`. Persists the entire validated `HarnessGraphState` (harness control dict + identity fields) as a JSON-safe checkpoint.\nNote: `_finalize` saves directly via `await self.run_store.save(command.run_ref, state)` at **L1024** (not through `_save_running_state`, hence not deadline-wrapped).\n\n## 3. `_planner_input` contents\n\nDefinition: controller.py@986-1004. Returns `PlannerInput` (contracts.py, state_result_store) with:\n- `compiled_context` (L989) — the `CompiledContext` from `_build_context`.\n- `state_view=PlannerStateView(...)` (L990-1002): `original_goal=harness[\"original_goal\"]` (L991), `iteration=harness[\"iteration\"]` (L992), `observations=[RunObservation.model_validate(v) for v in harness[\"observations\"]]` (L993-996), `last_error` = raw `harness[\"last_error\"]` dict or `None` (L997-1001).\n- `tool_specs=self.tool_specs` (L1003).\n\nControlled error feedback around `last_error`: set from tool result at L483-486 (and from planner failure at L611); cleared for `category == \"planner\"` after a successful plan at **L370-372** (`state[\"harness\"][\"last_error\"] = None`); `planner_retry_count` reset to 0 at **L369**. Rebuilt at L347 (first pass) and L532 (each subsequent pass), and inside the planner-retry branch at L358.\n\n## 4. `_build_context`\n\nDefinition: controller.py@844-942.\n- Rebuilds identity: `run_ref = self._run_ref_from_state(state)` (L845; `_run_ref_from_state` at L1165-1176).\n- Creates request: `self.context_request_factory.create(state, system_instructions=self.system_instructions, agent_type=\"data_agent\")` (L854-858).\n- **Engine call: `compiled_context = await self.context_builder.build(request)` (L859)** — `ContextBuilder` protocol method `build(request: ContextRequest) -> CompiledContext` (contracts.py@149-152).\n- Returns the `CompiledContext` (L942).\n- Storage: (a) local `compiled_context` in `_run` at L340-342 (first) and L525-527 (subsequent), later passed to `_planner_input` (L347/L532) and `_finalize` (L379/L423); (b) persisted into harness state: `state[\"harness\"][\"last_context_build_id\"] = compiled_context.build_id` (L870) and `state[\"harness\"][\"last_context_token_count\"] = compiled_context.token_count` (L871).\n\n## 5. `start()` return value for COMPLETED\n\n`start` returns `_run_guarded` → `_run` → `_finalize` result: **`LoopRunResult`** (contracts.py@89-107; `LoopResult = LoopRunResult | LoopPausedResult | LoopResumeAcceptedResult`, contracts.py@146). Constructed at controller.py@1050-1057 with fields:\n- `run_ref` = `command.run_ref`\n- `status` = `finalization.status` (= `HarnessStatus.COMPLETED`; validator enforces equality with `finalization_result.status`, contracts.py@105-106)\n- `phase` = `LoopPhase.FINALIZATION` (validator enforces this, contracts.py@101-102)\n- `iteration` = `finalization.iteration` (int ≥ 0)\n- `finalization_result` = `FinalizationResult` (contracts.py@66-86: `run_ref`, `status`, `final_answer`, `final_output_type`, `final_output_ref`, `iteration`, `last_error`)\n- `last_error` = `finalization.last_error` (`RunError | None`; `None` on COMPLETED happy path)\n\n`final_output_type`/`final_output_ref` for COMPLETED come from `_final_output(state)` (L1025-1029; method at L1068-1085 — walks `observations` in reverse for a `result_kind == \"report\"` ToolSpec with SUCCESS/PARTIAL status and a `result_ref`; falls back to `(\"text\", None)`).\n\n## 6. One-liners\n\n- **`_handle_planner_failure` retry emission** (controller.py@618-627): emits `planner.retrying` (`phase=PLAN`, `iteration=int(state[\"harness\"][\"iteration\"])`, `payload={\"retry_count\": harness[\"planner_retry_count\"] after increment, \"error_code\": failure.error.code}`) only when `failure.error.retryable and retry