tatus=idempotent)`，不重启循环（controller.py:144-158）。\n- decision=reject → `_finalize(CANCELLED)`，final_answer=\"用户拒绝了本次确认，任务已停止。\"（controller.py:173-180）——拒绝也是走 Ledger 的正式终态。\n\n### 3.4 收口方式\n\n暂停本身**不收口**：不走 Ledger、不发终态事件，现场以 `WAITING_CONFIRMATION` 落库。恢复链路：`resume()` → `_run_guarded` → `_run()` 无条件回到 BUILD_CONTEXT（controller.py:336-342）重建上下文再重新规划；用户答复已在 state 中，Planner 输入可见。恢复后 iteration 不变（不加 1），从同一轮次继续计数。\n\nWait — is that last claim true? On resume, _run rebuilds context with same iteration; iteration only increments after tool observation. If pause happened after ASK_USER (no tool executed this round), iteration unchanged. If pause via NEEDS_USER, also before iteration increment (pause at 487-506 before 510). So yes, resume continues with same iteration value — the round counter doesn't advance on pause. That's a nice precise fact: 暂停发生在 iteration 递增之前（两个分叉点都在 +1 之前），恢复后同一 iteration 重走本轮. Good, verifiable: ASK_USER pause at 429-445 occurs before iteration increment (510 happens only in RECORD_OBSERVATION). Correct.\n\n### 3.5 前端表现\n\n- 「等待用户确认」是 STEP_ORDER 里的固定步骤（step 分组），confirmation.required 到 confirmation.resolved 之间显示等待态（partial 语义在 statusForEvents 里由族配对处理）。\n- 恢复后 SSE 重新建立（/run/resume/stream），历史事件通过 execution-trace 接口回放补齐轮次分组；iteration 连续，轮次分组不受暂停打断。\n\nHmm — careful: on resume, does the frontend replay history? The resume stream is a NEW SSE connection; events from before pause came on the original stream. Whether the panel merges old events + new stream events — that's frontend behavior I know partially (toHistoricalStreamEvent exists for history replay). I shouldn't overclaim the merge mechanics. Keep it modest: 恢复后是新的 SSE 连接；先前事件经 execution-trace 历史回放补齐（toHistoricalStreamEvent）。轮次分组按 iteration 连续衔接。That's accurate per implementation discussed earlier.\n\n### 疑点清单\n\n- confirmation 24h 过期后（expires_at）由谁清理/收口？当前未见显式过期处理逻辑，待确认。\n\nThat's a genuine 疑点 — I haven't seen expiry handling. Good catch to register.\n\n§4 content — replace comments:\n\n### 4.1 failed：意外失败\n\n来源分两层：\n\n- **运行级未预期异常**：`_run_guarded` 兜底 except Exception → `_prepare_interruption_state` → `_finalize(FAILED)`（controller.py:232-246）。\n- **循环内判定的失败**（不靠异常，主动收口）：\n  - Planner 重试耗尽或不可重试（controller.py:354-366）\n  - 相同工具请求此前已失败（fencing，controller.py:397-404）\n  - 重复确认无法解决（ask_user 407-418 / NEEDS_USER 489-498）\n- 工具失败本身不直接收口：ToolResult 分类错误写入 `last_error`（controller.py:483-486），受控反馈给 Planner 重规划；只有规划层无法消化才走到上面两条。\n\n### 4.2 timeout：deadline / max_iterations\n\n三处来源：\n- `_check_deadline` 循环边界（controller.py:281-285）\n- `_await_with_deadline` 单个外部调用包装（287-303）——只把\"确实触及运行 deadline\"的 TimeoutError 转成 HarnessDeadlineExceeded，组件自身超时保持原语义（300-302 注释）\n- max_iterations 达到：RECORD_OBSERVATION 后检查（510-519），`_finalize(TIMEOUT)`，final_answer=\"任务达到最大工具迭代次数…\"\n前两者在 `_run_guarded` 捕获 HarnessDeadlineExceeded → `_prepare_interruption_state` → `_finalize(TIMEOUT)`（controller.py:191-204）。\n\n### 4.3 cancelled：客户端断开\n\nSSE body() 检测到断连 cancel task 并 shield（harness.py:561-569）→ 控制器 asyncio.CancelledError 分支：`_prepare_interruption_state` → 收口任务 `create_task(_finalize(CANCELLED))` + `asyncio.shield`（controller.py:205-227）——请求已无法返回结果时，收口任务由 done callback 兜底消费（248-254），保证落库完成。\n\n### 4.4 共同点与前端表现\n\n三条路径共用 `_prepare_interruption_state`（controller.py:305-327）：\n- 从**最后已持久化版本**重载现场（313-319），内存态不参与收口\n- 若现场停在 WAITING_CONFIRMATION，先翻回 RUNNING/RESTORE_RUN（320-325）再写中断错误\n- `_set_interruption_error` 把 category/code/message 写进 `last_error`（256-267）\n\n之后全部经 `_finalize` 走完 Ledger 六 stage（与正常完成唯一的区别是 terminal_status 与 formation_submitted 只在 COMPLETED 提交，service.py:121-128），终态事件由 `_emit_terminal` 按 status 映射 run.failed / run.timeout / run.cancelled（controller.py:1114-1119）。\n\n前端 partial 语义：statusForEvents 检测到 run.cancelled / run.timeout / run.failed 即判 interrupted，未走完的分组显示\"中断\"，已完成项保留成功态。\n\n例外：`FinalizationFailure` 不在此列——不降级、留给 reconcile（controller.py:228-231），前端表现为 run 一直没有终态事件，直到 reconcile 完成后才收到终态。\n\n### 疑点清单\n\n- FAILED 收口时如果 ledger 从未 prepared（如 _finalize 之前就崩）——账本缺失时 checkpoint_saved 之前失败的行为值得实测确认（reconcile 依赖 input_payload，此时无行可依）。\n\nHmm — is that accurate? If FinalizationFailure occurs, a ledger row exists (prepared happened). If the exception happens BEFORE finalize is called... _run_guarded catches Exception around _run; if crash occurs mid-loop, _prepare_interruption_state → _finalize(FAILED) → prepare ledger → proceeds. So ledger always gets prepared on any finalize. The 疑点 would be: if _finalize itself fails at prepared stage → run stuck running/finalization, no ledger row → reconcile raises FinalizationLedgerError. API handler at 412-420 refuses to fabricate FAILED if ledger row exists — but if no row? Then... _require? Actually agent D said: \"The unhandled-failure cleanup path refuses to fabricate a FAILED terminal if a ledger row exists (result ownership is locked): harness.py:412-420\". So if no row exists, maybe it fabricates? Unclear. That's a legit 疑点: \"收口失败且账本行不存在（prepared 都没成功）时的清理路径行为待确认（harness.py:412-420 只在有账本行时拒绝伪造 FAILED）\".\n\nLet me phrase: 疑点：收口在 prepared 之前就失败（账本行不存在）时，harness.py:412-420 的清理路径行为待实测——该段仅在账本行存在时拒绝伪造 FAILED。\n\nOK. Both chapters ready. Let me make the two Edits now. Need exact old_strings from the current file. §3 old text (lines 192-212 of original read; 3.1 comment was updated by me earlier so use the new version I wrote):\n\nCurrent §3:\n```\n### 3.1 与主干的分叉点\n\n<!-- 两个分叉点：① Planner 产出 ask_user 动作（提交后暂停，controller.py:429-445）；② 工具返回 NEEDS_USER（观察记录前暂停，controller.py:487-506）。→ confirmation.required → LoopPausedResult，HTTP 响应结束但 run 存活。 -->\n\n### 3.2 事件序列差异\n\n<!-- confirmation.required payload / 用户提交确认 → confirmation.resolved -->\n\n### 3.3 恢复的身份约束\n\n<!-- 同一 run_id/turn_id/thread_id；resume 不能新建 thread 或覆盖旧现场（对应 todolist review 项 4） -->\n\n### 3.4 收口方式\n\n<!-- 不收口。恢复链路：resume() → _run_guarded → _run() 无条件回到 BUILD_CONTEXT（controller.py:336-342），重建上下文 + 重新规划；用户答复已消费写入 state，Planner 可见。确认幂等重放时仅补发 confirmation.resolved(status=idempotent)，不重启循环（controller.py:144-158）。 -->\n\n### 3.5 前端表现\n\n### 疑点清单\n\n