t only until refresh. Meh.\n\n**B. Frontend: fetch the artifact by final_output_ref on run.completed** — new API call to read the artifact content (is there an endpoint? artifacts API? I don't recall a public artifact read endpoint; there's the execution-trace endpoint and turn outputs via sessions API). Heavier; new endpoint maybe needed. Out of scope for a quick fix.\n\n**C. Backend: include the final report content in run.completed/run.result payload.** run.result already carries loop_result with final_answer etc. The report content lives in the artifact; _final_output reads it during history_saved. Could the terminal event include the output payload? That changes the event payload contract (bigger payload, but bounded). This makes real-time rendering work immediately. But it duplicates report content into the event stream (trace persistence also stores it — trace payload sanitization drops large keys? _sanitize drops \"result\", \"rows\", etc. — \"sections\" not dropped; a full report in every trace... acceptable? It's one event per run).\n\nActually — wait. Let me check whether after run completion the frontend refetches history. Look around line 1080-1110 and the end of the stream handler for a refetch (e.g., onSessionRefresh / mutate / fetchTurns). If there's already a refetch, fix A is clean and the report appears right after completion. Let me search for a refresh call after terminal event.","startTime":1791428023748,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023748},{"id":"eece9740-7661-4345-8f5c-17c74ac88fe3","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"抓到了。实时路径在 `run.completed` 时（chat-session-view.tsx:1073-1079）把 **`{ message: assistantText }`** 这个占位对象直接塞给了 `buildConversationMeta`，而 `final_output_type` 是 `rendered_report` → 被强转成报告 → `sections` 不存在 → 崩溃。报告内容此时只在 artifact 里，事件流里根本没有。确认一下跑完后前端会不会重新拉历史："},{"id":"call_28c9feb97426452ea7a28c63","type":"TOOL","toolName":"grep_content","params":{"-n":"true","output_mode":"content","path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analy