here = StreamEvent.source = HarnessEvent.source = context.source + \":\" + node = f\"{context.get('source', 'tool')}:{node}\". The screenshot node = \"analyze_data:plan_analysis\" → context.source = \"analyze_data\". Hmm interesting — so during graph execution the writer is bound with source = current graph node (\"analyze_data\" is the graph node that runs plan_analysis internally?). Whatever — action_id: probably not bound during graph-node execution (no action yet) → payload.action_id undefined... or it IS bound if this happens inside an action. Either way, source exists → scope stable. Fine.\n\nNew scope with custom_type bucket:\n\n```ts\nfunction progressScope(event: DebugEvent) {\n  // 思考/正文流式片段各自聚合，普通进度单独一条，保证合并后仍能按语义展示。\n  const kind = event.payload.custom_type === \"reasoning_chunk\" || event.payload.custom_type === \"llm_chunk\"\n    ? String(event.payload.custom_type)\n    : \"progress\";\n  return \"tool.progress::\" + kind + \"::\" + String(event.payload.action_id || event.payload.source || event.node) + \"::\" + String(event.payload.phase || event.step || \"\");\n}\n```\n\nHmm wait — but hold on. Do I actually want the scope change in compactAllEvents (affecting 全部事件 tab), or should the split apply only in 步骤返回? Let me re-read the user's messages once more:\n\n1. \"方案a\" — approved: merge same-node progress into one 「执行进度 ×N」, details show..., 全部事件 tab keeps full data, no backend change.\n2. \"感觉应该是思考过程，没有一口气返回，但是也可融入思考过程\" — refinement: these are the thinking process arriving piecemeal; they can be merged into the 思考过程 presentation.\n\nI read message 2 as overriding the label: the merged item should be presented as 思考过程 (not merely 工具执行进度 ×N). Applying the custom_type-aware scope in compactAllEvents gives:\n- 步骤返回: node shows 思考过程（173 个片段）+ 模型输出（M 个片段）+ 工具执行进度 — exactly the \"融入思考过程\" presentation.\n- 全部事件: same split — consistent, and arguably better. Data preserved.\n\nI'll go with the unified change. It keeps ONE compaction machinery (优雅, no duplicate).\n\nEdge: what if a tool emits genuine multi-step progress events (custom_type \"progress\" × many, e.g. long SQL execution with per-step progress)? They merge into one 工具执行进度（N 条内部事件）— unchanged from today. Good.\n\nNow implement:\n\n**Edit 1 — compactAllEvents scope**: add custom_type bucket to tool.progress scope.\n\nCurrent lines 460-465:\n```ts\n    const scope = isToolProgress\n      ? \"tool.progress::\"\n        + String(event.payload.action_id || event.payload.source || event.node)\n        + \"::\"\n        + String(event.payload.phase || event.step || \"\")\n      : streamScope(event);\n```\n\nReplace with:\n```ts\n    const scope = isToolProgress\n      ? \"tool.progress::\"\n        + progressKind(event)\n        + \"::\"\n        + String(event.payload.action_id || event.payload.source || event.node)\n        + \"::\"\n        + String(event.payload.phase || event.step || \"\")\n      : streamScope(event);\n```\n\nwith helper:\n```ts\n/** 工具进度内的 LLM 流式片段按思考/正文分桶聚合，普通进度单独合并。 */\nfunction progressKind(event: DebugEvent) {\n  return event.payload.custom_type === \"reasoning_chunk\" || event.payload.custom_type === \"llm_chunk\"\n    ? String(event.payload.custom_type)\n    : \"progress\";\n}\n```\n\n**Edit 2 — displayLabel tool.progress** (:391-396):\n```ts\n  if (event.type === \"tool.progress\") {\n    const count = typeof event.payload.compacted_count === \"number\"\n      ? event.payload.compacted_count\n      : 1;\n    const customType = typeof event.payload.custom_type === \"string\" ? event.payload.custom_type : \"\";\n    if (customType === \"reasoning_chunk\") return (count > 1 ? \"思考过程（\" + count + \" 个片段）\" : \"思考过程片段\") + phase;\n    if (customType === \"llm_chunk\") return (count > 1 ? \"模型输出（\" + count + \" 个片段）\" : \"模型输出片段\") + phase;\n    return count > 1 ? \"工具执行进度（\" + count + \" 条内部事件）\" : \"工具执行进度\";\n  }\n```\n\n**Edit 3 — nodeGroups** (:517-526):\n```ts\nfunction nodeGroups(events: DebugEvent[], fallback?: RunStatus, runCompleted = false): NodeGroup[] {\n  const grouped = new Map<string, DebugEvent[]>();\n  for (const event of events) grouped.set(event.node, [...(grouped.get(event.node) || []), event]);\n  return Array.from(grouped.entries()).map(([node, nodeEvents]) => ({\n    node,\n    status: statusForEvents(nodeEvents, fallback, runCompleted),\n    latest: nodeEvents[nodeEvents.length - 1],\n    // 与「全部事件」同源压缩：流式片段/工具进度在节点内合并，避免逐 chunk 刷屏。\n    events: displayEvents(compactAllEvents(nodeEvents)),\n  })).sort((left, right) => eventOrder(left.latest) - eventOrder(right.latest));\n}\n```\n\nWait — ordering issue: compactAllEvents preserves input order (merged items take position of first event in their scope). nodeEvents are in events-array order (append order = sequence order). Within a node, e.g. plan_analysis: [tool.started?, progress, chunks×173, tool.completed]. After compaction: [tool.started, 工具执行进度(1), 思考过程(173), 模型输出(M), tool.completed]. Order sensible. \n\nHmm wait — actually is tool.started in the same node group? tool.started's node: moduleNode → tool.* → tool_name ?? source. HarnessEvent for tool.started: source = \"harness\"? tool.started is emitted by ToolRuntime with source... The screenshot showed the node group \"analyze_data:plan_analysis\" containing progress items; tool.started may be in node \"analyze_data\" (different group). Doesn't matter.\n\nOne more consideration — `displayEvents(compactAllEvents(nodeEvents))`: displayEvents' hasNonProgress check: `events.some((event) => event.type !== \"progress\")` — hides type \"progress\" events. Merged tool.progress isn't affected. OK.\n\nAlso — the ProgressView \"进度\" tab step summary shows `step.latest.payload.message` — for 执行工具 step, latest is the last llm_chunk (no message) → shows nothing. Unchanged behavior.\n\nNow — double-check no OTHER caller of compactAllEvents breaks with the scope change: only ExecutionPanel :755 (全部事件 tab). The change splits merged 工具执行进度 items there into buckets — intended.\n\nHmm, wait — one more: are there tool.progress events whose payload lacks custom_type? writer.custom always sets custom_type (pops type, default \"progress\"). Old data / history from execution-trace: same bridge → has custom_type. toHistoricalStreamEvent flattens payload too. OK.\n\nNow, let me also think — should the merged 思考过程 item ALSO appear when reasoning_result exists? displayEvents hides reasoning_chunk (raw type) when reasoning_result present — but merged tool.progress with custom_type reasoning_chunk is type tool.progress → NOT hidden. For nodes that emit both (e.g. generate_sql emits reasoning_chunk via bridge AND a reasoning_result?) — both would show: 思考过程（N 片段） + 思考过程（result）. Slight duplication. Does that happen? reasoning_result/llm_result events — where are they emitted? Let me grep backend for \"reasoning_result\". If they're emitted by the same nodes, dedup might be desirable... but displayEvents already has the vocabulary; the hiding rule is type-based. Keep as-is — minimal. Actually wait, let me check quickly whether reasoning_result exists in backend.","startTime":1791428023748,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023748},{"id":"1231a30b-24a3-48be-b3a6-4746fe68a104","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"Now I have the full picture. Let me check whether `reasoning_result`/`llm_result` exist as real backend event types (they affect dedup interplay in `displayEvents`):"},{"id":"call_33bc1512b9cf4056aac64448","type":"TOOL","toolName":"grep_content","params":{"-n":"true","output_mode":"content","path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app","pattern":"reasoning_result|llm_result|reasoning_chunk|llm_chunk"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Found 24 matches\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/services/agent_service.py:\n  Line 509:             stream_types = {\"reasoning_chunk\", \"llm_chunk\"}\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/filter_table.py:\n  Line 55:             \"type\": \"llm_res