ess: I'm adding the kind bucket. Let me also double check the 全部事件 badge count changes: compactedEvents.length grows slightly (split items) — fine.\n\nNow write the edits.\n\nEdit 1 — displayLabel tool.progress block (:391-396):\n\nOld:\n```ts\n  if (event.type === \"tool.progress\") {\n    const count = typeof event.payload.compacted_count === \"number\"\n      ? event.payload.compacted_count\n      : 1;\n    return count > 1 ? `工具执行进度（${count} 条内部事件）` : \"工具执行进度\";\n  }\n```\n\nNew:\n```ts\n  if (event.type === \"tool.progress\") {\n    const count = typeof event.payload.compacted_count === \"number\"\n      ? event.payload.compacted_count\n      : 1;\n    // custom_type 是 writer.custom 归一化前的原始事件类型；思考/正文流式片段按原语义命名。\n    const customType = typeof event.payload.custom_type === \"string\" ? event.payload.custom_type : \"\";\n    if (customType === \"reasoning_chunk\" || customType === \"reasoning_result\") {\n      return (count > 1 ? `思考过程（${count} 个片段）` : \"思考过程\") + phase;\n    }\n    if (customType === \"llm_chunk\" || customType === \"llm_result\") {\n      return (count > 1 ? `模型输出（${count} 个片段）` : \"模型输出\") + phase;\n    }\n    return count > 1 ? `工具执行进度（${count} 条内部事件）` : \"工具执行进度\";\n  }\n```\n\nEdit 2 — itemStatus (:272-286):\n\nOld:\n```ts\nfunction itemStatus(event: DebugEvent, siblings: DebugEvent[]): RunStatus | undefined {\n  if (event.status) return event.status;\n  if (event.type === \"error\" || event.type.endsWith(\".failed\") || event.type === \"run.timeout\" || event.type === \"run.cancelled\") return \"failed\";\n  const derived = statusFromEventType(event.type);\n  if (derived === \"running\") {\n    // 同族生命周期在其之后出现终态事件时，started/进度标记按已完成展示，避免运行结束后仍显示执行中。\n    const family = event.type.split(\".\")[0];\n    const concluded = siblings.some(\n      (item) => item.sequence > event.sequence\n        && (item.type === `${family}.completed` || item.type === `${family}.failed` || item.type === `${family}.resolved`),\n    );\n    if (concluded) return \"success\";\n  }\n  return derived;\n}\n```\n\nNew:\n```ts\nfunction itemStatus(event: DebugEvent, siblings: DebugEvent[]): RunStatus | undefined {\n  if (event.status && event.status !== \"running\") return event.status;\n  if (event.type === \"error\" || event.type.endsWith(\".failed\") || event.type === \"run.timeout\" || event.type === \"run.cancelled\") return \"failed\";\n  // 显式 running 不能短路同族终态判断：进度标记在工具完成后应随同族事件收敛。\n  const derived = statusFromEventType(event.type) ?? (event.status === \"running\" ? \"running\" : undefined);\n  if (derived === \"running\") {\n    // 同族生命周期在其之后出现终态事件时，started/进度标记按已完成展示，避免运行结束后仍显示执行中。\n    const family = event.type.split(\".\")[0];\n    const concluded = siblings.some(\n      (item) => item.sequence > event.sequence\n        && (item.type === `${family}.completed` || item.type === `${family}.failed` || item.type === `${family}.resolved`),\n    );\n    if (concluded) return \"success\";\n  }\n  return derived;\n}\n```\n\nHmm wait — careful with `derived = statusFromEventType(event.type) ?? (running→running)`. For tool.progress, statusFromEventType returns \"running\" already. For an event with explicit running but NO type rule (e.g. analysis_task_phase... wait does analysis_task_phase carry explicit status \"running\"? Let me check execute_analysis emission... line 341 area emits reasoning_chunk; the phase events: earlier summary said analysis_task_phase events exist. Do they include \"status\":\"running\"? Uncertain. Either way behavior preserved or improved.) \n\nHmm — wait, actually there's a subtle regression risk: an event with explicit status \"running\" whose family HAS a later completed event but SHOULD still show running? Can't think of one — family completed ⇒ that stage is done. OK.\n\nActually hmm, hold on. Let me reconsider — do I really want to touch itemStatus? Let me re-examine: is the stuck spinner actually real? The initial progress event (custom_type \"progress\", payload.status \"running\"): in the merged 