三条结果标记被挤进了「普通进度」桶——标签取了桶里第一个事件的类型（所以叫思考过程），绿色来自 `analysis_plan` 的 success。纯错位。\n- **前两条一直转圈**：片段桶里没有终态事件（结果标记被分走了），节点整体是 success 但单项永远 running。\n\n## 现在的行为\n\n以 plan_analysis 为例，169 条事件聚合后节点展开只剩：\n\n```\n✓ 思考过程    ← 136 条思考片段 + reasoning_result 合并，展开看完整思考文本\n✓ 模型输出    ← 30 条正文片段 + llm_result 合并，展开看完整正文\n```\n\n具体改动（都在 [`execution-panel.tsx`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx)）：\n\n1. **分桶改成「流族」**：`reasoning_chunk + reasoning_result` 一桶、`llm_chunk + llm_result` 一桶——结果事件就是这条流的终点，并进去而不是单独一条。\n2. **结果事件到达即置 success**：流式输出中转圈（实时语义正确），结果一到变绿，不再永远转圈。\n3. **标签只叫 思考过程 / 模型输出**：去掉「N 个片段」计数和「· execute_tool」内部 phase；普通进度仍保留「工具执行进度（N 条内部事件）」计数（多步工具如 SQL 执行需要）。\n4. **裸进度标记隐藏**：节点内已有思考/正文流时，那条只有「已开始」含义的 progress 标记直接不显示——「全部事件」tab 仍保留全量，数据无损。\n\n顺带受益的还有 `filter_metric`/`filter_table` 这类只发 `llm_result` 的节点：以前显示成莫名的「工具执行进度」，现在正确显示为「模型输出」且直接是绿的。\n\n`tsc` 验证通过（仍只有 4 个存量错误），刷新页面重新问一轮就能看到效果。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789643060793},{"id":"57809d9f-7046-4a9e-9e5a-cd431bd6552f","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"还有一点，我决定，如果执行过程之后不对用户开放，聊天内容有点太单调了，用户可能认为任务一直没有执行，你看能加一下什么更丰富一点吗？先给我方案","payload":{"query":"还有一点，我决定，如果执行过程之后不对用户开放，聊天内容有点太单调了，用户可能认为任务一直没有执行，你看能加一下什么更丰富一点吗？先给我方案","rawMessage":"还有一点，我决定，如果执行过程之后不对用户开放，聊天内容有点太单调了，用户可能认为任务一直没有执行，你看能加一下什么更丰富一点吗？先给我方案","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"app/agent/nodes/plan_analysis.py","name":"plan_analysis.py","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"5c7c1eeb-0fb8-4ef5-bdce-9f5306eb67df","requestedAt":1789643171628,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"57809d9f-7046-4a9e-9e5a-cd431bd6552f"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"bcc9ce000688653c6d7465fa24c98828a8335cc1","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]},"taskReminderInjected":true},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1789643171643},{"id":"24a4cb21-5121-4f67-b4ca-5972bb7ea2d8","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"57809d9f-7046-4a9e-9e5a-cd431bd6552f","reportedId":"5141e8e3-f1ef-418f-9953-132123107554","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Comate"},"role":"assistant","status":"cancelled","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":56.95,"contextUsed":145789,"contextLimit":256000,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"performanceMetrics":{"firstTokenLatency":865,"totalDuration":770372},"appliedRuleNames":[],"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"6aabc9a41ca25a5d690591a1","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":33949},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"4ad275db-8987-428e-83e9-a0b4a8509713","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"The user is now looking at plan_analysis.py and asks: \"还有一点，我决定，如果执行过程之后不对用户开放，聊天内容有点太单调了，用户可能认为任务一直没有执行，你看能加一下什么更丰富一点吗？先给我方案\"\n\nTranslation: \"One more thing — I've decided that if the execution process won't be exposed to the user (i.e., the execution panel is not user-facing / they decided NOT to show the execution process to end users), the chat content is a bit too plain/dull. Users might think the task isn't executing. Can you add something to make it richer? Give me a plan first.\"\n\nSo the context: the execution panel (执行过程 side panel) is a developer/debug view. For end users, the chat is just: user asks question → long silence (could be 30s-2min of context building + LLM streaming + SQL execution + analysis + report) → final answer. During that time the chat shows nothing (or just a typing indicator), so users think nothing is happening.\n\nThe user wants a PLAN first (先给我方案), not implementation. So I should present options/方案 for enriching the chat during execution.\n\nLet me think about what the existing infrastructure offers:\n\n1. **The SSE stream already carries rich progress events**: context.started/memory_retrieved/knowledge_retrieved/context_compiled/completed, planner.started/completed, action.committed, tool.started/tool.progress/tool.completed, confirmation.required, analysis_task_phase, analysis_task_result, run.completed/run.result. The frontend already consumes these into debugEvents. So the chat view can render a lightweight progress timeline from the SAME events without backend changes.\n\n2. **The thinking process (reasoning) is already streamed**: reasoning_chunk/llm_chunk events (via tool.progress with custom_type) — the chat could show a collapsible \"思考中...\" bubble with live streaming reasoning text — like DeepSeek-R1 style. This is probably the richest, most engaging option and requires zero backend change.\n\n3. Existing chat UI: chat-session-view.tsx — during running, is there any indicator? Probably a loading dot or \"正在思考\" placeholder. There might already be some streaming of assistant text? The final answer arrives at run.completed (text answer). Actually — does the chat show streaming answer text? run.result has final output. The rendered_report path shows the report. For daily chat, the answer text arrives only at completion.\n\nSo options for the 方案:\n\n**方案 A — 聊天内轻量进度时间线（步骤级）**: While running, show a status line/bubble under the user's question that updates through the stages: 正在理解问题 → 已召回知识 → 正在划分任务 → 正在执行分析（任务 1/3）→ 正在生成报告. Derived from existing SSE events, no backend change. Small, elegant, low risk. Auto-collapses into a \"已完成 · 用时 Xs\" summary line when done.\n\n**方案 B — 思考过程实时流（R1 风格）**: collapsible \"深度思考中\" bubble streaming reasoning text live (reasoning_chunk already streams). Richest content, makes it obvious the AI is working. Slightly more UI work; reasoning text can be long — need max-height scroll/collapse.\n\n**方案 C — 任务卡片进度**: For analysis tasks (analysis_plan events carry tasks with question/purpose/depends_on), render a mini task list with per-task status (pending/running/success) updated by analysis_task_phase/analysis_task_result events. Very informative for multi-task analyses.\n\n**方案 D — 阶段进度条/轮播文案**: simplest — a spinner with rotating stage text (从事件推导当前阶段). Minimal.\n\nRecommendation: A + C combined (timeline with task progress), plus optionally B as collapsible. Actually — what fits \"聊天不单调 + 用户知道在执行\"? I'd recommend 方案 A（主线时间线）+ 方案 C（任务清单）as the core, both derived from existing events with zero backend change; B (streaming thinking) as an optional add-on since data already streams.\n\nKey design considerations:\n- History: after loadConversation refetch, these interim bubbles disappear (history only stores final messages) — need to decide: keep transient (disappear after completion, replaced by final answer + maybe a compact \"执行过程\" summary chip) or persist. Simplest: transient during run; on completion collapse to a small muted line like \"已完成 · 5 个步骤 · 用时 48s\" that stays in that message bubble. Persistence in DB would require backend changes (storing progress snapshots in message metadata) — could be phase 2.\n- Confirmation pause: when confirmation.required arrives, chat should show \"等待确认\" with the confirmation card (already exists? there's a confirmation flow in the UI — need to check).\n- Failure: run.failed → show error state.\n\nThe user said \"先给我方案\" — so present the plan, ask which to implement. Use AskUserQuestion? The user explicitly asked for a plan first. I could present options in text and let them choose, or use AskUserQuestion with the options. Given the interface guidance (AskUserQuestion for structured choices), presenting 2-4 options with a recommendation via AskUserQuestion seems right. But the user might want to read a fuller plan. I think: give a concise written plan with options + my recommendation, then ask which combination to implement via AskUserQuestion.\n\nLet me check what the chat currently shows during execution to ground the plan. Let me look at chat-session-view.tsx around the running indicator and how messages render during a run. Let me grep for \"running\" / loading UI in the chat view and the message rendering area.\n\nActually, to keep it efficient: I'll do a quick grep to see what the chat shows while running (is there a \"思考中\" indicator already?), and whether reasoning_chunk data is accessible at the chat-session-view level (debugEvents state is there — yes, line 762 debugEvents state). Also check what happens with confirmation.\n\nLet me do a quick targeted exploration, then write the plan.\n\nKey facts I need:\n1. What does the chat show during a running turn currently? (search for loading/typing indicator in chat-session-view)\n2. Is there an existing stage/phase text?\n\nLet me grep quickly.","startTime":1791428023748,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023748},{"id":"cacaf2be-d031-4a3b-bf0f-c8759829fc0f","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"先快速确认一下现在聊天区在执行期间到底显示了什么，再给方案："},{"id":"call_0cc9e260407249ad850fed27","type":"TOOL","toolName":"grep_content","params":{"-n":"true","output_mode":"content","path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx","pattern":"正在|思考中|running &&|isRunning|\\{running|执行中|typing"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":{"$blob":"sha256:64dd4eb1265a04dbb2f88160dd7c87bcc0c8fc4ed21a12175b0a593cbcbbd0da","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":4245,"compression":"none"},"metadata":{"pattern":"正在|思考中|running &&|isRunning|\\{running|执行中|typing","relevantFiles":[{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx","startLine":104,"endLine":104},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx","startLine":547,"endLine":547},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/