iredToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"c0ec456f-820a-48cf-a8ea-ee218f96f95f","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"Now I understand the current chat UX during a run:\n- User sends question → user bubble appears, and an assistant message is appended (placeholder — let me check what text). Let me look at the send handler quickly (around :854-960) to see what assistant placeholder is added.\n\nActually I have enough context — during a run the assistant bubble likely shows a static placeholder like \"正在分析…\" with a streaming cursor (showStreamingCursor). The whole wait (30s~2min) shows one static bubble. That's the \"单调\" problem.\n\nThe user's decision: 执行过程之后不对用户开放 — the execution panel won't be exposed to end users (it stays as a dev tool). So the chat itself must convey progress.\n\nNow design options (方案) for enriching the chat during execution. All can be derived from the existing SSE/debugEvents state — zero backend changes:\n\n**方案 A — 执行状态时间线（推荐核心）**\nDuring the run, under/inside the assistant bubble, render a compact live status list derived from debugEvents: \n- 正在理解问题（构建上下文）\n- 已召回知识/字段\n- 正在划分分析任务\n- 正在执行分析（含每个任务的 running phase，如 生成 SQL → 执行 SQL）\n- 正在汇总生成报告\nEach line flips from spinner to ✓ as events arrive. On completion, collapse to a single muted summary chip: \"已完成 · 4 个步骤 · 用时 52 秒\"(可点开? or just static). On failure, show the failed step.\n- Only transient UI during run; after completion, collapses into a small line above the final answer. History refetch unaffected (no DB change).\n\n**方案 B — 实时思考流（DeepSeek-R1 风格）**\nA collapsible \"深度思考中…\" section inside the assistant bubble that streams the reasoning text live (reasoning_chunk chunks — already streaming via SSE into debugEvents; just concatenate). When llm_result/reasoning_result arrives → collapse, label \"已深度思考（用时 X 秒 · 展开看思考过程）\". \n- Richest \"AI is working\" feeling; zero backend change.\n- Caveat: multiple nodes each have their own reasoning stream (plan_analysis, generate_sql, execute_analysis, generate_report_plan) — need to show the CURRENT node's stream, or concat per node with separators.\n\n**方案 C — 分析任务清单卡片**\nWhen analysis_plan arrives (tasks with question/purpose/depends_on), render a task checklist card: each task with status icon updated by analysis_task_phase (running phase text like 生成 SQL) / analysis_task_result. Very concrete \"it's working on 3 things\" evidence. On completion the card stays (data available from... hmm — transient during run; after refetch the final answer includes the report; the task card would disappear unless persisted).\n\n**方案 D — 最小方案：动态阶段文案 + 计时器**\nJust upgrade the static placeholder to a rotating status line: \"正在分析您的问题…（已执行 35 秒）\" with stage text derived from latest event. Minimal effort.\n\nMy recommendation: A + C combined (timeline becomes richer once tasks exist), B as optional add-on. Actually B is the most \"chat-like\" and engaging; A+C is more structured. Since the user's concern is \"用户可能认为任务一直没有执行\" — visible progress is the cure. A+C gives structure; B gives life.\n\nPhasing: \n- 第一期（纯前端，一次改动）：A + C + D 的计时器（都是 debugEvents 派生，一个新组件 ChatProgressCard，挂在 assistant bubble 内，仅在 isRunning 或刚完成时显示）。\n- 可选加 B（思考流）。\n- 后续（可选，动后端）：把步骤摘要写入 message meta 持久化，历史消息也保留\"执行摘要\"行。\n\nPresentation: give the plan in text with a small mockup, then AskUserQuestion to pick scope: (1) A+C 时间线+任务清单 (推荐), (2) A+C+B 含思考流, (3) D 最小文案, (4) 先只做 B 思考流. Also ask whether completed state should collapse to a summary chip or disappear entirely? That's a detail I can decide (collapse to chip, since disappearing keeps chat clean but chip gives reassurance... actually after the answer arrives, the progress is redundant — the report/answer IS the outcome. But a small \"用时 52 秒 · 查看执行过程\" chip is nice. Keep: collapse to one muted line with elapsed time + 查看执行过程 entry).\n\nOne more consideration — where does the progress UI live? Inside the last assistant bubble (the placeholder). The placeholder message: let me check what text it has at send. In onNew/send handler — the assistant placeholder message is appended with some content like \"正在分析...\" Let me quickly grep for what placeholder text is used at :900ish. I saw at :1215/:1233 \"正在根据你的确认继续处理...\" for confirmations. For normal send — let me check quickly. Actually — the exact placeholder text matters for the plan (we'd replace/augment it). Quick grep for the send append.","startTime":1791428023748,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023748},{"id":"call_be9a0ad7ddbc48d3961ea125","type":"TOOL","toolName":"grep_content","params":{"-n":"true","output_mode":"content","path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx","pattern":"role: \"assistant\"|正在分析|正在处理|status: \\{ type: \"running\""},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Found 5 matches\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx:\n  Line 865:         role: \"assistant\",\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx:\n  Line 868:         status: { type: \"running\" },\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx:\n  Line 1216:                 status: { type: \"running\" },\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx:\n  Line 1225:             role: \"assistant\",\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx:\n  Line 1228:             status: { type: \"running\" },","metadata":{"pattern":"role: \"assistant\"|正在分析|正在处理|status: \\{ type: \"running\"","relevantFiles":[{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx","startLine":865,"endLine":865},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-age