Tasks`, `progressKind`, `type TaskSummary`.\n\nHmm — actually also need a status helper: task status comes in TaskSummary.status already (RunStatus). And terminal check for tasks — TaskSummary.status is RunStatus. In chat file define local `terminal()` (3 lines) or export. Local tiny helper fine.\n\n**Component design details**:\n\n```tsx\ninterface RunStage {\n  key: string;\n  label: string;\n  status: RunStatus;\n  detail?: string;\n  kind?: \"tasks\";   // renders task checklist under this stage\n}\n```\n\nStage derivation function `deriveRunStages(events, tasks)`:\n\n```ts\nconst has = (pred) => events.some(pred);\n// helper: latest event by sequence\n```\n\nStage 1 理解问题并召回上下文: present if any context.* or type question_route. status: failed if context.failed; success if context.completed || later stages present; running otherwise.\n  - \"later stages present\" — simpler: success if context.completed exists; running if not. If stream ends without it... edge, fine.\nStage 2 划分分析任务: present if planner.* or analysis_plan. success if planner.completed or analysis_plan(success); failed if planner.failed or analysis_plan(failed); else running. detail: tasks.length ? `${tasks.length} 个任务` : undefined.\nStage 3 执行: present if action.committed or tool.started/tool.progress/tool.completed or tasks non-empty. \n  - If tasks.length: label 执行分析任务; doneCount = tasks.filter(terminal).length; detail: running → `已完成 ${doneCount}/${tasks.length}`; success when doneCount === tasks.length; failed if any task failed and none running... reuse aggregateTaskStatus? That's panel-internal too. Local: status = tasks.every(terminal) ? (any failed ? partial/failed... hmm aggregate: all success → success; mixed → partial; any failed → failed). Small local function.\n  - else: label 执行数据查询; success if tool.completed present (and no later tool.started); running if tool.started/progress; failed if tool.failed.\n  - confirmation.required present && !resolved → status partial, detail 等待你确认. Hmm —