aceholder. Let me read :1190-1300 before writing.\n\nAlso `displayLabel`... not needed here.\n\nLet me also double check `getDisplayMessageText` exists (used at :639) ✓.\n\nOne more design point — the timeline visual: compact, chat-appropriate:\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"space-y-1.5\">\n  {/* thinking sections first */}\n  {/* stages */}\n  <div className=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n    <StatusIcon/>\n    <div>\n      <div className=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600\">{label}{detail && <span className=\"text-slate-400\"> · {detail}</span>}</div>\n      {kind === \"tasks\" && <task list/>}\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\nWith a live header: 「正在执行 · 35s」pulsing. Hmm — timer: put in ChatRunTimeline: \n```tsx\nconst [now, setNow] = useState(() => Date.now());\nuseEffect(() => { const t = setInterval(() => setNow(Date.now()), 1000); return () => clearInterval(t); }, []);\nconst elapsed = Math.max(0, Math.round((now - start.getTime())/1000));\n```\nstart = first event receivedAt, or mount time if no events. Show header only when elapsed >= 3? Show always「正在执行 · Xs」.\n\nFor pure daily chat (fast): run.started→run.completed, no stages → fallback 「正在思考…」 — a 1-2s flash — fine.\n\nIcons needed: Loader2, CheckCircle2, XCircle, AlertCircle(partial), Circle(pending), ChevronRight(details summary), Bot? no. lucide imports in new file.\n\nNow, before writing — read the resume flow section :1190-1300 to wire correctly.","startTime":1791428023748,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023748},{"id":"call_565e6d7c5ffe406dad9f0d09","type":"TOOL","toolName":"read_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-session-view.tsx","limit":"115","offset":"1195"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":{"$blob":"sha256:6b44017f311d7a107334aaab3b6ea8a37a92e15026481e2f4244009bf5f5899a","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":5858,"compression":"none"},"metadata":{"relativePath":"frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-