│\n│                                  │\n│ ✓ 理解问题并召回上下文             │\n│ ✓ 划分分析任务 · 2 个任务          │\n│ ⟳ 执行分析任务 · 已完成 1/2        │\n│     ✓ 各区域销售额趋势 — 已完成     │  ← 任务清单逐个点亮\n│     ⟳ 环比明细 — 生成 SQL          │\n│ ⟳ 汇总生成报告                    │\n└──────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n- **思考流**（方案 B）：每个 LLM 节点一节，流式期间展开自动滚动，完成后自动折叠成「✓ 已完成」，可点开回看完整思考文本\n- **时间线**（方案 A）：只显示已开始的阶段，`run.failed`/超时会把最后一个进行中的阶段标红\n- **任务清单**（方案 C）：每个任务显示问题摘要 + 当前阶段（生成 SQL / 执行 SQL…）+ 状态\n\n## 执行完成后\n\n气泡让位给正文（打字机输出一开始进度就收场），下方留一行浅色摘要 chip：\n\n- `✓ 已完成 · 用时 52 秒 · 查看分析过程 ▸`（点击直接打开执行面板，替代了原来的按钮）\n- 失败 → 红色 `✗ 执行失败 · 用时 X 秒`；确认暂停 → 琥珀色 `已暂停，等待你的确认`\n- chip 数据来自 `meta.elapsed_seconds`（后端 turn 落库的 started/completed），**历史消息和刷新后也有**；日常闲聊（chat 类型）不显示，避免秒回也挂个 chip\n\n## 几个关键衔接\n\n- 恢复确认流时，占位语「正在根据你的确认继续处理...」期间进度条会接着暂停前的事件继续走（debugEvents 不清空）\n- 纯前端实现，与执行面板共用同一份 `debugEvents`，后端零改动；导出了面板的 `buildTasks`/`progressKind` 等复用，没有复制逻辑\n- 事件到来前（前 1-2 秒空窗）显示「正在思考…」兜底，不会闪空气泡\n\n`tsc` 验证通过（仍只有 4 个存量错误）。浏览器里实测我没法替你做——刷新页面问一轮分析问题，重点看：思考流滚动是否跟手、任务清单 phase 文案、完成后 chip 的用时是否合理。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789643286215},{"id":"3c0cc108-104a-4753-8dea-bcc2d5d34ee3","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"这个总进度还是要再优化优化，看看你有没有什么好的方案，不用遵循现有的设计","payload":{"query":"这个总进度还是要再优化优化，看看你有没有什么好的方案，不用遵循现有的设计","rawMessage":"这个总进度还是要再优化优化，看看你有没有什么好的方案，不用遵循现有的设计","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"app/agent/nodes/plan_analysis.py","name":"plan_analysis.py","type":"CURRENT_FILE"},{"id":"624418","name":"image.png","content":"https://comate.baidu.com/api/aidevops/autocomate/rest/autowork/v1/file/stream/624418?authorization=NjFjYWEwODUtMGY0Ni00YTYyLTg1NjEtN2Y0MmJlYWJlNzYx","type":"IMAGE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"670f96c8-2e50-4704-b286-2b75414a5832","requestedAt":1789698241909,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"3c0cc108-104a-4753-8dea-bcc2d5d34ee3"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"bcc9ce000688653c6d7465fa24c98828a8335cc1","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]}},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1789698242109},{"id":"8f1ae9a0-736c-4056-8bb7-1b6b7a156477","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"3c0cc108-104a-4753-8dea-bcc2d5d34ee3","reportedId":"454a6104-15cf-4d58-8de6-f5f3558d22a9","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Comate"},"role":"assistant","status":"cancelled","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":69.43,"contextUsed":177743,"contextLimit":256000,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"performanceMetrics":{"firstTokenLatency":1609,"totalDuration":871859},"appliedRuleNames":[],"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"6aaca0c3b7e22404df6e20a5","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":90246},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"64746bf6-6f82-4a6a-89a6-ec6acd07d3f4","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"The user shows the 执行过程 panel's 进度 tab (ProgressView). The screenshot shows:\n\n- 第 3 轮\n- ✓ 开始执行\n- ✓ 构建上下文\n- ✓ 任务划分\n- ✓ 提交动作\n- ✓ 执行工具\n- ✓ 运行结果\n- ⟳ 执行分析任务 — 已完成 0/1 个分析任务\n- 分析任务总进度 0/1 with empty progress bar\n\nProblems visible:\n1. \"第 3 轮\" — iteration counter confusing (第 3 轮 with everything already done?)\n2. The static pipeline steps (开始执行/构建上下文/任务划分/提交动作/执行工具/运行结果) are all ✓ but they're shown for round 3 — the whole list is repetitive across rounds and doesn't convey meaningful progress. The order is weird: 运行结果 appears BEFORE 执行分析任务 which is still running (0/1) — because ProgressView sorts by STEP_ORDER and 执行分析任务 isn't in STEP_ORDER... STEP_ORDER = [\"开始执行\", \"构建上下文\", \"任务划分\", \"提交动作\", \"执行工具\", \"等待用户确认\", \"运行结果\"]; 执行分析任务 gets order = STEP_ORDER.length → appended last. So \"运行结果 ✓\" shows while analysis tasks are still 0/1 — misleading and ugly.\n3. All the completed steps give no sense of what's actually happening NOW — the only live item is the task progress at the bottom.\n4. The user says: \"这个总进度还是要再优化优化，看看你有没有什么好的方案，不用遵循现有的设计\" — the overall progress view needs polish; I'm free to redesign, not bound by the current design.\n\nWhich \"总进度\"? The screenshot is the 执行面板's 进度 tab (ProgressView). So they want a redesign of the ProgressView (进度 tab). Hmm — or do they mean the chat timeline? The screenshot is clearly the right-side panel (执行过程 header, three tabs). So: redesign ProgressView.\n\nLet me think about what a great design would be, given available data (debugEvents with iterations):\n\nCurrent problems with ProgressView:\n- Round header 第 N 轮 + a flat static step list that's identical every round → noise.\n- Steps shown are harness-internal lifecycle (开始执行/提交动作/运行结果) — meaningless to humans; the real story is: 上下文 → 计划 → 每个任务的执行 (生成 SQL → 执行 SQL → ...) → 报告.\n- \"运行结果 ✓\" before tasks done — ordering bug-ish.\n- No time info.\n- No current-activity emphasis.\n\nRedesign options:\n\n**方案 1 — 单一叙事时间线（拍平轮次）**\nDrop the round grouping in the 进度 tab; merge all rounds into ONE continuous timeline of human-meaningful milestones, sorted by time:\n- ✓ 理解问题 · 召回上下文 (2.1s)\n- ✓ 划分分析任务 · 2 个任务 (1.4s)\n- ✓ 任务1 各区域销售额趋势：生成 SQL → 执行 SQL → 增强结果 (18s)\n- ⟳ 任务2 环比明细：生成 SQL…\n- ○ 汇总生成报告\nEach row: status icon + label + duration. Completed rounds' lifecycle steps collapse away entirely (they're boilerplate). This is basically my ChatRunTimeline but for the panel — richer version. The panel is a DEV/debug tool though — but user says 不用遵循现有设计, and wants 总进度优化.\n\n**方案 2 — 两段式：顶部总进度 + 下方活动流**\n- Top: one progress bar + current activity headline (「正在执行 任务2/3 · 生成 SQL」) + elapsed + overall %.\n- Below: the merged timeline from 方案 1.\n\n**方案 3 — 里程碑泳道按轮次折叠**\nKeep rounds but collapse completed rounds into a single line「第 1-2 轮 · 已完成 · 12s」, expand only the current round with the meaningful inner steps (task phases), not the lifecycle boilerplate.\n\nWhat's the best? The user explicitly invites a fresh design. The core insight: the 进度 tab should answer three questions at a glance: (1) 总体到哪一步了 (2) 现在在干什么 (3) 还剩什么. \n\nMy recommendation: 方案 2 (两段式):\n- **Header card**: 大号当前活动 + 总耗时 + 进度百分比（基于里程碑权重或任务完成度）。\n- **Timeline**: 里程碑合并拍平（跨轮次），每个里程碑带用时；生命周期样板步骤（开始执行/提交动作）不再单独成行——提交动作/执行工具合并进任务的叙事中。\n\nMilestones derivation from events:\n1. 理解问题 — context.* (duration: first context event → context.completed)\n2. 划分任务 — planner.* (→ planner.completed) [detail: N 个任务]\n3. Per task (in execution order): task.question + phase chain (生成 SQL ✓ 8s → 执行 SQL ✓ 5s → 增强 ✓ 2s) — from analysis_task_phase/resolved/result events + tool.progress steps with taskId. Current task shows live phase; done tasks show ✓ with total duration.\n4. 汇总生成报告 — report_plan_result → rendered_report (only when present)\n5. (等待确认) — if confirmation.required present.\n\nProgress %: weight: context 10%, plan 10%, tasks 60% (split evenly by terminal tasks), report 20% (when report route present). Or simpler: tasks done/total drives the bar; before tasks, indeterminate \"flow\" animation. A % that's honest: (completed milestones / total expected milestones). Expected total depends on route... For analysis: context+plan+N tasks+report → % = done/(N+3). For simple query: context+tool+done → coarser. Hmm — could show % only when task list known; before that show animated bar (indeterminate).\n\nAlso multi-round: tasks may span rounds; timeline merges naturally by time. Round info can appear as tiny badges (第 2 轮) on milestones when iteration changes — optional; drop it (noise).\n\nAlso live \"当前活动\" headline = the first running milestone's text (e.g. 「任务2/3 · 执行 SQL」).\n\nTime source: event.receivedAt (live) — durations per milestone = last - first. Live milestone duration ticks? Use receivedAt of latest event as \"now\" — no timer needed... but elapsed should tick. The panel isn't currently ticking; ProgressView static. Add a 1s interval like ChatRunTimeline? The panel shows while running; a ticking clock adds life. Keep: total elapsed ticking; milestone durations frozen at completion (computed from receivedAt) — no timer needed per milestone.\n\nData derivable: need per-task phase chain. Events: analysis_task_phase (payload.phase, task_id), analysis_task_resolved, analysis_task_result (status). Plus task question from analysis_plan/buildTasks. buildTasks gives TaskSummary with events per task — I can compute per-task phase chain from task.events (phases in order + durations from receivedAt).\n\nDesign the layout (panel width 430-500px):\n\n```\n┌───────────────────────────────┐\n│ ● 正在执行 任务 2/2 · 执行 SQL   │  ← headline (big, bold, 13px)\n│ ▓▓▓▓▓▓░░░░░░ 45% · 已执行 1 分 12 秒 │\n├───────────────────────────────┤\n│ ✓ 理解问题并召回上下文    3.2 秒 │\n│ ✓ 划分分析任务 · 2 个任务  1.1 秒 │\n│                                 │\n│ ✓ 任务 1 · 各区域销售额趋势  21 秒│\n│     生成 SQL → 执行 SQL → 增强    │  ← muted sub-line (chain)\n│ ⟳ 任务 2 · 环比明细              │\n│     生成 SQL ✓ → 执行 SQL…       │\n│                                 │\n│ ○ 汇总生成报告                   │\n└───────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\nFor non-analysis routes (simple_data): milestones = 理解问题 → 执行数据查询 (tool.*) → 完成. Reuse generic.\n\nAlso handle waiting_confirmation: headline 「等待你确认」, amber.\n\nAnd failed: headline red 「执行失败」+ bar red.\n\nWhat about 轮次 (rounds)? Multi-round = controller looped (tool failures or follow-up actions). Milestones just continue; maybe show a subtle divider「第 2 轮」when a new tool round starts? I'd show rounds only when >1 as small muted dividers in the timeline. Hmm — actually simpler: skip rounds entirely in this redesign; the milestone story is self-explanatory. But the step-round info has debug value... it's in 步骤返回 tab anyway. Drop from 进度 tab. \n\nSo the redesign plan:\n\n**ProgressView v2 — 「当前活动 + 里程碑时间线」**\n\n1. **状态头**（卡片）:\n   - 运行中: 蓝点脉冲 + 当前活动文案（首个 running 里程碑，含任务序号/phase）+ 已执行时间（1s tick）\n   - 进度条: 有任务清单时 = 任务完成度（已完成任务/总数 + 当前任务 phase 权重? keep simple: 任务级）；无任务时 indeterminate 流动条；失败红条\n   - 终态: ✓ 已完成 · 总用时 / ✗ 执行失败\n2. **里程碑时间线**（纵向，带连接线）:\n   - 理解问题 → 划分任务(含 N 任务) → [每任务: 状态+总用时+phase 链] → 生成报告（存在才显示）\n   - 每行右侧灰字用时（完成的）；当前行蓝字\n   - phase 链子行: 生成 SQL ✓ 2.1s → 执行 SQL ⟳ … （仅任务行展开显示）\n3. 交互: 行可点开详情? 进度 tab 保持纯速览（详情在步骤返回 tab）— 不加交互，保持轻。\n\nWait — hmm, but should I ask the user which 方案 first? They said \"看看你有没有什么好的方案\" — give a plan? Or just do it? Last time they said 先给我方案 for the chat feature. This message: \"这个总进度还是要再优化优化，看看你有没有什么好的方案，不用遵循现有的设计\" — they're asking for proposals again. I should present the design (maybe with ASCII mockup) and... hmm. Given the pattern, they want to see the 方案 first. But it's a UI polish of an existing tab — maybe they want me to just present the design and implement. The phrase \"看看你有没有什么好的方案\" = propose. I'll present ONE strong proposal (not a menu — they said 不用遵循现有的设计, giving me freedom; a single confident design with rationale + mockup), then ask confirm via AskUserQuestion with maybe 2 variants (minimal vs full)? \n\nHmm — decision fatigue. Better: present the recommended design with mockup, plus briefly note what I'm dropping (round grouping, lifecycle boilerplate rows) and why. Then a quick AskUserQuestion: 按这个做 / 要保留轮次信息 / 其他调整. Actually the user has been decisive; one question with 2-3 options: (a) 就按这个做 (b) 保留轮次分组 (c) 更简化. Let me also consider effort — moderate rewrite of ProgressView (~120 lines). Fine.\n\nLet me also double check what data I can get for per-task phase chains. In buildTasks, task.events contains all events with taskId: analysis_task_phase (phase), analysis_task_resolved, analysis_task_result, and tool.progress events with task_id? Do task-scoped tool.progress events carry task_id? execute_analysis emits reasoning_chunk etc. with task_id in payload? Earlier: \"StreamEvent.task_id → DebugEvent.taskId → buildTasks assigns them to the task\" — task.events includes tool.progress with task_id ✓ (chips carry task_id in payload — from execute_analysis writer calls :341-420 — do those include task_id? They're emitted inside task loop... likely yes with \"task_id\": task_id). I'll verify quickly by grepping execute_analysis for task_id in writer payloads.\n\nPhase chain per task: iterate task.events in order; collect phases: for analysis_task_phase → phase name + start receivedAt; phase ends when next phase event or result arrives; duration. Also tool.progress chunk events with step? For chain display simplicity: show phase names with ✓/⟳ and duration for completed phases.\n\nLet me check execute_analysis event payloads for phase names & task_id.","startTime":1791428023748,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023748},{"id":"4ef573e3-401b-4177-8186-5ce5c61601ed","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"这个截图确实暴露了进度 tab 的根本问题：生命周期样板行（开始执行/提交动作/运行结果）占满屏、轮次语义混乱（第 3 轮全绿但任务 0/1）、「运行结果 ✓」排在还没跑的分析任务前面。我先确认一下任务级事件里有哪些字段可用，再给方案："},{"id":"call_4dc00e60d65e4a71b8e0e9a2","type":"TOOL","toolName":"grep_content","params":{"-n":"true","output_mode":"content","path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","pattern":"\"task_id\"|\"phase\"|\"type\": \"(analysis_task_phase|analysis_task_resolved|analysis_task_result|progress)\""},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":{"$blob":"sha256:ca89ee30acec0f9cedda93b0b16d417d405023db954358e048150d7e8dd96d44","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":6301,"compression":"none"},"metadata":{"pattern":"\"task_id\"|\"phase\"|\"type\": \"(analysis_task_phase|analysis_task_resolved|analysis_task_result|progress)\"","relevantFiles":[{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","startLine":344,"endLine":344},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","startLine":345,"endLine":345},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysi