izhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","startLine":736,"endLine":736},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","startLine":775,"endLine":775},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","startLine":777,"endLine":777},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","startLine":779,"endLine":779},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","startLine":783,"endLine":783},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","startLine":786,"endLine":786},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","startLine":791,"endLine":791},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py","startLine":809,"endLine":809}]}}}]},{"id":"6aaca11f2dd493057d75b9a1","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":51290},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"0d09e91a-a58c-4d9c-8cc9-afe572e06808","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"Confirmed: task-scoped events all carry `task_id` + `phase`, with phase names like 「解析依赖结果」「生成 Python 分析代码」「执行 Python 计算」(and the analysis sub-nodes emit phases like 生成 SQL etc.). `analysis_task_result` marks the end. So per-task phase chains with durations are derivable from `buildTasks` output (task.events in order).\n\nNow — the user asked for a proposal (\"看看你有没有什么好的方案，不用遵循现有的设计\"). Following the established pattern (they approved A+B+C via options last time), I should present a design proposal and let them pick. But they also said \"还是要再优化优化\" — they want it better. Let me design ONE strong proposal with a clear mockup, and offer 1-2 alternatives via AskUserQuestion.\n\n**The redesign: 进度 tab → 「当前活动 + 里程碑时间线」**\n\nProblems solved:\n1. Kill the boilerplate lifecycle rows (开始执行/提交动作/运行结果) — they're harness internals, not user story. The story: 理解问题 → 划分任务 → 每个任务 → 报告.\n2. Kill round grouping in this tab (multi-round merges into one continuous story; round detail lives in 步骤返回).\n3. Fix ordering (运行结果 before tasks).\n4. Add live \"now\" emphasis + time.\n5. Progress % that's honest (task-driven).\n\nLayout (430-500px sidebar):\n\n```\n● 正在执行 任务 2/2 · 生成 SQL          ← 当前活动大字（蓝，脉冲）\n▓▓▓▓▓▓▓░░░░ 50% · 已执行 1 分 12 秒      ← 任务完成度 + 总时长\n─────────────────────────────\n✓ 理解问题并召回上下文            3 秒\n✓ 划分分析任务 · 2 个任务         1 秒\n✓ 任务 1 · 各区域销售额趋势      21 秒\n    解析依赖 ✓ 1s → 生成 SQL ✓ 8s → 执行 SQL ✓ 6s → 增强 ✓ 3s\n⟳ 任务 2 · 环比明细              12 秒\n    生成 SQL ⟳ …\n○ 汇总生成报告\n```\n\n- Header: current activity = first running thing (task phase / context / report); when waiting confirmation → amber 等待你确认; failed → red.\n- Progress bar: tasks known → done/total; before plan → indeterminate shimmer; failed → red bar.\n- Timeline rows: milestone icon + label + right-aligned duration (completed ones); running row blue.\n- Task rows: sub-line phase chain with per-phase duration, arrows between.\n- Non-analysis route: 理解问题 → 执行数据查询 → (生成报告 if any). Generic milestones.\n- Multi-round: merged; if >1 tool round, a tiny muted badge on affected task rows? Skip — merged timeline is self-explanatory. Actually a subtle「第 N 轮」chip could still help debugging... skip it, 不做无用功能. Mention in proposal that rounds are dropped here (still visible in 步骤返回).\n\nImplementation notes:\n- Rewrite ProgressView in execution-panel.tsx (~150 lines). Reuses buildTasks (already there), eventOrder, etc.\n- Tick timer 1s while running for elapsed.\n- Percent: tasks.length ? Math.round(done/tasks.length*100) : indeterminate. Hmm — include phase-level weight for the running task? Over-engineering; task granularity fine (0/2 = 0% feels stuck when task 1 is 80% done... could do (done + runningTaskProgress)/total where running task progress = completed phases/expected phases? Phase count varies — unreliable. Keep task-level %. Hmm — but 0% for a minute looks bad. Alternative: indeterminate shimmer until first task completes, then switch to %? A % that jumps 0→50→100 is fine. Actually let me do weighted: phases observed for the running task... no. KEEP: % = done/total tasks; indeterminate animated bar while tasks unknown. If tasks exist but 0 done, show 0% + the ticking time conveys life; also the headline shows current phase. Acceptable. Hmm — actually nicer: bar fill = (done + 0.5*running)/total → shows partial motion. Slightly fake but honest-ish \"half a task in progress\"... 不靠谱判断逻辑不要 — 0.5 credit is a hack. Use done/total strictly. The ticking clock + phase chain updates give life.\n\n- Durations: milestone = from first relevant event receivedAt to its completing event receivedAt. Task duration: first task event → result event. Phase durations: phase event → next phase/result event.\n\nWaiting confirmation: headline amber 「等待你确认」; bar paused (indeterminate amber).\n\nWhere does current-activity text come from: pick first stage/task in running state, in timeline order: context running → 「理解问题并召回上下文」; plan running → 「划分分析任务」; task i running → 「任务 i/N · {phase}」; report running → 「汇总生成报告」; else 「执行数据查询」 etc.\n\nAlso non-analysis (simple_data): tasks empty; execute milestone = 执行数据查询 (tool.completed → done). Chat route: only run events → timeline nearly empty → header shows 正在思考/已完成.\n\nAlternatives to offer:\n(a) 推荐方案：当前活动+里程碑时间线（如上）\n(b) 保守优化：保留现有结构，只修排序+删样板行+加用时 — smaller change\n(c) 或者在 a 的基础上加「轮次」折叠条\n\nI'll present the recommended design with mockup and ask: A 按推荐做 / B 保守优化 / C 推荐方案+保留轮次徽标. Actually keep it to a single question, 3 options. Present the mockup in the message text, then AskUserQuestion.","startTime":1791428023748,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023748},{"id":"963f4a81-c4ea-4931-8147-533f03dc285b","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"任务级事件字段确认充足（每个任务都有 `task_id` + `phase` 链：解析依赖结果 → 生成 SQL/Python 代码 → 执行计算 → 增强，`analysis_task_result` 收口），足够支撑一次彻底的重做。\n\n## 现状的问题（你截图里的）\n\n1. **样板行占满屏**：「开始执行/提交动作/运行结果」是 Harness 内部生命周期，不是用户能理解的进度叙事\n2. **轮次语义混乱**：第 3 轮全绿 ✓，唯一在跑的分析任务却 0/1——轮次是调试视角，不是进度视角\n3. **排序错误**：「运行结果 ✓」排在还没执行的分析任务前面\n4. **没有时间感**：不知道跑了多久、每步多快、现在卡在哪一步\n\n## 推荐方案：当前活动 + 里程碑时间线\n\n进度 tab 只回答三个问题：**到哪了 / 在干什么 / 还剩什么**。删掉轮次分组和生命周期样板行（这些在「步骤返回」tab 保留），按时间拍平成一条人类可读的里程碑叙事：\n\n```\n● 正在执行 任务 2/2 · 生成 SQL            ← 当前活动（蓝色脉冲大字）\n▓▓▓▓▓░░░░░ 50% · 已执行 1 分 12 秒        ← 任务完成度 + 总时长（每秒走动）\n\n✓ 理解问题并召回上下文              3 秒\n✓ 划分分析任务 · 2 个任务           1 秒\n✓ 任务 1 · 各区域销售额趋势        21 秒\n     解析依赖 1s → 生成 SQL 8s → 执行 SQL 6s → 增强 3s\n⟳ 任务 2 · 环比明细                12 秒\n     生成 SQL …\n○ 汇总生成报告\n```\n\n- **每个任务一行**：状态 + 用时；子行是 phase 链（每段带耗时，用 → 串联），一眼看出卡在哪一段\n- **头部进度条**：有任务清单时 = 已完成任务/总数；计划还没出来时用流动动画（诚实的不确定态）；失败变红条 + 红色 headline\n- **等待确认**：headline 变琥珀色「等待你确认」\n- **非分析路由**（简单问数/闲聊）：同一套里程碑退化成 理解问题 → 执行数据查询，不留空壳行\n- 多轮执行不再单独分组——轮次信息在「步骤返回」tab 里本来就有，这里拍平成一条连续故事"},{"id":"call_2c97c34a053947fd9a059a4c","type":"TOOL","toolName":"ask_user_question","params":{"questions":"[{\"id\": \"approach\", \"options\": [{\"description\": \"删样板行与轮次分组，按任务拍平成里程碑叙事 + 当前活动头部 + 任务进度条\", \"id\": \"redesign\", \"label\": \"按推荐方案重做（推荐）\"}, {\"description\": \"保留现有结构，只修排序 bug、删生命周期样板行、加用时显示\", \"id\": \"conservative\", \"label\": \"保守优化，不动结构\"}, {\"description\": \"推荐方案基础上，多轮时在时间线里加「第 N 轮」小徽标\", \"id\": \"redesign_rounds\", \"label\": \"推荐方案 + 保留轮次徽标\"}], \"prompt\": \"进度 tab 按哪个方案改？\"}]"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"User questions responses:\nQuestion approach: Selected option(s) redesign","metadata":{"title":"","questions":[{"id":"approach","options":[{"description":"删样板行与轮次分组，按任务拍平成里程碑叙事 + 当前活动头部 + 任务进度条","id":"redesign","label":"按推荐方案重做（推荐）"},{"description":"保留现有结构，只修排序 bug、删生命周期样板行、加用时显示","id":"conservative","label":"保守优化，不动结构"},{"description":"推荐方案基础上，多轮时在时间线里加「第 N 轮」小徽标","id":"redesign_rounds","label":"推荐方案 + 保留轮次徽标"},{"id":"other_option","label":""}],"prompt":"进度 tab 按哪个方案改？","selectedOptionIds":["redesign"]}],"state":"completed"}}}]},{"id":"6aaca284b7e22404df6e25eb","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":91062},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"eaee90c4-bf9f-4761-8318-773ce09c7285","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"User chose the full redesign. Now implement ProgressView v2 in execution-panel.tsx.\n\nDesign the implementation:\n\n**Replace `ProgressView` function** (execution-panel.tsx :710-728 currently) with the new implementation. The component signature stays `{ events, tasks }` — called from ExecutionPanel with `orderedEvents` and `tasks`. Actually current call: `<ProgressView events={orderedEvents} tasks={tasks} />`. tasks = buildTasks(rawEvents). Keep signature.\n\n**Data model:**\n\n```ts\ninterface ProgressMilestone {\n  key: string;\n  label: string;\n  status: RunStatus;           // pending shown? only render started ones + pending report? \n  detail?: string;\n  durationMs?: number;         // completed duration\n  phases?: ProgressPhase[];    // for task milestones\n}\n\ninterface ProgressPhase {\n  label: string;\n  status: RunStatus;\n  durationMs?: number;\n}\n```\n\n**Derivation** (from events + tasks):\n\nHelpers:\n- `eventsBetween(startIdx, endIdx)` — durations via receivedAt.\n- Use Date.parse(receivedAt).\n\nMilestones:\n\n1. 理解问题并召回上下文 — events: type startsWith \"context.\" (also question_route? mainStep maps question_route → 判断问题路由 — include as part of understanding: type === \"question_route\"). \n   - start = first such event; end = context.completed (type === \"context.completed\") or last such event if running.\n   - status: context.failed → failed; context.completed → success; else running.\n   - Only include if any such event exists.\n2. 划分分析任务 — planner.* or analysis_plan:\n   - status: failed (planner.failed / analysis_plan failed) / success (planner.completed || analysis_plan success) / running.\n   - detail: tasks.length ? `${tasks.length} 个任务`.\n   - duration: first → planner.completed (or analysis_plan success event) receivedAt.\n3. Task milestones — for each task (in buildTasks order — which is analysis_plan order? buildTasks iterates analysis_plan events' payload.tasks in order → Map insertion order = plan order ✓):\n   - label: `任务 ${index+1} · ${task.question || task.task_id}` — question might be long; truncate with CSS (truncate class).\n   - status: task.status (already computed by taskStatus).\n   - duration: first task event → analysis_task_result event receivedAt (if terminal).\n   - phases: from task.events: analysis_task_phase events (payload.phase) in order; each phase runs until next phase event or analysis_task_resolved/analysis_task_result; also analysis_task_resolved = phase \"解析依赖结果\"? — execute_analysis emits analysis_task_phase with phase \"解析依赖结果\" (:524) AND analysis_task_resolved separately (:569). Hmm — the resolved event duplicates the phase end? phase 解析依赖结果 starts at :519; resolved at :569 marks its end? Then next phase 生成 Python 分析代码 :616. So phase end = next phase event's start OR resolved event (for the 解析依赖结果 phase) OR result event.\n   \n   Simplification: phase list = ordered analysis_task_phase events; phase[i].end = start of phase[i+1] (or resolved/result event receivedAt if it's the last phase and resolved/result follows). Phase status: last phase = running (if task not terminal) else success; earlier = success. Duration = end - start.\n   \n   Hmm wait — do tasks also have phases from OTHER event types? tool.progress with taskId carrying payload.step (e.g. \"生成 SQL\" phases from generate_sql inside analysis?) — execute_analysis's inner nodes (generate_sql etc. for SQL-based tasks) — line :344-424 emits reasoning_chunk/llm_chunk with phase?? Those lines show \"phase\" + \"task_id\" keys — wait lines 344/345 are inside... those are `reasoning_chunk` events (:341) carrying phase+task_id! So chunk events have phase too. And phases like 生成 SQL — from where? Line :519-524 analysis_task_phase phase \"解析依赖结果\"; :616 \"生成 Python 分析代码\"; :661 \"执行 Python 计算\". For SQL-type tasks, phases 生成 SQL/执行 SQL presumably emitted similarly elsewhere (maybe in the same file earlier portion or via sub-node calls with different phase strings). Fine — generic: milestone phases from analysis_task_phase events only (the dedicated phase events). The chunk events' phase key is coincidental metadata; ignore.\n\n   Hmm — but what about \"解析依赖结果\" phase AND analysis_task_resolved event — the resolved event arrives AFTER the phase completes (taskStepLabel treats 分析任务结果/依赖结果解析 as separate labels). For phase chain: [解析依赖结果, 生成 Python 分析代码, 执行 Python 计算]. Good enough.\n\n   Also: task 0/1 stuck \"0%\"? Progress bar = done/total.\n\n4. 汇总生成报告 — report_plan_result or rendered_report:\n   - status: rendered_report || run.completed → success; else running.\n   - duration: report_plan_result → rendered_report.\n   - Only include if present.\n\n5. Non-task execute milestone — when tasks.length === 0 but tool events exist: 执行数据查询 — status tool.failed → failed; tool.completed → success; else running. duration: first tool.* → tool.completed.\n   - Position: after 划分任务 milestone (if plan stage exists) else after 理解问题.\n\n6. Failure overlay: runFailed → last running milestone → failed.\n\n**Header:**\n\n- status derivation:\n  - failed → red: headline 「执行失败」\n  - waiting_confirmation present && !resolved → amber 「等待你确认」 (events: confirmation.required without confirmation.resolved)\n  - run.completed present → green ✓ 「已完成」+ total duration\n  - else running → blue pulse: current activity text.\n- current activity: walk milestones in order, first with status \"running\" → its label (+ for task: current phase label appended: `任务 2/2 · 生成 SQL`? label already 任务 2 · question — headline wants task INDEX + phase: `任务 2/2 · ${runningPhase}`). Compute from tasks + phases: runningTaskIdx = tasks.findIndex(!terminal); phase = its last analysis_task_phase phase name. If no milestones running (early gap) → 「正在准备执行」/「正在思考」.\n- elapsed: first event receivedAt → now (1s tick); completed → total = last-first.\n\n**Progress bar:**\n- tasks.length > 0 → percent = done/total (done = taskTerminal count); bar blue (or red if failed).\n- else if run completed → 100%.\n- else indeterminate: CSS animated shimmer bar (animate-pulse full-width block or a moving gradient — use a simple `animate-pulse` rounded bar or custom keyframe? Tailwind: `<div className=\"h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-100 overflow-hidden relative\"><div className=\"h-full w-1/3 rounded-full bg-blue-500 animate-[progress-slide_1.2s_ease-in-out_infinite]\"/></div>` — custom keyframes need config... simpler: use `animate-pulse` on a full bar (pulsing opacity) — conveys \"working\" without keyframes. Use that for indeterminate.\n- waiting → amber pulsing bar.\n\n**Rendering rows:** vertical list, each row: StatusIcon (reuse) + label + detail muted + right-aligned duration text (text-[10px] slate-400). Task rows: phase chain sub-line: `解析依赖 1s → 生成 SQL 8s → …` with the RUNNING phase highlighted? Keep chain muted text-[10px]; running phase gets blue. Joined with \" → \".\n\nPhase chain with per-phase duration might be long — allow wrap? whitespace-nowrap + truncate could hide later phases... use flex-wrap with separator spans, or just truncate. For 430px width: 「解析依赖 1s → 生成 SQL 8s → 执行 SQL 6s → 增强 3s」 ≈ fits mostly; truncate edge OK.\n\n**Now replace ProgressView.** Current ProgressView also feeds the 「执行分析任务」 pseudo-step and progress bar at bottom — full replacement.\n\nAlso the currentRound display drops (per design).\n\nCheck ProgressView current usages: `<ProgressView events={orderedEvents} tasks={tasks} />` — orderedEvents sorted by step-order then eventOrder. For durations I need TIME order — receivedAt-based. Milestone derivation uses presence + specific boundary events; I'll compute durations via finding boundary events in the events array (any order) using sequence: first = min sequence among matching, end = specific event. Simpler: iterate events sorted by sequence once and track first-seen/last-seen per milestone. I'll sort locally by eventOrder (sequence) inside the derivation.\n\nImplementation sketch:\n\n```ts\ninterface ProgressPhase { label: string; status: RunStatus; durationMs?: number; }\ninterface ProgressMilestone { key: string; label: string; status: RunStatus; detail?: string; durationMs?: number; phases?: ProgressPhase[]; }\n\nfunction receivedMs(event: DebugEvent) { const value = Date.parse(event.receivedAt); return Number.isFinite(value) ? value : NaN; }\n```\n\nHmm — receivedAt uses `new Date().toISOString()` at append (client clock) ✓ consistent within session. History events (trace) — appendExecutionEvent called with receivedAt=now at load time — ALL history events get the SAME receivedAt (load moment)! So durations from history = 0. Hmm — panel's trace loading (:1562 reduce appendExecutionEvent) — all receivedAt identical → milestone durations all ~0 → shows \"0 秒\"/blank. Should I hide duration when < 1s? Or use event.timestamp? HarnessEvent has timestamp (server-side ISO)! toHarnessStreamEvent keeps ...event spread → timestamp field survives into StreamEvent → safePayload → payload.timestamp. So I can use payload.timestamp (server clock) when present, fallback receivedAt. For history events, trace endpoint returns stored events with timestamp ✓ → durations work for history too!\n\nLet me verify HarnessEvent has timestamp field — yes (writer.py :117 timestamp=datetime.now(UTC)). And model_dump includes it ✓. Trace endpoint returns stored HarnessEvents ✓.\n\nSo: `eventTimestampMs(event)`: payload.timestamp string → Date.parse; fallback Date.parse(receivedAt). \n\nFor phases/milestones: first = eventTimestampMs(first matching), end = eventTimestampMs(boundary). Live running: elapsed for running milestone — don't show live per-milestone ticking (only header elapsed ticks). Completed milestone shows duration ✓.\n\nDurations format: <1s → \"<1 秒\"? or \"0.x 秒\"? Use: ms<1000 → `${Math.round(ms/100)+\"\"}`... keep: <1000ms → \"不足 1 秒\"? too long. Format helper: \n```ts\nfunction formatDuration(ms: number) {\n  const seconds = ms / 1000;\n  if (seconds < 1) return \"<1 秒\";\n  if (seconds < 60) return `${Math.round(seconds)} 秒`;\n  const minutes = Math.floor(seconds / 60);\n  const rest = Math.round(seconds % 60);\n  return rest ? `${minutes} 分 ${rest} 秒` : `${minutes} 分钟`;\n}\n```\n\nNow write the code. Replace the whole ProgressView function (:710-728 in original numbering — shifted now). Let me view the current ProgressView to replace precisely. It was at :710-728 before my edits; the file shifted (+~20 lines from earlier edits). Let me read the current region.\n\nAlso — the old ProgressView referenced taskOverview/aggregateTaskStatus — those stay used by buildStepGroups ✓ keep them.\n\nTimer: `const [, setTick] = useState(0); useEffect(interval 1000)` — only tick while running (component shows during completed too — timer only needed when running; gate: if running state... derive `const running = !(completed||failed||waiting)` and only set interval when running. useEffect dep [running].\n\nLet me now write the new ProgressView. Also keep the function name ProgressView (call site unchanged).\n\nOne more design detail — the rows list with a left connector line (timeline feel)? Simple: space-y-2 rows without connector — cleaner. Or with connector like StepCard... keep simple rows, the header already anchors.\n\nBar percent: `done/total`; show `已完成 X/Y 个任务`? The bar row: percent text right? Design: bar + right text `{percent}%`... and headline carries 任务 i/N. Put percent INSIDE bar row right side, plus 总时长 in header. Wait — design mockup: `▓▓▓▓░░ 50% · 已执行 1 分 12 秒` — one row under headline: bar flex-1 + percent text + elapsed. Elapsed ticks — put in header line instead? Mockup had it in bar row. Implement bar row: `<div flex items-center gap-2><bar flex-1/><span>{pct}%</span><span>{elapsed}</span></div>`. For completed: bar full green? Keep blue. waiting: amber.\n\nHeadline for running with running task: `正在执行 任务 2/2 · 生成 SQL`; running task but no phase yet: `正在执行 任务 2/2`; no tasks running but context running: `正在理解问题`; plan running: `正在划分分析任务`; report running: `正在汇总生成报告`; execute (no tasks) running: `正在执行数据查询`; nothing: `正在准备`.\n\nAlso headline when waiting: `等待你确认`; failed: `执行失败`; completed: `已完成`.\n\nMilestone labels:\n1. 理解问题并召回上下文\n2. 划分分析任务\n3. tasks or 执行数据查询\n4. 汇总生成报告\n\nRender only milestones with events (except: pending report row when tasks exist but report not started? Design mockup showed ○ 汇总生成报告 as pending — showing expected future steps gives \"还剩什么\" answer. Show report row as pending when tasks exist and report milestone absent but run not completed? Hmm — report always comes for analysis runs. Show pending report row when tasks.length > 0 && !runCompleted && no report events. After completion, milestone appears (success). OK — include pending row: status \"pending\" (grey circle StatusIcon handles). Similarly pending tasks show as pending rows ✓ (tasks include pending ones from plan ✓).\n\nWhat about a pending row for 执行分析任务 when plan done but no task events yet — tasks have status pending → rows render pending ✓ good.\n\nWrite it now. I need current file region — read ProgressView now.","startTime":1791428023748,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023748},{"id":"98dc4520-abf0-48c3-98c8-24bee53bcd9e","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"按推荐方案重做。先看当前 ProgressView 的确切代码段："},{"id":"call_0bb46649f34b49c9949ddb8b","type":"TOOL","toolName":"grep_content","params":{"-A":"20","-n":"true","output_mode":"content","path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx","pattern":"function ProgressView"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Found 1 matches\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx:\n  Line 734: function ProgressView({ events, tasks }: { events: DebugEvent[]; tasks: TaskSummary[] }) {\n  Line 735:   const runCompleted = events.some((event) => event.type === \"run.completed\");\n  Line 736:   const groups = new Map<string, DebugEvent[]>();\n  Line 737:   for (const event of events.filter((item) => !STREAM_EVENT_TYPES.has(item.type) && !item.taskId)) {\n  Line 738:     const label = event.step;\n  Line 739:     groups.set(label, [...(groups.get(label) || []), event]);\n  Line 740:   }\n  Line 741:   if (tasks.length) groups.set(\"执行分析任务\", [taskOverview(tasks)]);\n  Line 742:   const steps = Array.from(groups.entries())\n  Line 743:     .map(([step, values]) => ({\n  Line 744:       step,\n  Line 745:       status: step === \"执行分析任务\" ? aggregateTaskStatus(tasks) : statusForEvents(currentEvents(values), undefined, runCompleted),\n  Line 746:       latest: values[values.length - 1],\n  Line 747:     }))\n  Line 748:     .sort((left, right) => orderOf(left.step) - orderOf(right.step));\n  Line 749:   const completed = tasks.filter((task) => terminal(task.status)).length;\n  Line 750:   const currentRound = events.reduce((max, event) => Math.max(max, event.iteration), -1);\n  Line 751:   return <>{currentRound >= 0 && <div className=\"mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500\">第 {currentRound + 1} 轮</div>}<div className=\"space-y-3\">{steps.map((step, index) => <div key={step.step} className=\"relative flex gap-3\">{index < steps.length - 1 && <span className=\"absolute left-[7px] top-5 h-[calc(100%+12px)] w-px bg-slate-200\" />}<StatusIcon status={step.status} /><div className=\"min-w-0 pb-1\"><div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-700\">{step.step}</div>{step.step === \"执行分析任务\" && tasks.length ? <div className=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-400\">已完成 {completed} / {tasks.length} 个分析任务</div> : typeof step.latest.payload.message === \"string\" ? <div className=\"mt-1 break-words text-[11px] leading-5 text-slate-400\">{step.latest.payload.message}</div> : null}</div></div>)}{!steps.length && <div className=\"py-10 text-center text-xs text-slate-400\">提交问题后显示执行步骤</div>}</div>{tasks.length ? <div className=\"mt-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4\"><div className=\"mb-2 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400\"><span>分析任务总进度</span><span>{completed} / {tasks.length}</span></div><div className=\"h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-100\"><div className=\"h-full rounded-full bg-blue-500 transition-all\" style={{ width: (completed / tasks.length * 100) + \"%\" }} /></div></div> : null}</>;\n  Line 752: }\n  Line 753: \n  Line 754: function AllEvents({ events }: { events: DebugEvent[] }) {","metadata":{"pattern":"function ProgressView","relevantFiles":[{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx","startLine":734,"endLine":754}]}}}]},{"id":"6aaca2dfb7e22404df6e26f4","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":171263},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"6330774e-bfd5-42a8-ad74-b67d09eb872c","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"Now I'll write the new ProgressView. I'll replace lines 734-752 with the new implementation plus helper functions above it.\n\nKey derivations:\n\n```ts\nfunction eventTimestampMs(event: DebugEvent) {\n  // 优先服务端 timestamp（历史 trace 的 receivedAt 都是补拉时刻），缺省退回本地接收时间。\n  const server = typeof event.payload.timestamp === \"string\" ? Date.parse(event.payload.timestamp) : NaN;\n  if (Number.isFinite(server)) return server;\n  const local = Date.parse(event.receivedAt);\n  return Number.isFinite(local) ? local : NaN;\n}\n```\n\nWait — payload.timestamp: is it in the payload? makeEvent payload = safePayload(event) where event is the flattened StreamEvent — top-level `timestamp` from HarnessEvent → flattened into payload ✓ (payload spread includes top-level fields). For toHistoricalStreamEvent: {...raw, ...payload} — raw.timestamp ✓. So event.payload.timestamp ✓.\n\nHmm — actually careful: flattened payload = safePayload(event) — event has `timestamp` top-level → payload.timestamp ✓. But ALSO the nested original payload has no timestamp. OK.\n\nformatDuration helper.\n\nMilestone builder:\n\n```ts\ninterface ProgressPhase {\n  label: string;\n  status: RunStatus;\n  durationMs?: number;\n}\n\ninterface ProgressMilestone {\n  key: string;\n  label: string;\n  status: RunStatus;\n  detail?: string;\n  durationMs?: number;\n  phases?: ProgressPhase[];\n}\n\nfunction deriveProgressMilestones(events: DebugEvent[], tasks: TaskSummary[]): ProgressMilestone[] {\n  const ordered = events.slice().sort((left, right) => eventOrder(left) - eventOrder(right));\n  const firstMs = (predicate: (event: DebugEvent) => boolean) => {\n    const event = ordered.find(predicate);\n    return event ? eventTimestampMs(event) : NaN;\n  };\n  const lastMs = (predicate) => { for (let i = ordered.length - 1; ...) } // or reduce\n  const has = (predicate) => ordered.some(predicate);\n  const failed = runFailed(ordered); // runFailed already exists in chat-run-progress... it's defined THERE not here. Hmm — I defined runFailed in chat-run-progress.tsx. For the panel I need it too — duplicating 6 lines or export from chat-run-progress? Panel is the source module; chat imports from panel. Putting runFailed in panel and importing into chat would invert. Simplest: define locally in panel (small). Or move to a shared util... Given two uses, define in panel and have chat-run-progress import it? chat already imports from panel — but panel doesn't import from chat (no cycle either way). I'll add local helper in panel `runInterrupted` — hmm wait, actually chat-run-progress.tsx already has runFailed; panel needs same. To avoid duplication: export runFailed from chat-run-progress and import in panel? Import direction panel ← chat currently; panel importing from chat creates a cycle (chat imports panel, panel imports chat). ES modules tolerate cycles if usage is at render time... risky. Cleanest: move runFailed INTO panel (export), chat imports it (chat already imports panel). Do that: add `export function runFailed` — hmm naming: runInterrupted? Keep runFailed but it lives in panel... chat-run-progress currently defines its own runFailed — I'd edit chat to import instead. Small cleanup; do it.\n\n  const milestones: ProgressMilestone[] = [];\n\n  // 1. 理解问题\n  const contextEvents = ordered.filter((e) => e.type.startsWith(\"context.\") || e.type === \"question_route\");\n  if (contextEvents.length) {\n    const start = eventTimestampMs(contextEvents[0]);\n    const completedEvent = ordered.find((e) => e.type === \"context.completed\");\n    const failedEvent = ordered.find((e) => e.type === \"context.failed\");\n    milestones.push({\n      key: \"understand\",\n      label: \"理解问题并召回上下文\",\n      status: failedEvent ? \"failed\" : completedEvent ? \"success\" : \"running\",\n      durationMs: completedEvent || failedEvent ? eventTimestampMs(completedEvent ?? failedEvent!) - start : undefined,\n    });\n  }\n```\n\nHmm — careful with duration NaN (missing timestamps) — formatDuration guards: only render when Number.isFinite && >0.\n\n  // 2. 划分任务\n```ts\n  const planStart = firstMs((e) => e.type.startsWith(\"planner.\") || e.type === \"analysis_plan\");\n  if (Number.isFinite(planStart)) {\n    const boundary = ordered.find((e) => e.type === \"planner.completed\" || e.type === \"planner.failed\"\n      || (e.type === \"analysis_plan\" && (e.status === \"success\" || e.status === \"failed\")));\n    const failed = boundary?.type === \"planner.failed\" || boundary?.status === \"failed\";\n    milestones.push({\n      key: \"plan\",\n      label: \"划分分析任务\",\n      status: boundary ? (failed ? \"failed\" : \"success\") : \"running\",\n      detail: tasks.length ? `${tasks.length} 个任务` : undefined,\n      durationMs: boundary ? eventTimestampMs(boundary) - planStart : undefined,\n    });\n  }\n```\n\n  // 3. tasks (per task) OR 执行数据查询\n```ts\n  if (tasks.length) {\n    tasks.forEach((task, index) => {\n      const taskEvents = task.events.slice().sort((a, b) => eventOrder