0.29/M) — extremely cheap. Supports **flexible dimensions 32-4096** (MRL) per the model page. The SiliconFlow API presumably supports the `dimensions` parameter (their docs mention flexible dims; the platform embed page says \"灵活的向量维度（32 到 4096）\").\n- MTEB multilingual: 8B = 70.58 (#1 as of June 2025), 4B ≈ 69+, 0.6B ≈ 64.3.\n\nSo the answer: **Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-8B**, with `dimensions: 1024` via MRL → zero structural change to Qdrant (vector_size stays 1024) and ES mapping. That's the ideal combo: top-tier quality + no infra rebuild + ¥20 covers ~¥0.29/M × years of usage ≈ 60M+ tokens.\n\nWait — need to double check SiliconFlow API supports `dimensions` param. The SiliconFlow docs for embeddings: their API is OpenAI-compatible POST /v1/embeddings with model, input, encoding_format... and I believe they support `dimensions` for Qwen3-Embedding series (the model card advertises 32-4096 flexible dims — that flexibility is exposed via the API's dimensions parameter). The search result from the official model page explicitly says \"提供灵活的向量维度（32 到 4096）\" on SiliconFlow's own site. Good enough to recommend with a \"先发一个请求验证\" step — and their startup verify_dimension self-check will catch it if the param doesn't work (dimension mismatch → boot fails fast). That's a nice safety net: if dimensions param isn't honored and returns 4096, verify_dimension(1024) fails → immediate feedback. And config fix would be adjusting... well if it can't do 1024, they'd need to rebuild at 4096 or fall back to 0.6B.\n\nAlso instruction-aware: Qwen3-Embedding supports instruction prefix for queries (improves retrieval ~1-5%). Optional; skip for simplicity, or mention as a later refinement.\n\nLatency: 8B FP8 on SiliconFlow serverless — fine.\n\nComparison with the 4 options:\n- VL-Embedding-8B: multimodal vision-language — unnecessary for text metadata (can't feed images anyway in their pipeline). Skip.\n- 8B: best quality, MRL dims → 1024 possible. ✅推荐\n- 4B: middle, 2560 max, MRL too (32-2560), $0.02/M? cheaper but quality below 8B. No reason over 8B at these prices.\n- 0.6B: 1024 native, cheapest ($0.01/M?), weakest. Only if latency matters.\n\n¥20 credit: at $0.04/M ≈ ¥0.29/M, ¥20 ≈ 69M tokens ≈ many years of their usage. \n\nAlso address: switching vendor Bailian → SiliconFlow: their client is OpenAIEmbeddings with base_url — works. provider stays \"dashscope\" branch (cosmetic naming — it's just the OpenAI-compatible branch). base_url = https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1, api_key = SiliconFlow key. One config nuance: `check_embedding_ctx_length=False` already set ✓ good for Chinese.\n\nAlso note the earlier plan (qwen3.7-text-embedding on Bailian) — compare: quality qwen3.7 vs Qwen3-Embedding-8B: qwen3.7 claims +20% over v4; MTEB unknown. Either is strong. But the user wants to use the ¥20 — recommend 8B on SiliconFlow; it also frees them from Bailian quota expiry. And their rerank idea: SiliconFlow has Qwen3-Rerank too for later.\n\nSwitch mechanics (same as before):\n1. config.yaml/.env: base_url → siliconflow, model → Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-8B, api_key → SF key, dimensions stay 1024, batch_size — SiliconFlow batch limit for embeddings: 32 texts per request? SiliconFlow /v1/embeddings batch limit is 32 I believe. Their batch_size 6 fine, could raise later.\n2. Rebuild vectors (metadata + dimension values ES/Qdrant), clear memory collections.\n3. Restart → verify_dimension self-check (1024 expected; catches param problems).\n\nKeep answer focused: recommendation = 8B (VL 排除理由一句话), table comparing 4, the dimensions=1024 trick, cost math, then offer to execute. Concise.","startTime":1791428023749,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023749},{"id":"5336c23e-b121-41d9-922f-d0f6924a196e","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"查完了，答案很明确：**选 Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-8B，并把输出维度设成 1024**。\n\n## 四个候选怎么排\n\n| 模型 | MTEB 多语言 | 判断 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Qwen3-Embedding-8B** | **70.58**（2025/6 榜一） | ✅ 推荐：质量天花板，且支持 32~4096 自定义维度 |\n| Qwen3-Embedding-4B | ~69 | 尴尬位：比 8B 便宜不了多少，质量低一档 |\n| Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B | ~64.3 | 只在追求最低延迟时选 |\n| Qwen3-VL-Embedding-8B | — | 视觉-语言多模态模型，你的管线只喂文本，用不上，排除 |\n\n## 为什么 8B 不会带来结构重建\n\n关键点：8B 支持 **MRL 自定义输出维度（32~4096）**，把 `dimensions` 设成 **1024**，就和你现在 Qdrant `vector_size: 1024`、ES 的 dense_vector mapping 完全兼容——**collection 结构一行都不用改**，只做一次全量重嵌（反正换模型本来就要做）。你的启动自检还会兜底：如果硅基流动没正确处理 dimensions 参数返回了 4096 维，`verify_dimension` 启动直接报错，不会静默劣化。\n\n## 费用：¥20 ≈ 用好几年\n\n- 硅基流动 8B 定价 **$0.04/百万 tokens ≈ ¥0.29/M**，比百炼 qwen3.7（¥0.5/M）还便宜\n- 你的年消耗撑死几百万 token → 全年不到 ¥2，**¥20 额度够用六七年**\n- 顺便摆脱了百炼免费额度 10/13 到期的计时炸弹\n\n## 切换清单（客户端零改动）\n\n你现在的 `OpenAIEmbeddings` 走 OpenAI 兼容接口，硅基流动完全兼容，只动配置：\n\n```\nbase_url: https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1\napi_key:  <硅基流动的 key>\nmodel_name: Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-8B\ndimensions: 1024          # 不变\nbatch_size: 6             # 先保持，稳了可以试 32\n```\n\n然后老三样：全量重嵌元数据（3 个 collection）→ 重建维度值（ES + Qdrant）→ 清空记忆 collections → 重启验证自检。\n\n一个后续可选优化：Qwen3-Embedding 支持 instruction-aware 查询前缀（查询侧加一句任务描述能再提一点召回），这个等切换稳定后可以试，不动存量。\n\n要我现在开始切吗？改配置 → 重建 → 自检，一轮搞定。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789700537572},{"id":"7a85a830-0c9a-441a-a79a-10d59b099425","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"那就切换一下吧","payload":{"query":"那就切换一下吧","rawMessage":"那就切换一下吧","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx","name":"execution-panel.tsx","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"76a0fa37-4916-4d6e-98c7-567479f5fcf4","requestedAt":1789700645572,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"7a85a830-0c9a-441a-a79a-10d59b099425"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"bcc9ce000688653c6d7465fa24c98