EL,text-embedding-v3}\n  # api_key: ${oc.env:DASHSCOPE_API_KEY,\"\"}\n  # base_url: ${oc.env:DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL,https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1}\n```\n\nWait — if provider is commented in the Bailian block... the provider line stays active (`openai-compatible`). Fine.\n\nCode changes:\n- embedding_client.py:45: `if self.config.provider == \"openai-compatible\":` — comment above stays.\n- config.py:162: `return self.model_name if self.provider == \"openai-compatible\" else self.model`\n\nCheck for other references to the literal provider \"dashscope\" (tests, scripts). auto_llm_adapter_demo.py uses LLM provider stuff, unrelated. Let me grep the whole repo (excluding hello-agent-project) for `\"dashscope\"` / `provider.*dashscope` to be safe. Also docs/ may mention it — docs are historical, fine, but let me check for as-built doc updates later. The standing deferred task mentions as-built docs — not needed now.\n\nAlso — memory: the deferred note \"optional hardening (collection model-name marker)\" — skip, not asked.\n\nOne important detail: `verify_dimension` in main.py — check what expected value it uses. Let me read main.py quickly around line 44. Also confirm startup log line to grep after restart.\n\nThen execute. Let me also confirm OmegaConf loads .env via dotenv in config.py — grep for load_dotenv.","startTime":1791428023749,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023749},{"id":"f61a203a-9a2b-4dfe-862e-3949491c6b6b","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"provider 只在 2 处硬编码 `\"dashscope\"` 分支判断。既然现在指向硅基流动，值改成与 llm 段一致的 `openai-compatible`（3 处小改，配置语义就不撒谎了）。确认一下 dotenv 加载和 main.py 自检参数："},{"id":"call_b37e9074c4384f31ac2cf9d5","type":"TOOL","toolName":"grep_content","params":{"-n":"true","glob":"*.py","head_limit":"30","output_mode":"content","path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis","pattern":"load_dotenv|verify_dimension|dashscope"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Found 8 matches\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_ana