toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"git -C /Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis add frontend/components/insight-agent/chat-run-progress.tsx && git -C /Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n聊天气泡：任务清单置顶，思考流折叠降高\n\n- 阶段时间线（含任务清单）移到上方，思考流作为二级信息放在下面\n- live 思考限高 max-h-24 并加底部渐隐，完成后折叠为「已思考」一行\n- 划分分析任务失败时在阶段行直接显示失败原因\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit chat bubble adjustments"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Command executed successfully.\nExit code: 0\nOutput:\n[main b75447f] 聊天气泡：任务清单置顶，思考流折叠降高\n 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)\n","metadata":{"cwd":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis","autoRun":true,"state":"completed","runMode":"yolo","taskId":"0uw5ta","output":"[main b75447f] 聊天气泡：任务清单置顶，思考流折叠降高\n 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)\n","exitCode":0,"inBackground":false}}},{"id":"call_a08afe4399074733a9f05e10","type":"TOOL","toolName":"update_task","params":{"status":"completed","taskId":"23"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Updated task #23 status","metadata":{"taskId":"23","updatedFields":["status"],"statusChange":{"from":"in_progress","to":"completed"},"ignoredDependencyIds":[],"taskSnapshot":{"$blob":"sha256:c5cfc2a16a7faa4e0e0b86fa5e10095dc6f6971a452a4d81dec1fcde7b87d83d","version":1,"encoding":"json","byteLength":7957,"compression":"none"}}}}]},{"id":"6aacd253b08fa821c7085626","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":16211},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"80908660-76ff-4ef5-bfad-dc340a1f2f67","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"All three tasks complete. Summarize what was done against the \"清晰可控\" requirement. Note: backend auto-reloaded (context.plan event), frontend is Next.js dev — hot reload. Suggest the user refresh and run a test question.\n\nKeep the summary tight — three commits, what changed, and what to look for when testing.","startTime":1791428023750,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023750},{"id":"a0f07395-347b-472a-b3ee-0c4b57efb69d","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"三件事全部落地，围绕“清晰、可控”：\n\n**`fe32834` — 事件统一识别 + 上下文透明化**\n排查中发现一个系统性 bug：harness 链路把节点事件归一化成 `tool.progress`+`custom_type`，而前端约 15 处按原始 `type` 匹配——**任务完成后会一直卡“执行中”、报告里程碑永远不出现**（你之前截图里“执行数据查询 0/1”部分源于此）。统一走 `customEventOf` 识别后，任务状态、phase 链、报告里程碑在 harness 模式下才真正开始工作。\n同时后端补发 `context.plan` 事件（召回组合决策 + 候选/选中数 + token 数），进度页“理解问题并召回上下文”现在会显示：`路由：数据分析 · 召回 12/34 项 · 8.2k tokens`。\n\n**`6dfdace` — 进度页 v3**\n- 头部压缩成一行：当前活动 + 已用时间；下面是 **4 段分段条**（理解→划分→执行→报告，颜色即状态）——替代长任务期间永远 0% 的百分比条\n- 里程碑保留（骨架），下面新增**执行明细活动流**：时间倒序、每条一行、点击展开 JSON 详情（Devin 式）\n- 底部**任务清单**：状态 + 当前 phase + 失败原因\n\n**`b75447f` — 气泡调整**\n- 阶段时间线（含任务清单）移到上方，思考流降到下方\n- live 思考限高 6 行 + 底部渐隐（原来是 10 行裸滚），完成后折叠成“已思考”一行\n- 划分分析任务失败时，阶段行直接显示原因\n\n验证方式：跑一个“查询2017年每个月的销售额”看完整链路——气泡里任务清单在上、思考收成一行；进度页三分段条逐步点亮、执行明细可逐条展开、任务清单在底部。有问题随时说，`--reload` 和前端热更都是即时的。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789710948195},{"id":"93732344-8cc5-4c05-8885-d0985b8b7b68","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"要不进度不要了？","payload":{"query":"要不进度不要了？","rawMessage":"要不进度不要了？","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx","name":"execution-panel.tsx","type":"CURRENT_FILE"},{"id":"624922","name":"image.png","content":"https://comate.baidu.com/api/aidevops/autocomate/rest/autowork/v1/file/stream/624922?authorization=NjFjYWEwODUtMGY0Ni00YTYyLTg1NjEtN2Y0MmJlYWJlNzYx","type":"IMAGE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"7f1c49fa-053c-447c-a24c-899139943b87","requestedAt":1789712029795,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"93732344-8cc5-4c05-8885-d0985b8b7b68"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"bcc9ce000688653c6d7465fa24c98828a8335cc1","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]}},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1789712030217},{"id":"f96c7c6d-3793-4825-9a69-d070db8ec69f","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"93732344-8cc5-4c05-8885-d0985b8b7b68","reportedId":"67d7830f-66f9-42c8-a09a-dfa097c882a1","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Comate"},"role":"assistant","status":"cancelled","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":22.63,"contextUsed":57941,"contextLimit":256000,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"performanceMetrics":{"firstTokenLatency":2427,"totalDuration":477528},"appliedRuleNames":[],"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"6aacd6a1e5abac4a687df98f","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":72905},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"b578c772-0db7-4ca1-943a-bbee9d77407d","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"The user shows a screenshot after running a new query. The right panel (执行过程) shows the \"步骤返回\" tab active with 第1轮 (success: 开始执行 → 构建上下文 → 任务划分 → 提交动作 → 执行工具) and 第2轮 (running: 构建上下文 → 任务划分). The \"进度\" tab is NOT selected in this screenshot — they're on 步骤返回 tab. The bubble looks good now (task list ✓✓✓, 生成 SQL 已思考 collapsed).\n\nUser asks: \"要不进度不要了？\" — \"How about we just drop the 进度 (tab)?\"\n\nThey're suggesting removing the 进度 tab from the execution panel since the bubble already shows the timeline nicely and the panel has 步骤返回 + 工具与事件 tabs. The screenshot shows them on the 步骤返回 tab with round grouping.\n\nLet me think about this honestly. Arguments:\n\n**For removing the 进度 tab:**\n- The bubble now carries the live progress (stages + tasks + thinking) — duplication with the panel's progress tab is real. I noted this myself in the case study (\"聊天与面板分工\").\n- The panel's 进度 tab content (headlines, segments, milestones, activity feed, task list) largely mirrors what the bubble shows live. After completion, the chip + bubble remain.\n- Two places showing the same thing = maintenance burden and cognitive load.\n- 步骤返回 (step returns, grouped by round) + 工具与事件 (all events) cover the drill-down needs.\n\n**Against removing entirely:**\n- During a live run, if the user is looking at the panel (e.g., wider screen, they opened it), the 进度 tab gives the \"at a glance\" state. But the bubble gives that too.\n- Historical runs: when you open an old conversation's execution trace, the bubble shows only the summary chip; the 步骤返回 tab shows rounds/steps. A \"progress\" view for historical runs? The segments/milestones are derivable from trace events — but is it needed? 步骤返回 rounds already tell the story.\n\nHmm — but wait. There's a nuance: the panel has three tabs: 进度 / 步骤返回 / 工具与事件. The user's proposal: remove 进度 tab, keep 步骤返回 + 工具与事件. Then the panel becomes purely a \"detail/drill-down\" tool (Devin's computer panel), while the chat bubble is the progress surface (Manus pattern). That's actually the CLEAN division I recommended in the case study: 聊天里只放叙事级摘要，原始细节全部收进面板. So removing 进度 tab aligns with the north star.\n\nBut what about useful unique bits in 进度 tab that would be lost?\n1. 分段条 + headline — bubble covers live; after done, chip covers.\n2. 里程碑 detail (路由/召回统计) — would be lost from a dedicated view; but it's in 执行明细/event JSON (context.plan event visible in 工具与事件; and question_route in 步骤返回). Acceptable.\n3. 活动流 (activity feed) — 工具与事件 tab already IS that (chronological EventDetails list). So the feed is redundant with 工具与事件.\n4. 任务清单 — in 步骤返回 TaskCards + bubble.\n5. failure reason display (planner.failed error_message) — in 步骤返回 planner node events payload + bubble planFailureMessage. OK.\n\nSo removing 进度 tab loses almost nothing that isn't elsewhere. The main thing: default tab would become 步骤返回 (or 工具与事件).\n\nAlso the panel header text \"实时展示本次运行的总体进度、任务返回和节点事件\" should be updated. And the ExecutionPanel default tab state (\"progress\") → \"returns\". Tab count 3 → 2 (grid-cols-3 → grid-cols-2).\n\nWhat about ProgressView code? If we remove the tab, ProgressView + deriveProgressMilestones + deriveProgressHeadline + ProgressMilestoneRow + segmentColor + ProgressActivityFeed + ProgressTaskList become dead code — delete them (不做无用兼容/死代码原则). But careful: exports from execution-panel used by chat-run-progress: buildTasks, customEventOf, formatDuration, progressKind, runFailed, StatusIcon, DebugEvent, RunStatus, TaskSummary — all still used. ProgressView/derive* are internal. RunStatus etc. stay.\n\nWait — also chat-session-view imports? It imports ChatRunTimeline/ChatRunSummaryChip from chat-run-progress; RunProgressContext uses DebugEvent[]. Fine.\n\nHmm, but should I push back? The user asks \"要不进度不要了？\" — half question half proposal. My honest assessment: yes, remove it — it now duplicates the bubble, and the panel's other two tabs cover drill-down. This matches the Manus/Devin division of labor. But one consideration: during live runs the bubble is in the chat flow which auto-scrolls; the panel 进度 tab was a stable place to watch. Removing means the panel default view = 步骤返回 rounds which DO update live (第2轮 running with phase chain — screenshot shows it live-updating). So the panel still shows liveness via 步骤返回. Good.\n\nAlso the round grouping in 步骤返回 (第1轮/第2轮) — visible in screenshot, works.\n\nDecision: agree + implement removal:\n1. ExecutionPanel: remove 进度 tab (TabsTrigger + TabsContent), default tab \"returns\", grid-cols-3 → grid-cols-2, header subtitle update.\n2. Delete dead code: ProgressView, deriveProgressMilestones, deriveProgressHeadline, ProgressMilestoneRow, segmentColor, ProgressActivityFeed, ProgressTaskList, ProgressPhase/ProgressMilestone interfaces, and now-unused imports (segmentColor helpers etc.). Also ROUTE_MODE_LABELS/formatTokens (used only by deriveProgressMilestones) — remove. customEventOf stays (used by buildTasks/taskStatus etc.). displayEvents/compactAllEvents stay (used by nodeGroups + AllEvents).\n3. Check unused imports after removal (Loader2? XCircle? CheckCircle2? — StatusIcon uses them; EventDetails uses ChevronRight; headlineIcon used Loader2/XCircle/AlertCircle/CheckCircle2 — AlertCircle might become unused if only headline used it. Check StatusIcon implementation imports. Also `terminal` function — used by ProgressView? terminal() used in taskStatus? `terminal(task.status)` was removed from ProgressView; terminal is used in... deriveRunStages in chat has its own taskTerminal. In execution-panel, terminal() used by currentEvents (terminal(event.status)) — stays. useState/useEffect/useRef — ProgressView used useState/useEffect for the timer; ExecutionPanel uses useState/useRef. useEffect might become unused if only ProgressView used it — check. useCallback? no.\n\nLet me also reconsider: maybe keep it simple and NOT delete the code but just remove the tab? No — dead code violates user's stated principle (不做无用兼容; they've asked to delete dead event mappings before, task #15 \"删除永不触发的事件死映射\"). Delete.\n\n4. Panel header subtitle: \"实时展示本次运行的总体进度、任务返回和节点事件\" → \"按轮次回看任务返回与节点事件，聊天区展示实时进度\" or similar. Also the bottom bar text \"正在执行/本次执行已结束/等待提问\" stays.\n\nAlso — the summary chip in bubble \"查看执行过程\" opens the panel (traceToggle). Default tab becomes 步骤返回 — good for that purpose.\n\nWait — one more: the \"工具与事件 22\" tab (AllEvents) and \"步骤返回 7\". Keep both.\n\nAlso verify no other component imports ProgressView etc. (they're internal, not exported — check exports of execution-panel: RunStatus, TaskSummary, StatusIcon, buildTasks, progressKind, runFailed, eventTimestampMs, formatDuration, customEventOf, DebugEvent, StreamEvent, appendExecutionEvent, ExecutionPanel. eventTimestampMs — used by chat? chat imports formatDuration etc. eventTimestampMs exported — used in chat-run-progress? No (imports list: buildTasks, customEventOf, formatDuration, progressKind, runFailed, StatusIcon). eventTimestampMs used internally by... derive