有判定复用已有的 `progressKind` / `customEventOf` / `mainStep`，不新写一套类型匹配**——这是这次唯一的逻辑点，保证 harness 归一化形态（`tool.progress + custom_type`）和旧 agent 原始 type 两种形态都被覆盖。\n- 一个 `CategoryIcon({ category })` 小组件 + 一张 `CATEGORY_ICONS` 映射表；识别不出的类别返回 `null`（不加图标，不做兜底装饰）。\n- 插入点共 4 处：`EventDetails`、`StepCard`、`RoundCard`、`TaskCard`/Drawer trigger（Drawer 本身由调用方传 trigger，改调用处即可）。\n- 纯前端展示派生：不改后端、不改事件结构、不引新依赖。\n- 体量：约 40~50 行。\n\n## 验证\n\n跑一次 analysis 运行，两个 tab 核对链路：构建上下文（Layers）→ 判断问题路由（Compass）→ 分析计划（ListTree）→ 任务步骤里的思考行（Brain violet）→ 执行 SQL（Database）→ 最终报告（FileText）+ `tsc --noEmit` 无新增错误。\n\n要调整的话说一声（比如图标选型、颜色版本），确认后我就动手。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789713528811},{"id":"8e0e48f9-78f7-4868-ab48-1f2bde482948","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"ok，开工吧","payload":{"query":"ok，开工吧","rawMessage":"ok，开工吧","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx","name":"execution-panel.tsx","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"0a7a2135-5007-4f1b-8214-d491900ecd51","requestedAt":1789713579042,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"8e0e48f9-78f7-4868-ab48-1f2bde482948"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"bcc9ce000688653c6d7465fa24c98828a8335cc1","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]}},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1789713579066},{"id":"45a452ee-2bc1-45b7-a88d-4d09b10469c5","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"8e0e48f9-78f7-4868-ab48-1f2bde482948","reportedId":"98320da4-8f37-4202-98d4-f7dece65018f","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Comate"},"role":"assistant","status":"cancelled","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":35.1,"contextUsed":89856,"contextLimit":256000,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"performanceMetrics":{"firstTokenLatency":963,"totalDuration":389617},"appliedRuleNames":[],"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"6aacdcacb7e22404df6e9efd","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":102020},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"1f5b229b-7e12-4357-9e20-44a0b0a41887","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"User approved. Implement the plan:\n\n1. Add `eventCategory(event)` pure function near `progressKind`\n2. Add `CATEGORY_ICONS` map + `CategoryIcon` component\n3. Insert capability icon at:\n   - `EventDetails` (:748) — after label text\n   - `StepCard` (:768) — before title\n   - `RoundCard` (:772) — before title\n   - `TaskCard` trigger (:777) — before title\n   - node Drawer trigger in StepCard — before title? The plan said TaskCard/Drawer trigger. Node Drawer trigger is inside StepCard. Let me handle both.\n4. Module-level derivation: first non-progress event's category; thinking doesn't participate in group-level.\n\nLet me re-read the exact current code of the components I need to modify:\n- EventDetails :748-750 (already read above, line 749 is the giant one-liner)\n- StepCard :768-770\n- RoundCard :772-774\n- TaskCard :777 — need to read\n- TaskBody maybe not needed\n- Also check what eventCategory needs: progressKind, customEventOf are module-level. event.step is the normalized mainStep.\n\nDesign:\n\n```tsx\ntype EventCategory = \"thinking\" | \"planning\" | \"route\" | \"context\" | \"data\" | \"report\" | \"confirm\" | \"run\";\n\n/** 能力类别：表达这行/这个模块产出什么，与 StatusIcon 表达的「跑得怎么样」正交。识别不出返回 null，不加图标。 */\nexport function eventCategory(event: DebugEvent): EventCategory | null {\n  const kind = progressKind(event);\n  if (kind === \"reasoning\" || kind === \"llm\") return \"thinking\";\n  if (customEventOf(event, \"question_route\")) return \"route\";\n  if (customEventOf(event, \"analysis_plan\") || event.type.startsWith(\"planner.\") || customEventOf(event, \"report_plan_result\")) return \"planning\";\n  if (customEventOf(event, \"analysis_task_phase\") || customEventOf(event, \"analysis_task_resolved\") || customEventOf(event, \"analysis_task_result\")) return \"data\";\n  if (customEventOf(event, \"rendered_report\")) return \"report\";\n  if (event.type.startsWith(\"context.\")) return \"context\";\n  if (event.type.startsWith(\"confirmation.\")) return \"confirm\";\n  if (event.type.startsWith(\"run.\") || event.type === \"stream.failed\") return \"run\";\n  // 数据执行类：SQL 生成/执行与各类召回（老 agent 链路靠 mainStep 归一后的 step 判断）\n  if (event.type.startsWith(\"tool.\") || event.type === \"action.committed\" || event.type === \"progress\") {\n    const step = event.step;\n    if (step === \"生成 SQL\" || step === \"执行 SQL\" || step === \"整理 SQL 上下文\" || step.startsWith(\"召回\") || step === \"过滤指标\" || step === \"过滤表\" || step === \"增强查询结果\") return \"data\";\n  }\n  return null;\n}\n```\n\nWait — careful. For tool.* events in harness mode: `tool.started/tool.completed/tool.failed` with tool_name. `event.step` for those is mainStep(sourceStep, type) → \"执行工具\" since type.startsWith(\"tool.\"). Hmm, mainStep: `if (type.startsWith(\"tool.\")) return \"执行工具\";` — so harness tool events have step=\"执行工具\" regardless of sourceStep. So for tool.* events, better look at sourceStep? sourceStep for tool.started from harness would be the original step value. Let me think about what sourceStep is for harness tool events: the writer emits events with step... In the harness path, events come with step names like \"生成 SQL\" etc. via step fields. makeEvent: sourceStep = event.step trimmed. type = \"tool.started\". mainStep returns \"执行工具\" for all tool.* types. So the normalized step loses the detail; sourceStep keeps it.\n\nSo for data category, check `event.sourceStep` too. Let me use sourceStep matching the same patterns: sourceStep.startsWith(\"生成 SQL\") / \"执行 SQL\" / \"召回\" / \"过滤\" / \"整理 SQL 上下文\" / \"补全过滤后的上下文\" / \"增强查询结果\" / \"执行分析任务\".\n\nSimpler: check both event.step and event.sourceStep against the pattern list. Actually since event.step = mainStep(sourceStep, type), and mainStep output for these data steps is exactly the normalized names, checking event.step suffices for old-agent events. For harness tool.* events, event.step === \"执行工具\" but sourceStep retains e.g. \"生成 SQL\". So check both:\n\n```ts\nconst stepText = event.step === \"执行工具\" ? event.sourceStep : event.step;\n```\n\nHmm, that's getting fiddly. Alternative: match against a list of prefixes against sourceStep OR step:\n\n```ts\nconst DATA_STEP_PREFIXES = [\"生成 SQL\", \"执行 SQL\", \"整理 SQL 上下文\", \"补全过滤后的上下文\", \"补充 SQL 生成上下文\", \"召回\", \"过滤指标\", \"过滤表\", \"增强查询结果\", \"执行分析任务\"];\nif (DATA_STEP_PREFIXES.some((prefix) => event.sourceStep.startsWith(prefix) || event.step.startsWith(prefix))) return \"data\";\n```\n\nWait but \"执行分析任务\" for harness path: analysis_task_phase events come as tool.progress with custom_type, already caught above by customEventOf checks. The step \"执行分析任务\" (sourceStep) also appears. Including it in data is fine.\n\nBut careful about ordering: check planning before data, because analysis_plan arrives as tool.progress + custom_type — caught by customEventOf(event, \"analysis_plan\") → planning. Good.\n\nAlso `question_route` → route before planning? No overlap.\n\nWhat about tool.started/tool.completed for the analysis tasks themselves (harness)? Their sourceStep might be \"执行分析任务\" → data. Good.\n\nWhat about \"汇总全部分析证据\"/\"生成报告规划\"/\"渲染最终报告\"? mainStep normalizes to those. Report category: only `rendered_report` → report per plan. But \"生成报告规划\" → planning per plan (report_plan_result covers harness; old-agent sourceStep \"生成报告规划\" → planning?). Plan's table said 规划 includes report_plan_result. Old agent: \"生成报告规划\" step. Let me include step/sourceStep === \"生成报告规划\" → planning. And \"渲染最终报告\" → report. \"汇总全部分析证据\" → data? It's an LLM summarization step... but category is about module capability. Keep it data? Hmm — 汇总分析证据 is part of report generation arguably. Keep simple: not matched → null. Actually let me not over-engineer; the plan's table is the contract:\n\n- thinking: progressKind reasoning/llm\n- route: question_route\n- planning: analysis_plan, planner.*, report_plan_result\n- data: analysis_task_*, SQL/召回/过滤/增强 steps (sourceStep fallback for harness tool events)\n- report: rendered_report\n- context: context.*\n- confirm: confirmation.*\n- run: run.*, stream.failed\n- else null\n\nFor \"生成报告规划\"/\"渲染最终报告\" old-agent steps — 渲染最终报告 is the old equivalent of rendered_report → report. 生成报告规划 → planning. I'll add these two step checks since they're real old-agent steps (mainStep normalizes them). Small, principled.\n\nCategoryIcon component:\n\n```tsx\nconst CATEGORY_ICONS: Record<EventCategory, LucideIcon> = {\n  thinking: Brain,\n  planning: ListTree,\n  route: Compass,\n  context: Layers,\n  data: Database,\n  report: FileText,\n  confirm: Hand,\n  run: Flag,\n};\n\nconst CATEGORY_TONES: Record<EventCategory, string> = {\n  thinking: \"text-violet-500\",\n  planning: \"text-slate-400\",\n  ...\n};\n\nfunction CategoryIcon({ event }: { event: DebugEvent }) — inline variant: renders icon after label\nfunction CategoryIconOf(category) — generic\n```\n\nSimpler: one component `CapabilityIcon({ category, className })` and a helper `groupCategory(events)`:\n\n```ts\n/** 模块分组行的能力类别：取组内首个可识别的非流式事件的类别；思考流是子产物，不参与组级判定。 */\nfunction groupCategory(events: DebugEvent[]): EventCategory | null {\n  const found = events.find((event) => !STREAM_EVENT_TYPES.has(event.type) && progressKind(event) === \"progress\" && eventCategory(event));\n  return found ? eventCategory(found) : null;\n}\n```\n\nHmm wait: progressKind(event) === \"progress\" — for non-tool.progress events, progressKind returns \"progress\" (custom_type undefined). For tool.progress with custom_type rea