ategory(found) : null;\n}\n```\n\nBut do I still need !STREAM_EVENT_TYPES? A reasoning_chunk (old agent) in events list — eventCategory now returns thinking (after fix) → excluded by !== \"thinking\" ✓. So drop STREAM/progressKind filters — cleaner. But wait: could a group contain ONLY thinking events? Then groupCategory → null → no icon. Fine.\n\nOne more consideration: StepGroup events for harness: group \"构建上下文\" contains context.* + tool.progress custom_type=question_route → groupCategory → first event... events in group order? buildStepGroups groups by step preserving insertion order (rawEvents sorted by eventOrder). First recognizable event = likely context.started → context ✓. The 判断问题路由 group → question_route → route ✓. \"分析计划\" group (harness: step for analysis_plan tool.progress = mainStep(sourceStep)... its step label — whatever, category from custom_type analysis_plan → planning ✓). \"执行分析任务\" tasks group → fallback data ✓.\n\nnodeGroups derive from visible events per node — e.g. node \"analysis_agent\" with question_route + reasoning chunks → route ✓ (thinking excluded).\n\nEventDetails line-level: merged reasoning event (old agent type reasoning_chunk after compact) → thinking ✓ after fix. Harness merged tool.progress custom_type reasoning_chunk → progressKind reasoning → thinking ✓.\n\nLet me rewrite eventCategory + groupCategory with the rawType normalization. Also double-check: rawType for context.plan (direct) = \"context.plan\" → context ✓ (check order: planning check rawType.startsWith(\"planner.\") — context.plan doesn't match; data check no; report no; context: rawType.startsWith(\"context.\") ✓).\n\nWait, ordering issue: rawType === \"report_plan_result\" → planning ✓ before report check ✓. rendered_report → report ✓.\n\nAlso confirm scope checks (event.type === \"action.committed\" || \"progress\" || tool.*) remain for step-based data/report planning matching — with rawType, \"progress\" type events keep rawType = \"progress\" → fall to scoped block ✓.\n\nNow rewrite the function block.","startTime":1791428023750,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023750},{"id":"42538fb7-88dd-403e-87a8-45ccea0cdc2b","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"发现一个逻辑漏洞需要修：老 agent 链路的 `reasoning_chunk`/`llm_chunk` 是原始 type（没有 `custom_type`），`progressKind` 对它们返回 `\"progress\"`，会漏判成非思考流。用 `custom_type ?? type` 归一化原始事件名来修，判定也更收敛："},{"id":"call_f45ac39eb3744c9b9fbeb7e3","type":"TOOL","toolName":"edit_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx","new_string":{"$blob":"sha256:efab67db809c804a0500d61b4328205344826a3c93fc57e12192b1216a6d2c87","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":1922,"compression":"none"},"old_string":{"$blob":"sha256:c66f37c6948125a2e8d132c7da8b0dbeeb3f96fcaf27544c1c10ac42d2b57f74","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":1743,"compression":"none"},"replace_all":"false"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"relativePath":"frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx","absolutePath":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend/components/insight-agent/execution-panel.tsx","resolution":"absolute","content":{"$blob":"sha256:0de9f9bc4c3b0ea21c8e976f96a09c0ece50043d943255f5204886effb8f4fd0","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":50265,"compression":"none"},"originalContent":{"$blob":"sha256:5e2c4703ae5e98270451bd8ef81c6a35a0c581986ef3de8bf8462a4ca5b96b3b","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":50086,"compression":"none"},"askReview":false,"diff":{"add":13,"remove":8},"runMode":"yolo"}},"accepted":true,"isRebuilt":true}]},{"id":"6aacde09233325005315f4b3","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":10991},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"call_319739a25742412f88461a65","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"cd \"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/frontend\" && npx tsc --noEmit 2>&1 | grep -v \"sidebar.tsx\" | gre