result` / `analysis_result` / `rendered_report`，报告工具按它校验可否渲染 | `build_report/tool.py:72-79` |\n\n## 在一次运行里的流转\n\n```\n工具执行 ──▶ ToolRuntime 落库，拿到 result_ref（runtime.py:112-125）\n              │\n              ▼\nRunObservation（summary + result_ref）──▶ 进入运行状态，规划器据此决定下一步\n              │\n              ▼\nbuild_report 凭 result_refs 读上游 Artifact 渲染报告（tool.py:48-50）\n              │\n              ▼\n报告自己也落成 rendered_report Artifact ──▶ 收口时 final_output_ref 写进收口记录（service.py:174）\n```\n\n打个比方：Artifact 之于工具结果，就像**取件码之于包裹**——包裹（完整结果）放仓库（PG），流转过程中递的只是取件码（result_ref），而且取件必须核验本人身份（完整运行五元组）。\n\n按惯例已把这条语义补进 [`contracts.py`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/state_result_store/contracts.py) 的 `RunObservation.result_ref` 注释（这是引用在核心契约里露面的地方），提交 `8c88f64`。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789724770444},{"id":"82c2e316-6d93-4bd6-be40-e57726b6c441","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":" @data_agent_harness_asbuilt.md  1.4术语表中增加这个，简短写就行","payload":{"query":" @data_agent_harness_asbuilt.md  1.4术语表中增加这个，简短写就行","rawMessage":"$[data_agent_harness_asbuilt.md](file:docs/data_agent_harness_asbuilt.md) 1.4术语表中增加这个，简短写就行","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"docs/data_agent_harness_asbuilt.md","name":"docs/data_agent_harness_asbuilt.md","type":"FILE"},{"id":"app/agent/state_result_store/contracts.py","name":"contracts.py","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"46a31709-1d66-4d4b-ac2c-f8e64f311e8f","requestedAt":1789724898688,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"82c2e316-6d93-4bd6-be40-e57726b6c441"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"bcc9ce00068