 必然使用，且报告自身也是一个 Artifact。\n\nShould this be committed anywhere? The user is confirming understanding, not asking a question requiring comment supplement. No code comment needed — this is conversational validation. Maybe add to the glossary? No — they didn't ask. Keep it conversational and short. Confirm their understanding with the precise pipeline and one refinement (result_kind gate + report necessarily consumes + report itself is an artifact).\n\nKeep response short — validate, refine two points, tiny diagram. No commit needed (nothing asked to write). Actually the standing rule is about \"问了\" (asked questions about semantics) → write comments. This is a statement of understanding to verify. No file changes warranted.","startTime":1791428023751,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023751},{"id":"dafb11a1-5ed8-4a43-b964-2eaddf21641e","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"理解完全正确，就是这两句话。补两个精确化的细节，让心智模型更完整：\n\n1. **不是所有工具结果都产出 Artifact——由 ToolSpec 的 `result_kind` 决定**（[`contracts.py:233`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/state_result_store/contracts.py#L233)）：`inline_summary` 只回摘要不落库；当前三个工具全部是 `artifact`/`report`，所以实践中每次工具调用都产出 Artifact。\n\n2. **最终报告不是“可能使用”而是“必然使用”**——`build_report` 的入参 schema 里 `result_refs` 是必填项且至少 1 个（`harness.py:222-230`），没有上游产物它根本无法调用；而且**报告本身也会产出一个 Artifact**（`rendered_report`），收口时 `final_output_ref` 指向的就是它。\n\n完整链路一句话串起来：\n\n```\nquery_data / analyze_data ──产出──▶ query_result / analysis_result Artifact\n        │                                    │\n        └── observation 只带 summary+result_ref 给规划器\n                                             │\nbuild_report ◀──凭 result_refs 读内容────────┘\n        │\n        └──产出──▶ rendered_report Artifact ──▶ 收口 final_output_ref\n```\n\n另外记住一条边界：**读 Artifact 内容的只有两处**——报告工具（渲染时）和收口服务（history_saved 阶段导出结构化产物）；规划器从头到尾只看摘要和引用，看不到原始数据。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789725042839},{"id":"daafe42e-fc5d-433b-95cb-c06260c51eaf","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"