_graph.py — was it compiled with a checkpointer? Need to check. The agent_graph in graph.py:100 `agent_graph = build_agent_graph()` — compiled with checkpointer=None by default (build_agent_graph takes checkpointer param, called with none at module level). AgentService probably recompiles with checkpointer. \n\n2. **Harness LoopController state** — dict {\"user_id\"...,\"harness\": HarnessControlState} — persisted to harness_runs via PostgresHarnessRunStore. This is NOT AgentState per se, though HarnessGraphState(AgentState) adds harness+project_id fields. Hmm — HarnessGraphState is the state schema for... what graph? Let me think: the controller saves `state` dict to run_store — its keys are user_id/conversation_id/thread_id/turn_id/run_id/asset_ids/harness (+ observations? observations list is inside harness: state[\"harness\"][\"observations\"]). So controller state ≠ AgentState. HarnessGraphState seems to be a schema for a graph that includes harness control — maybe the LoopController's LangGraph? From summary: \"controller.py:1132: \"thread_id\": command.run_ref.thread_id\" and \"controller.py:1210: thread_id=state[\"thread_id\"]\" — the controller likely compiles an internal LangGraph with HarnessGraphState schema and a PG checkpointer (checkpointer mentioned in PG list). Indeed as-built 1.1: \"PG[(PostgreSQL harness_runs / checkpointer / 会话)]\" — checkpointer = LangGraph checkpoint for harness graph.\n\nSo the accurate picture:\n\n- **AgentState（旧图状态）**：默认在内存里流转。两个持久化例外：\n  a) 旧图在独立 AgentService 路径（/agent/run）如果带 checkpointer 编译且调用带 thread config，checkpoint 会落 PG（thread_id = conversation_id）。需要验证 graph.py:100 build_agent_graph() 无参编译 → checkpointer=None → 模块级 agent_graph 无持久化。AgentService.arun 用的哪个图实例？agent_service.py:149 \"thread_id\": conversation_id — hmm that suggests it does config with thread_id. Let me check whether AgentService compiles with checkpointer. Earlier grep showed agent_service.py:149 `\"thread_id\": conversation_id,` and :298 thread_id=identity[\"thread_id\"] — that's building config for astream presumably. If checkpointer=None, config thread_id is harmless (no persistence).\n  \n  Actually I should verify: does AgentService use agent_graph (no checkpointer)? Or build with the PG checkpointer? Let me grep checkpointer in agent_service.py.\n\n  b) **工具结果不进 AgentState 的持久化**——Harness 路径下，工具的完整结果不写进 controller state（state 里只有 observations 摘要 + result_ref）；完整结果进 harness_artifacts 表。这也正是\"AgentState 在内存\"的另一半真相：Harness 的 run_store 存的是控制现场（含 observations 摘要），完整数据在 artifacts。\n\n- **Harness 控制状态**（harness 子字典 + 身份）→ harness_runs 表 JSONB（这就是\"进 PG 的部分\"）。\n- **LangGraph checkpointer**：harness 的内部图（若用）checkpoint 进 PG；旧图 query_graph 在工具内调用时不带 checkpointer（无 config）→ 纯内存。\n\nTo answer \"AgentState 是在内存当中，并没有进入到PG\" — mostly correct with nuance: AgentState 本体（旧图状态）确实不直接落库；落 PG 的是三样东西：① Harness 控制现场（harness_runs，含身份五元组+控制字段+observations 摘要）；② 工具完整结果（harness_artifacts）；③ 会话消息/执行轨迹（conversations 表，finish_turn 写）。而 messages 沉淀走 finalize_turn → ConversationMessageModel。让我验证 agent_service 是否用 checkpointer，避免说错。\n\nLet me check:\n1. agent_service.py — checkpointer usage, which graph it runs (agent_graph?).\n2. query_data tool: query_graph.astream without config → confirm no checkpointer on query_graph (query_graph.py compile line).\n3. confirm controller state content (observations inside harness dict).\n\nQuick greps:\n- Grep \"checkpointer\" in app/agent/query_graph.py, app/services/agent_service.py, app/agent/graph.py, controller.py.\n\nThen compose the answer:\n\n**Part 1: AgentState 的存储真相** — 对，旧图状态本体是内存态。真正进 PG 的是：\n| 数据 | 去向 | 写入者 |\n- Harness 控制现场（身份五元组 + harness 控制字段 + observations 摘要）→ harness_runs（run_store.save，每个 phase 边界）\n- 工具完整结果 → harness_artifacts（ToolRuntime）\n- 会话消息 + 执行轨迹 → conversations/turns/messages + execution_trace（start_turn/finish_turn/save_execution_trace）\n- LangGraph checkpoint（harness 内部图，若走 checkpointer）→ PG checkpointer\n而 AgentState 只在旧图单次执行期间存活；Harness 每轮 rebuild context 时靠 observations 摘要 + CompiledContext 重建\"事实\"，不重放完整旧图 state。旧图 standalone 路径（/agent/run）的 checkpoint 情况——verify。\n\n**Part 2: 三个工具分工**\n- query_data：单问数链适配器（关键词→四路召回→过滤→SQL→执行→维度映射）→ query_result Artifact\n- analyze_data：深度分析适配器（plan_analysis→execute_analysis，任务级查询+计算+证据）→ analysis_result Artifact\n- build_report：报告适配器（读上游 Artifact → 归一化任务 → 报告规划 → 渲染）→ rendered_report Artifact\n\n**Part 3: 数据联动机制** — 核心是 **Artifact 引用接力**：\n1. Planner 在第 N 轮调用 query_data/analyze_data → ToolRuntime 执行 → 完整结果落 Artifact → RunObservation 只带 summary + result_ref 进 controller state\n2. Planner 看到 observations 里的 result_ref → 第 N+1 轮决策 build_report，把 result_refs 传进去\n3. build_report 凭完整运行身份经 artifact_store.read 拉完整结果 → 归一化任务 → 渲染 → 自己也落 rendered_report Artifact\n4. 收口时 final_output_ref 指向报告 Artifact；history_saved 阶段按引用读取导出\n联动不通过共享内存 state，而通过 PG 里的 Artifact + 规划器手里的引用字符串——这正是崩溃可恢复的原因（内存丢了，引用还在库里）。\n\nAlso 联动的另一条线：observations 累积进 harness state（摘要级）→ planner 每轮看到历史摘要 → 决定下一步。So 联动 = 引用接力 + 摘要累积。\n\nLet me verify the checkpointer questions quickly before answering. Grep checkpointer across app/.","startTime":1791428023752,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023752},{"id":"7ef5de0f-af3e-4b5f-91d1-f41a63be6e0e","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"先核实两个关键事实（AgentState 到底有没有进 PG、query_graph 编译时带不带 checkpointer），再回答："},{"id":"call_e4136fd4bc3b4cf5b5805d83","type":"TOOL","toolName":"grep_content","params":{"-n":"true","output_mode":"content","path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app","pattern":"checkpointer|AsyncPostgresSaver|build_agent_graph\\("},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Found 3 matches\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/graph.py:\n  Line 57: def build_agent_graph(checkpointer: Any = None):\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/graph.py:\n  Line 97:     return graph.compile(checkpointer=checkpointer)\n\n/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/graph.py:\n  Line 100: agent_graph = build_agent_graph()","metadata":{"pattern":"checkpointer|AsyncPostgresSaver|build_agent_graph\\(","relevantFiles":[{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/graph.py","startLine":57,"endLine":57},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/graph.py","startLine":97,"endLine":97},{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/graph.py","startLine":100,"endLine":100}]}}}]},{"id":"6ab09b07e5abac4a68824ab4","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":49477},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"4e553cb5-294a-43b9-bee7-9fe0c672eb61","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"Confirmed:\n- `agent_graph = build_agent_graph()` — compiled with `checkpointer=None`. No other checkpointer usage anywhere in app/ (the \"checkpointer\" mention in the as-built PG box refers to... nothing implemented? Interesting — the as-built architecture diagram says \"PG harness_runs / checkpointer / 会话\" but grep shows no checkpointer in app code. Wait — earlier task list mentioned \"checkpointer_saved\" stage in finalization = \"终态真正落库（status=terminal + run_store.save）\" — that's the FINALIZATION stage NAME \"checkpoint_saved\", not a LangGraph checkpointer! So the as-built's \"checkpointer\" in the PG box is a leftover/mislabel — actually looking at as-built line 50: \"PG[(PostgreSQL harness_runs / checkpointer / 会话)]\" — hmm, that likely refers to the checkpoint_saved concept i.e., run state. Fine — the key verified fact: **no LangGraph checkpointer anywhere; graphs run stateless in memory**.\n\nSo the user's understanding is exactly right: AgentState never enters PG. Persistence to PG is only:\n1. `harness_runs` — Harness control state (identity quintuple + harness control fields incl. observations summaries + final_answer etc.) via run_store.save\n2. `harness_artifacts` — full tool results via ToolRuntime/artifact store\n3. conversation tables — messages/turns/execution_trace via ConversationRepository\n4. harness_finalizations — ledger\n\nHow does the harness survive restart without checkpointer? The run_store state IS the checkpoint (checkpoint_saved stage = run_store.save of terminal state). The controller's state dict — what does it contain? {\"user_id\",\"conversation_id\",\"thread_id\",\"turn_id\",\"run_id\",\"asset_ids\",\"harness\": {...}} — plus observations inside harness. The LangGraph usage in controller: controller.py:1132 `\"thread_id\": command.run_ref.thread_id` and :1210 — those might be for... let me not overclaim; controller._run is a Python loop, not a LangGraph graph (from as-built: LoopController is 唯一编排者, pure Python loop with _save_running_state at phase boundaries). The 1132/1210 hits might be memory formation or context requests. Fine — the picture:\n\n**AgentState（旧图）**: memory-only, per tool-call execution. When query_data tool runs, it builds a fresh AgentState from run_ref + input, streams query_graph, takes the last values-state, extracts results, returns QueryDataOutput → ToolRuntime persists full result as artifact → RunObservation (summary + result_ref) into harness state. The AgentState dies when the tool call ends.\n\n**Harness state (controller dict)**: persisted per phase boundary to harness_runs (JSONB). Contains: identity, asset_ids, harness control fields (status/phase/iteration/action_seq/observations/last_error/terminal_intent/...). observations = list of RunObservation = summaries + result_refs (NOT full results).\n\nSo data linkage across tools = NOT shared memory state, but:\n1. **引用接力（Artifact relay）**: query/analyze → artifact (PG) → observation.result_ref → planner sees it in later rounds → build_report(result_refs=[...]) → artifact_store.read with full run identity → renders → rendered_report artifact → final_output_ref.\n2. **摘要累积（observation accumulation）**: harness.observations grows each round; every planner decision sees all prior summaries (controlled facts).\n3. **记忆线（memory）**: finalize → formation service → memory (Qdrant/Neo4j); next turn's context engine reads it back. Cross-TURN linkage.\n4. Also CompiledContext includes prior evidence refs (compiler.py:140 observation.result_ref → refs) — the context engine passes prior result_refs into the context for the planner? From grep earlier: context_engine/compiler.py:140-141 `if observation.result_ref: refs = (observation.result_ref, *refs)` — so context compilation collects result_refs as evidence refs. Good detail.\n\nThree tools' responsibilities (already commented in files):\n- query_data: single-shot question → recall/SQL chain → query_result artifact\n- analyze_data: plan→execute analysis tasks → analysis_result artifact\n- build_report: consume upstream artifacts → render report → rendered_report artifact\n\nAnswer structure:\n1. 判断：对，AgentState 纯内存（且验证：全项目没有任何 LangGraph checkpointer，graph.py:100 无参编译）。进 PG 的四样东西表格。\n2. 三个工具一句话分工表。\n3. 联动机制：引用接力 + 摘要累积 + 记忆线。画图。\n4. 点出设计意图：正因为 state 不落库/工具间不共享内存，崩溃恢复才简单——要恢复的一切都在 PG（控制现场+Artifact 引用）。\n\nNo code edits needed (comments already cover tool roles; this is a comprehension question). Maybe no commit. Keep it tight.","startTime":1791428023752,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023752},{"id":"0d9eb792-e18a-488c-a774-4c65c988a330","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"验证完毕，你的判断**完全正确**：全项目 grep 不到任何 LangGraph checkpointer——`agent_graph = build_agent_graph()` 是无参编译（[`graph.py:97,100`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/graph.py#L97)，`checkpointer=None`），旧图状态纯内存流转，用完即弃。\n\n## 一、AgentState 与 PG 的真实边界\n\nAgentState 只在一次工具调用（或一次旧图请求）期间存活。真正进 PG 的是四样东西：\n\n| 数据 | 表 | 写入者 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Harness 控制现场（身份五元组 + status/iteration/action_seq + **observations 摘要列表** + last_error…） | `harness_runs` | `run_store.save`，每个 phase 边界落一次 |\n| 工具**完整结果**（行数据/任务结果/报告） | `harness_artifacts` | ToolRuntime |\n| 会话消息 / 轮次 / 执行轨迹 | conversations 系列表 | start_turn / finish_turn / save_execution_trace |\n| 收口账本 | `harness_finalizations` | FinalizationService |\n\n注意关键分工：**进 state 的只有摘要和引用，完整数据只进 Artifact**——这就是为什么 state 可以放心不落库。\n\n## 二、三个工具分工\n\n| 工具 | 职责 | 产出 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `query_data` | 单问数链适配器：关键词→四路召回→过滤→SQL→执行→维度映射 | `query_result` Artifact |\n| `analyze_data` | 深度分析适配器：plan_analysis→execute_analysis，任务级查询+计算+证据 | `analysis_result` Artifact |\n| `build_report` | 报告适配器：读上游 Artifact→归一化任务→报告规划→渲染 | `rendered_report` Artifact |\n\n## 三、数据联动：不靠共享内存，靠“引用接力 + 摘要累积”\n\n三个工具互相之间**零直接调用、零共享 state**，联动全走两条机制：\n\n```\n第 N 轮：query_data / analyze_data 执行\n   │\n   ├─① 完整结果 ──▶ harness_artifacts（PG）\n   │\n   └─② RunObservation（summary + result_ref）──▶ harness.observations 累积\n              │                                        │\n              │            每轮 Planner 都看得到全部历史摘要\n              ▼\n第 N+1 轮：Planner 决定 build_report，把观察里的 result_ref 填进 result_refs\n              │\n              ▼\nbuild_report ──凭完整运行身份 artifact_store.read──▶ 拉回完整结果 ──▶ 渲染\n              │\n              └─▶ rendered_report Artifact ──▶ 收口 final_output_ref\n```\n\n- **引用接力**：`result_ref` 是工具间唯一的“数据交接棒”。上下文编译时还会把历史 result_ref 收集为证据引用（`compiler.py:140-141`），所以规划器每轮都知道“手里有哪些已落库的结果”。\n- **摘要累积**：`harness.observations` 每轮追加，Planner 靠受控摘要决定下一步调谁、传什么。\n- **跨轮记忆线**（turn 之间）：收口时 formation 提交记忆，下一轮 turn 的 ContextEngine 从 Qdrant 读回——这是唯一跨问答的联动。\n\n这个设计的回报正好呼应你上一句观察：**AgentState 不落库没关系**——崩溃恢复需要的一切（控制现场、结果引用、完整结果）都在 PG 里，内存 state 丢了从头重建上下文即可，工具联动链毫发无损。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789958969769},{"id":"5afd05c3-11e8-43d6-b61a-6258256915f0","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"我现在最不理解analyze_data是干嘛用的，再走一遍query_data吗？","payload":{"query":"我现在最不理解analyze_data是干嘛用的，再走一遍query_data吗？","rawMessage":"我现在最不理解analyze_data是干嘛用的，再走一遍query_data吗？","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"e8af3537-8e6a-4e6e-9f11-1567b06701b5","reques