":[{"id":"c51df7ec-ebb7-4053-a714-d9c3e81ea099","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"Now I have the complete verified picture of analyze_data. Let me answer the user's question precisely:\n\n\"analyze_data 是干嘛用的，再走一遍 query_data 吗？\"\n\nAnswer: 对，每个分析任务内部**确实会完整走一遍 query_data 的问数链**（execute_analysis.py:592 直接 `query_graph.astream(query_state, ...)`）——但这只是它的**第一步**。query_data 到\"查出数据\"就结束了；analyze_data 在查询之后还有三层：\n\nPer-task pipeline (_execute_task, :476-696):\n1. **解析依赖**（:515-576）——如果该任务 depends_on 前置任务，把前置任务的 calculation_result 喂给 LLM（resolve_analysis_task prompt）→ 生成\"具体化\"后的查询问题 resolved_question（例如前置任务算出\"销售额最高的月份是12月\"，本任务的问题就被具体化为\"12月的…\"）\n2. **查询数据**（:578-604）——`query_graph.astream(query_state)` 走完整问数链（召回→过滤→SQL→执行→增强），拿到 rows；custom 事件带上 task_id 透传\n3. **生成 Python 分析代码**（:613-657）——把查询结果的数据画像（_build_data_profile :611）喂给 LLM，生成 calculate(rows) 纯函数\n4. **执行 Python 计算**（:658-675）——沙箱执行 calculate(rows)，数值比较/排名/差值由确定性 Python 完成（:655 注释\"LLM 只生成计算程序；数值比较、排名和差值由沙箱中的 Python 完成\"）\n5. 产出 TaskResult（:676-696：sql/rows/python_code/calculation_result…），失败包装为 failed 继续\n\nOuter loop (execute_analysis :740-783+): 按 depends_on 拓扑调度——ready_tasks（依赖都完成）逐批执行 :761-783。\n\n所以两者的本质区别：\n\n| | query_data | analyze_data |\n|---|---|---|\n| 回答的问题 | \"查一下 X\"（一次取数） | \"分析 X\"（多步推理+计算） |\n| 内部结构 | 问数链走 1 遍，1 条 SQL | N 个任务 × (解析依赖 + **问数链走 1 遍** + 生成 Python + 沙箱计算) |\n| 计算在哪 | 无计算，只有查询结果 | 有确定性 Python 计算（沙箱），不让 LLM 算数 |\n| 任务间联动 | 无 | depends_on 拓扑 + 前置 calculation_result 具体化后续问题 |\n| 产物 | query_result Artifact | analysis_result Artifact（任务结果+证据汇总） |\n\n所以\"再走一遍 query_data 吗\"——准确说法：**每个分析任务都会内嵌走一遍 query_data 的问数链**（直接 astream 同一个 query_graph，execute_analysis.py:592），但 analyze_data ≠ 重复 query_data；它是在问数链外面加了\"计划分解 → 依赖具体化 → 确定性计算\"三层。LLM 不算数（防幻觉），算数交给沙箱。\n\n典型场景：query_data 适合\"上个月销售额是多少\"；analyze_data 适合\"各月份销售额同比下降趋势\"——需要查 2017 和 2016 两个任务的数据，再用 Python 算同比。\n\n举 concrete example from MockLangChainModel content: \"2017年销售额下降最明显的月份是12月\" — that's exactly an analyze_data-style output.\n\nWhy a separate tool + not just query_data multiple times: because the multi-task DAG + dependency-condition resolution + sandboxed calculation + evidence aggregation is one atomic tool call for the planner — planner 不用自己编排多轮取数再算数（Harness 规划器做规划，但任务级 DAG 调度下沉给 execute_analysis，见 graph.py:60-61 注释\"分析任务内部的依赖调度由 execute_analysis 负责，不在 LangGraph 中为每个动态任务创建节点\"）。\n\nNo code edits needed — pure explanation. The comments are already in place. Keep answer compact with the diagram.","startTime":1791428023752,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023752},{"id":"871e8f7f-7b10-4d6d-85a1-cf4c14456762","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"问得很准。**对了一半**：每个分析任务内部确实会完整走一遍 query_data 的问数链——[`execute_analysis.py:592`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py#L592) 就是直接 `query_graph.astream(query_state, ...)` 调的同一个图。但 analyze_data ≠ 重复 query_data，它在问数链**外面**包了三层东西。\n\n## analyze_data 的完整流程\n\n一次工具调用 = **N 个任务组成的依赖图**，每个任务五步（`_execute_task`，[`execute_analysis.py:476-696`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/nodes/execute_analysis.py#L476-696)）：\n\n```\nplan_analysis（规划）：\"2017年各月销售额同比下降趋势\"\n   └─▶ 拆成任务 DAG：task1 查2017逐月销售额 / task2 查2016逐月 / task3 算同比（依赖1、2）\n\n每个任务（_execute_task）：\n  ① 解析依赖（:515-576）── 前置任务的 calculation_result 喂给 LLM，\n     把本任务的抽象问题\"具体化\"（例：前置算出\"峰值在12月\"→ 本任务问题具体化为\"12月的…\"）\n  ② 查询数据（:592-604）── ★ 内嵌走一遍完整问数链 ★\n     query_graph.astream(召回→过滤→SQL→执行→增强)，拿到 rows\n  ③ 生成 Python 代码（:613-657）── 查询结果的数据画像喂给 LLM，\n     生成 calculate(rows) 纯函数\n  ④ 沙箱执行计算（:658-675）── 同比/排名/差值等数值由确定性 Python 算出\n  ⑤ 产出 TaskResult（:676-696）── sql/rows/python_code/calculation_result 打包\n\nexecute_analysis 主循环（:740-783）：按 depends_on 拓扑调度，\n前置失败则依赖任务标记失败停止，最后汇总 analysis_evidence\n```\n\n## 和 query_data 的本质区别\n\n| | query_data | analyze_data |\n|---|---|---|\n| 回答 | “查一下 X”——**一次取数** | “分析 X”——**多步推理 + 计算** |\n| 问数链 | 走 1 遍，1 条 SQL | 每个任务各走 1 遍（N 条 SQL） |\n| 数值计算 | 没有 | 有，且**不让 LLM 算**——LLM 只生成 `calculate(rows)` 代码，数字由 Python 沙箱确定性算出（`:655` 的注释：“数值比较、排名和差值由沙箱中的 Python 完成”） |\n| 任务联动 | 无 | depends_on 拓扑 + 前置结果具体化后续查询条件 |\n| 产物 | `query_result` Artifact | `analysis_result` Artifact（任务结果 + 证据汇总） |\n\n## 为什么不做成“Planner 自己多调几次 query_data”\n\n因为三件事必须**原子地**在一个工具调用里完成：任务 DAG 调度、依赖条件具体化、沙箱计算。拆开的话规划器要在 Harness 层做 N 轮“取数→喂结果→再取数”的编排，而这套依赖调度逻辑已经沉在 `execute_analysis` 里了——[`graph.py:60-61`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/graph.py#L60-61) 的注释就是这个设计决策：“分析任务内部的依赖调度由 execute_analysis 负责，不在 LangGraph 中为每个动态任务创建节点”。\n\n一句话总结：**query_data 负责“把数拿回来”，analyze_data 负责“把结论算出来”**——它内部把前者当零件用，外面加了分解、依赖、计算三层。你之前界面里那条“2017年销售额下降最明显的月份是12月”，就是它算出来的（数据来自内嵌问数链，结论来自沙箱里的 Python）。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789961328758},{"id":"e964c6d5-354b-422f-807b-177d5355b77f","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"那这个过程应不应该在planner中进行呢？","payload":{"query":"那这个过程应不应该在planner中进行呢？","rawMessage":"那这个过程应不应该在planner中进行呢？","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"3001b982-d781-4bea-9205-bed140cf41f6","requestedAt":1789961438396,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"e964c6d5-354b-422f-807b-177d5355b77f"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"cc89f1bf6393a278da603fb8c6345718b0afff8a","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]}},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1789961438404},{"id":"415f3c3e-26dd-47dc-b0f7-ba631feec26b","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"e964c6d5-354b-422f-807b-177d5355b77f","reportedId":"b872c23b-df91-4dd9-85d4-3b78de8d2edc","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Comate"},"role":"assistant","status":"cancelled","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":83.85,"contextUsed":214657,"contextLimit":256000,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"performanceMetrics":{"firstTokenLatency":2121,"totalDuration":69282},"appliedRuleNames":[],"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"6ab0a4e0b08fa821c70cce01","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":67159},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"e2a20299-45d2-45c3-84e4-84ff31fc9013","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"The user asks: \"那这个过程应不应该在planner中进行呢？\" — \"Should this process (the multi-task DAG scheduling, dependency resolution, sandboxed computation) be done in the Planner instead?\"\n\nThis is an architecture design discussion question. No code changes needed — pure design reasoning. Give an honest, well-reasoned answer with a clear recommendation.\n\nLet me think about this carefully.\n\n**Current design**: Harness LoopController's PlanningAgent decides ONE action per round (tool_call / ask_user / finish). The multi-task analysis DAG is hidden INSIDE analyze_data tool (plan_analysis → execute_analysis handles dependency scheduling + LLM-specific-condition resolution + sandbox calc).\n\n**The alternative**: push the DAG into the Planner — i.e., Planner itself plans task1, calls query_data, sees result, plans task2, ..., does calculation, etc. So the loop becomes: planner → query_data(task1) → observe → query_data(task2) → observe → ... → calculate → finish.\n\nArguments FOR moving to planner:\n- Single planning brain; more adaptive — planner can change course mid-way based on intermediate results (dynamic replanning).\n- Reuses existing harness primitives (retry, confirmation, artifact per step) instead of a bespoke inner scheduler.\n- Visibility: each step becomes a Harness round with its own events/artifacts — more transparent.\n- No duplicated \"inner planning\" concept (plan_analysis is itself an LLM plan) — two-layer planning (Harness planner + analysis planner) is conceptual redundancy.\n\nArguments AGAINST (why current design is right):\n1. **Cost/latency**: The Harness loop's every round = context rebuild (memory + metadata recall) + full planner LLM call + commit + persistence. An analysis with 3 tasks + calc would be 4-5 harness rounds, each with context rebuild overhead. The inner DAG scheduler batches this into ONE tool call — planner overhead paid once. execute_analysis has its own dependency-aware batching (runs ready tasks concurrently — execute_analysis:761-777 with gather? it processes ready_tasks... likely concurrent).\n2. **Determinism & correctness**: 数值计算必须在沙箱由确定性代码完成。Planner deciding numbers via LLM = hallucination risk. If planner orchestrated, who writes calculate()? You'd still need a \"calculate tool\" with the same sandbox. So the sandbox can't move into the planner anyway — only the ORCHESTRATION could move.\n3. **Atomicity/consistency**: The task DAG with dependency-condition resolution is one coherent unit of work; splitting it across planner rounds means partial failure states mid-analysis (task2 done, task3 pending) must be resumable — Harness CAN pause/resume between rounds, which is a plus... but every pause/resume costs a full context rebuild and planner re-derivation of the plan. The inner scheduler keeps the DAG state in memory for the duration of one tool call; failure = whole tool result failed, planner gets controlled error feedback and can retry/replan — simpler failure model.\n4. **Two-layer planning is intentional**: Harness planner = strategic (which tool, when to stop, when to ask user); analysis planner = tactical (decompose goal into data tasks with dependencies). Mixing them would bloat the planner prompt with task-DAG bookkeeping and make NextAction schema much more complex (task graphs, dependencies between actions). Current NextAction is deliberately tiny (tool_call/ask_user/finish).\n5. **The graph.py comment explicitly records this decision**: \"分析任务内部的依赖调度由 execute_analysis 负责，不在 LangGraph 中为每个动态任务创建节点\" — dynamic tasks can't be graph nodes.\n6. **Observability is already bridged**: inner tasks stream analysis_task_phase/analysis_task_resolved/analysis_task_result events via stream_writer → tool.progress → frontend shows per-task progress inside the execution panel. So you don't lose visibility by keeping it inside the tool.\n7. **Artifacts**: whole analysis result = one artifact; planner sees controlled summary. If per-task artifacts were needed, could split, but report consumption works on task_results list.\n\nHowever — honest caveats / when the answer flips:\n- If analysis tasks were LONG-running (minutes each) or needed human confirmation mid-DAG, the tool-internal approach has a problem: the whole tool call runs under one tool timeout (analyze_timeout_seconds), no pausing inside a tool (Harness can only pause between rounds at confirmation points; a tool runs to completion). If a task needed confirmation (e.g., \"要查询的部门口径是A还是B？\"), the inner scheduler would have to fail rather than pause. Currently AnalyzeDataSpec has ask_user only at planner level. That's a real limitation: NEEDS_USER can't surface mid-DAG. But current tasks are data queries — rarely need confirmation; acceptable.\n- Max iterations protects against runaway harness loops; the inner DAG has its own bounded task count (plan constrained — how many tasks max? plan_analysis presumably bounds tasks; input analysis_goals maxItems 16). Bounded.\n- If future requirements demand per-task artifacts / per-task resumability / mid-analysis confirmation, then consider elevating. The migration path: make each task a harness action (planner-driven) and keep a thin \"calculate\" tool for sandbox. That's a bigger redesign.\n\nSo the recommendation: **不应该**。The division \"planner = strategic single-step decisions, tool = cohesive unit of work with its own internal orchestration\" is the right boundary. The DAG inside analyze_data is exactly the kind of deterministic, tightly-coupled, short-lived orchestration that belongs in a tool; the planner should stay a cheap, stateless, single-decision loop.\n\nAnalogy: planner is 项目经理 deciding which subcontractor to hire next; analyze_data is the subcontractor that internally manages its own crew. You don't want the PM micromanaging the subcontractor's internal task board.\n\nAlso mention the two-layer planning isn't redundancy because they plan at different granularity and cadence (harness planner: once per round with full context rebuild; analysis planner: once per tool call, no context rebuild).\n\nCost comparison concrete: harness round ≈ context build (memory retrieval + metadata recall + compile) + planner LLM + save + events. For a 3-task analysis: outer-loop approach = ~4 extra rounds of context building + planner calls; inner = 1 round. And inner runs ready tasks in parallel (topological batching), outer loop would serialize planner decisions (planner is single-decision per round — actually could parallelize via multiple tool_calls? NextAction is single tool_call per round I believe).\n\nAnswer structure:\n1. 结论先行：不应该。当前分层是对的。\n2. 为什么不该：4 个理由（成本结构、确定性计算本质、失败/恢复模型、编排契约复杂度）+ 代码里已有的决策记录。\n3. 可见性没有损失（事件桥接 + 前端任务清单）。\n4. 什么条件下会翻转（诚实边界）：任务超长/需要中途确认/需要任务级产物与断点恢复 → 那时才值得把编排上移，但计算沙箱也上不去，仍需独立 calculate 工具。\n5. 一句话类比收尾。\n\nNo file changes (pure design Q). No commit.","startTime":1791428023752,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023752},{"id":"8372296f-3790-4f1f-8a5a-4cf70b60317f","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"**不应该。这条分层线划在“规划器只做单步决策、工具封装内聚工作单元”是对的**——把任务 DAG 上移到 Planner 看似更统一，实际会同时变慢、变脆、变复杂。逐条说：\n\n## 为什么 DAG 留在 analyze_data 里是对的\n\n**1. 成本结构差一个量级**\n\nHarness 每一轮的固定开销 = 重建上下文（记忆检索 + 元数据召回 + 编译）+ 规划器 LLM 调用 + 落库 + 事件。3 个任务的分析如果由 Planner 编排，就是 4-5 个完整 Harness 轮次，每轮都付一遍全套开销；现在只付 **1 次**。而且 `execute_analysis` 按拓扑分批并发跑就绪任务（`:761-777`），Planner 每轮只能做一个决策，反而把可并行的任务串行化了。\n\n**2. 计算这一层本来就上不去**\n\n数值必须由 Python 沙箱确定性完成（防 LLM 算数幻觉）。就算把“编排”上移给 Planner，`calculate(rows)` 仍得是独立工具——所以上移只能搬走任务调度，搬不走计算，等于只挪了半层，复杂度翻倍收益减半。\n\n**3. 失败模型更简单**\n\n现在：整个分析是一个工具调用，任务失败被包装成受控错误返回，Planner 拿到摘要后重试或换路。上移后：task2 完成、task3 待跑时崩溃，你需要“任务级断点恢复”——要么给每个任务做 Artifact + 恢复协议，要么容忍重头再来。当前方案里这个状态机根本不存在，因为它不需要存在。\n\n**4. Planner 的契约会膨胀**\n\n`NextAction` 现在刻意只有 tool_call / ask_user / finish 三种。要编排 DAG，动作之间就得有依赖关系、中间结果绑定、条件分支——规划器的输出 schema 和提示词都会膨胀一圈，而 Harness 规划器是**每轮都要重建上下文再决策**的，提示词越重越贵越不稳定。代码里其实已经记录了这个决策（[`graph.py:60-61`](/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/graph.py#L60-61)）：“分析任务内部的依赖调度由 execute_analysis 负责，不在 LangGraph 中为每个动态任务创建节点”。\n\n## 可见性并没有损失\n\n这是最容易让人想上移的原因，但它已经被解决了：任务内部每个 phase（解析依赖/查询/生成代码/计算）都经 `runtime.stream_writer` 桥接成 `tool.progress`（`analysis_task_phase/resolved/result`），前端执行面板能看到每个任务的实时进度。**藏在工具里的是调度，不是过程。**\n\n## 什么条件下这个结论会翻转（诚实的边界）\n\n- 任务变成**长时运行**（分钟级），需要一个工具超时装不下 → 得拆\n- 分析**中途需要用户确认**（“口径按 A 还是 B？”）→ 工具内部不能暂停（Harness 只能在轮次间暂停），这是当前方案的真实局限——目前任务都是取数+计算，不需要确认，所以成立\n- 需要**任务级 Artifact / 任务级断点恢复**\n\n真到那天，迁移路径是把任务提升为 Harness 动作、保留一个薄薄的 `calculate` 工具——但那是需求驱动的重构，不是现在的优雅性问题。\n\n一句话：**Planner 是项目经理，每步只决定“下一步雇谁”；analyze_data 是自己带班组的分包商，内部任务板自己管。** 让项目经理去盯分包商的内部任务排期，两边都干不好。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789961508119},{"id":"5de9737f-777b-4aa1-8dfd-e32856546dd2","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":" DAG是什么","payload":{"query":" DAG是什么","rawMessage":" DAG是什么","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"6284fc28-5bda-483e-9565-15efb7d346df","requestedAt":1789961534075,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"5de9737f-777b-4aa1-8dfd-e32856546dd2"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"cc89f1bf6393a278da603fb8c6345718b0afff8a","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]}},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1789961534082},{"id":"7f6ff590-39c4-4720-8b8d-b5dbb9c5ca66","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"5de9737f-777b-4aa1-8dfd-e32856546dd2","reportedId":"04d173d5-02a5-40b7-9368-3c8dcfbe37b9","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Comate"},"role":"assistant","status":"cancelled","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":11.75,"contextUsed":30080,"contextLimit":256000,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"performanceMetrics":{"firstTokenLatency":2555,"totalDuration":150058},"appliedRuleNames":[],"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"6ab0a5402dd493057d7a9a1a","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":147499},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"f76cbf25-34cc-4184-b5c2-4bc433fb4f10","type":"TOOL","toolName":"compress_message","params":{"status":"SUCCESS"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"","metadata":{"status":"success"}}},{"id":"79792c67-fcba-4e6f-ad8b-4145c17fcfbf","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"DAG = **Directed Acyclic Graph**,中文“有向无环图”。拆开看：\n\n- **有向**：边有方向。A → B 表示“A 的结果是 B 的输入”，即 B 依赖 A\n- **无环**：沿箭头走永远不会绕回出发点。也就是说不存在 A 依赖 B、B 又依赖 A 的循环依赖——否则两个任务互相等，永远执行不了\n\n它是描述“任务依赖关系”最通用的数据结构，Airflow、Make、CI 流水线底层都是它。\n\n## 落到本项目\n\n`plan_analysis` 产出的每个 task 带 `depends_on` 字段，这些 task + depends_on 边就构成一棵 DAG。以上一轮的例子：\n\n```\ntask1: 查 2017 年逐月销售额\ntask2: 查 2016 年逐月销售额\ntask3: 计算同比增速  (depends_on: [task1, task2])\ntask4: 汇总结论      (depends_on: [task3])\n\ntask1 ──┐\n        ├──→ task3 ──→ task4\ntask2 ──┘\n```\n\n`execute_analysis` 的主循环就是在这个 DAG 上做**拓扑调度**(execute_analysis.py:740-783):每轮扫描所有未完成任务，把“依赖已全部完成”的挑出来并发执行——第一轮 task1、task2 同时跑，第二轮 task3,第三轮 task4。这就是我说的“按 depends_on 拓扑分批”。\n\n“无环”在这个场景里是天然保证的：LLM 生成计划时，任务只能依赖**它之前**生成的任务，不可能出现 task1 依赖 task3 的倒挂——但这个不变式值得知道，它正是“分批调度总能推进、不会死锁”的原因。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789961685195},{"id":"aa484185-7b4b-4144-b968-e3af11f2f484","summary":"","role":"us