"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"/Users/z523/.comate/projects/Users-z523-Desktop-zizhi-ai-Python-ai-data-analysis/memory/feedback_inline_single_use.md","name":"feedback_inline_single_use.md","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"ca542ebc-2e1a-466a-bfe6-1d036d74ad72","requestedAt":1789979477519,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"fb970f3b-6246-4931-a65e-c9506f54f6a1"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"cc89f1bf6393a278da603fb8c6345718b0afff8a","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]},"taskReminderInjected":true},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1789979477549},{"id":"b3f016a6-ebbc-4a4c-a4d7-d20cf54c2876","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"fb970f3b-6246-4931-a65e-c9506f54f6a1","reportedId":"cd975944-2ce2-4a19-963d-23c7874a4b66","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Comate"},"role":"assistant","status":"cancelled","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":72.72,"contextUsed":186171,"contextLimit":256000,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"performanceMetrics":{"firstTokenLatency":574,"totalDuration":83852},"appliedRuleNames":[],"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"6ab0eb56b58a630c13934f03","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":35377},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"8ba437fc-9b0a-4e2c-9cca-bf929214a04e","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"用户问:run 域这 6 个事件说的是什么\"生命周期\"?\n\n这是问代码语义——按预授权:回答 + 直接补注释。\n\n6 个 run 域事件的生命周期语义:\n- RUN_STARTED(\"run.started\"):controller.start() 创建 run 现场后发——\"运行开始了\"。之后进入循环。\n- RUN_RESULT(\"run.result\"):harness.py 的 _sse_response 在 operation(controller.start/resume)整体返回后发——把 LoopRunResult(终态+final_answer 等)打包发给前端。注意:这不是\"运行结束\"信号,是\"结果载荷\"事件;真正的结束哨兵是 _STREAM_DONE(收流),不是事件。\n- RUN_COMPLETED / RUN_FAILED / RUN_TIMEOUT / RUN_CANCELLED(四选一):_finalize 成功持久化后由 controller 发(刚内联的那段)——终态宣告,对应 HarnessStatus 四个终态。\n\n时间顺序:\n1. run.started(start 入口)\n2. ……循环过程事件(tool.* context.* planner.* action.* confirmation.*)\n3a. 正常完成:run.completed(终态宣告)\n3b. 失败/超时/取消:run.failed / run.timeout / run.cancelled\n4. run.result(API 层在 operation 返回后,把最终 LoopResult 载荷发出去)——它在终态事件之后\n\n一个 run 的事件时间线:\n```\nrun.started → [context.* → planner.* → action.committed → tool.*]* → run.completed|failed|timeout|cancelled → run.result → (SSE 收流哨兵,非事件)\n```\n\nRUN_RESULT 和终态事件的区别:终态事件(run.completed 等)是 controller 在 finalize 后发的\"状态宣告\";run.result 是 API 层在 operation 函数返回后发的\"完整结果载荷\"(含 final_answer 序列化)。前端主要吃 run.result 拿最终答案 chip;run.completed 等用于状态判定。\n\n补注释:contracts.py EventType 的 run 域成员行内注释:\n```python\n    # —— run 生命周期：run.started（入口）→ 循环过程事件 → 终态四选一（completed/failed/timeout/cancelled，\n    #    controller 收口后发）→ run.result（API 层把最终结果载荷发给前端）——\n    RUN_STARTED = \"run.started\"  # start() 创建现场后发：运行开始\n    RUN_RESULT = \"run.result\"  # API 层在 operation 返回后发：最终结果载荷（前端吃它渲染答案）\n    RUN_COMPLETED = \"run.completed\"  # 终态宣告之一：正常完成\n    RUN_FAILED = \"run.failed\"  # 终态宣告之一：不可恢复失败\n    RUN_TIMEOUT = \"run.timeout\"  # 终态宣告之一：超出运行 deadline\n    RUN_CANCELLED = \"run.cancelled\"  # 终态宣告之一：用户取消/断连收口\n```\n\n先答概念,再补注释提交。","startTime":1791428023753,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023753},{"id":"935598c3-3a38-4bc8-8541-8adb92f5ba6a","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"这是“**一次 Harness run 从启动到终态**”的事件生命周期。时间线：\n\n```\nrun.started ──→ [循环过程事件:context.* → planner.* → action.committed → tool.*]* ──→ 终态四选一 ──→ run.result\n   入口                (每轮迭代)                                          completed/failed/         最终结果载荷\n                                                                          timeout/cancelled\n```\n\n| 事件 | 谁发、何时 | 语义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `RUN_STARTED` | `controller.start()` 创建现场后 | **入口**：运行开始，前端进入进度态 |\n| `RUN_COMPLETED` / `RUN_FAILED` / `RUN_TIMEOUT` / `RUN_CANCELLED` | controller 在 finalize **成功持久化后**(刚内联那段) | **终态宣告四选一**，对应 `HarnessStatus` 四个终态——失败、超时、用户取消也各有名字 |\n| `RUN_RESULT` | **API 层**(`_sse_response`)在 operation 整体返回后 | **最终结果载荷**：把 LoopRunResult(final_answer、final_output_ref 等)打包给前端渲染答案 chip |\n\n两个容易混的点：\n\n1. **终态宣告和结果载荷是两条事件**:`run.completed` 说“状态已落库，运行结束了”;`run.result` 说“这是你要的完整结果”。前端吃 `run.result` 渲染最终答案，吃终态事件做状态判定。\n2. **`run.result` 不是最后一条“生命”**：它之后 SSE 流还有一个非事件的收流哨兵(`_STREAM_DONE`),那是 API 层内部收流用的，不进协议。\n\n按惯例补进源码："},{"id":"call_123b578e9be448619aaacc66","type":"TOOL","toolName":"edit_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/streaming/contracts.py","new_string":{"$blob":"sha256:b9f75306fe6d319ecb5a7267ba575259f416b92a900b43244e11df6cba6f31a6","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":692,"compression":"none"},"old_string":{"$blob":"sha256:82091e8768ef1773b07d14796289e927ded03dc41b7641a8fbe030dcf50ad87e","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":287,"compression":"none"},"replace_all":"false"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"relativePath":"app/agent/streaming/contracts.py","absolutePath":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/streaming/contracts.py","resolution":"absolute","content":{"$blob":"sha256:26b5590a00a50e16d4b2e0e740f20958aa085a36f8445af3ffbfbe917f0d7c58","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":2964,"compression":"none"},"originalContent":{"$blob":"sha256:84b33ce1de70daf794947bb3fd48ebe7ac9201a6da7a8686b91fe0ba6d7fa4ab","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":2559,"compression":"none"},"askReview":false,"diff":{"add":8,"remove":7},"runMode":"yolo"}},"accepted":true,"isRebuilt":true}]},{"id":"6ab0eb7ab08fa821c70d7c5a","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":32645},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"call_d05c69585e6f4aee8b802cb7","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"uv run python -m py_compile app/agent/streaming/contracts.py && git 