irmation\"\n    COMPLETED = \"completed\"\n    FAILED = \"failed\"\n    CANCELLED = \"cancelled\"\n    TIMEOUT = \"timeout\" 感觉你设计了很多的生命周期呢。。。。","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"app/agent/streaming/contracts.py","name":"contracts.py","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"18778513-cf74-4901-9a2b-968286e86a65","requestedAt":1789979618229,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"6deffaa3-74b7-4859-9539-46f6a05b5f07"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"cc89f1bf6393a278da603fb8c6345718b0afff8a","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]}},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1789979618249},{"id":"f0c94bd0-bcca-4c6d-af89-e1a4d99cb9ac","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"6deffaa3-74b7-4859-9539-46f6a05b5f07","reportedId":"4a69ce30-6e90-4045-bccd-b7f0c892ac62","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Comate"},"role":"assistant","status":"cancelled","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":73.74,"contextUsed":188767,"contextLimit":256000,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"performanceMetrics":{"firstTokenLatency":716,"totalDuration":84243},"appliedRuleNames":[],"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"6ab0ebe32dd493057d7b4b98","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":66021},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"b430bd20-1f29-4a71-9f99-3d974c2f1128","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"用户看着 `HarnessStatus`(6 个值)感慨:\"感觉你设计了很多的生命周期呢……\"——他注意到现在系统里有好几套\"生命周期/状态\"并存,有点被绕晕或觉得过度设计。\n\n用户的观察其实非常关键,这是这套 Harness 的核心理解难点:确实有多套并行的状态/周期体系。我应该帮他理清:**到底有几套、各自管什么、为什么不能合成一套**。\n\n盘点全部\"生命周期类\"体系:\n\n1. **HarnessStatus**(contracts.py):run 的宏观状态机——RUNNING / WAITING_CONFIRMATION / COMPLETED / FAILED / CANCELLED / TIMEOUT。**作用**:run 现在处于什么大阶段?它写进 harness_runs 落库、驱动 HarnessStateSnapshot 的 validate_combination(和 phase 交叉校验)。\n2. **LoopPhase**(contracts.py,10 值):执行循环的**微观位置指针**——START_RUN/RESTORE_RUN/BUILD_CONTEXT/PLAN/VALIDATE_ACTION/EXECUTE_TOOL/HANDLE_TOOL_RESULT/RECORD_OBSERVATION/WAIT_CONFIRMATION/FINALIZATION。**作用**:循环内走到了哪一步;迁移表约束;恢复用。\n3. **EventType**(刚建的,26 值):事件协议——**广播用**,给前端的时序流水。不是状态(它不落库成\"当前状态\",只是事件流的记录)。\n4. **ResultStatus**(5 值):单次工具调用结果的成败分类——SUCCESS/PARTIAL/TEMPORARY_ERROR/NEEDS_USER/UNRECOVERABLE_ERROR。\n5. **ActionType**(3 值):NextAction 的三种动作——tool_call/ask_user/final_answer。\n6. **ConfirmationStatus**(4 值):单次确认的生命周期。\n7. **FinalizationLedger stage**(reconcile 用):收口账本的阶段。\n8. 前端还有自己的 UI 状态。\n\n用户说\"你设计了很多生命周期\"——核心回答:**它们不是同一层的东西,而是三个层次 + 若干局部小周期**:\n\n- **宏观状态(HarnessStatus)**:run 现在是什么状态?(6 个)\n- **微观位置(LoopPhase)**:循环走到哪一步?(10 个)\n- **广播流(EventType)**:发生了什么事件?(26 个,是流水不是状态)\n- **局部周期**:工具结果(ResultStatus)、动作类型(ActionType)、确认状态(ConfirmationStatus)——各管各的小领域\n\n为什么不能合并?举例:\n- HarnessStatus.RUNNING 期间,LoopPhase 会在 BUILD_CONTEXT→PLAN→EXECUTE_TOOL→... 间走——一个是\"什么状态\",一个是\"在哪一步\",一对多关系。RUNNING 时 phase 可以是 10 个中的 7 个;WAITING_CONFIRMATION 时 phase 恒为 WAIT_CONFIRMATION(校验器强制);终态时 phase 恒为 FINALIZATION。这是**状态 × 位置**的正交,合并会把 6×10 的组合压成一个扁平枚举,爆炸且丢信息。\n- EventType 是\"发生过什么\"的流水日志,同一时刻可以回放多条,不是\"当前是啥\"。\n- ResultStatus 是工具粒度的,一个 run 里 N 次工具调用各有各的 ResultStatus,和 run 级状态无关。\n\n类比:HarnessStatus 是\"订单状态\"(进行中/已完成/已取消),LoopPhase 是\"快递当前在哪个网点\",EventType 是物流短信流水。三者不可互相替代。\n\n这轮是纯概念澄清,用户没问某一行注释。但可以主动把\"层次关系\"写进 contracts.py?HarnessStatus 目前没有注释(contracts.py:14-20 裸的)。用户的话\"感觉你设计了很多的生命周期\"——按问答语义模式,可以给 HarnessStatus 补注释说明它与 LoopPhase/EventType 的分工。这有价值:正是理解断点。\n\n回应结构:\n1. 直答:确实有好几套,但它们是三个层次 + 局部小周期,不是重复设计\n2. 表格:六套各管什么、数量、作用域\n3. 关键:HarnessStatus × LoopPhase 是正交的(状态 × 位置),一段小演示\n4. EventType 是流水不是状态\n5. 补注释:HarnessStatus 类(它现在裸着)——加类 docstring + 行内注释,说明宏观状态身份 + 与 LoopPhase 分工\n6. 提交\n\nHarnessStatus 补注释设计:\n```python\nclass HarnessStatus(StrEnum):\n    \"\"\"run 的宏观状态；与 LoopPhase（微观位置）正交——一个 RUNNING 状态下 phase 会在循环各步间移动。\"\"\"\n\n    RUNNING = \"running\"  # 循环执行中（phase 可处于 build_context/plan/execute_tool 等任一过程步）\n    WAITING_CONFIRMATION = \"waiting_confirmation\"  # 暂停等用户确认（校验器强制 phase 恒为 wait_confirmation）\n    COMPLETED = \"completed\"  # 终态：正常完成（校验器强制 phase=finalization、terminal_intent 一致）\n    FAILED = \"failed\"  # 终态：不可恢复失败\n    CANCELLED = \"cancelled\"  # 终态：用户取消/断连收口\n    TIMEOUT = \"timeout\"  # 终态：超出运行级 deadline\n```\n\nvalidate_combination 里的交叉校验正是状态×位置正交的体现(status=WAITING_CONFIRMATION 要求 phase=WAIT_CONFIRMATION 等)。注释点出这个。\n\n演示正交:\n同一时刻\"一个 run 只有一个 (status, phase)\"对:\n- (RUNNING, PLAN)\n- (RUNNING, EXECUTE_TOOL)\n- (WAITING_CONFIRMATION, WAIT_CONFIRMATION)\n- (COMPLETED, FINALIZATION)\n不是所有组合合法,校验器管着。\n\n答完补注释提交。","startTime":1791428023753,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023753},{"id":"bdee71b2-ff18-4dfe-bb6d-0ebc5c10765e","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"你的感觉对——系统里确实并存着好几套“周期”，但它们**不是同一层的东西重复设计**，而是三个层次 + 几个局部小周期。这是理解这套架构的关键，值得掰开：\n\n## 三层 + 局部\n\n| 体系 | 数量 | 管什么 | 类比快递 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **HarnessStatus** | 6 | run 的**宏观状态**：现在整体处于什么大阶段 | 订单状态：进行中/已完成/已取消 |\n| **LoopPhase** | 10 | 循环的**微观位置**：走到了哪一步 | 包裹当前在哪个网点 |\n| **EventType** | 26 | **广播流水**：发生过什么(不是“当前是啥”，是日志) | 物流短信记录 |\n| ResultStatus / ActionType / ConfirmationStatus | 各 3-5 | **局部小周期**：单次工具结果、单次动作类型、单次确认 | 单个包裹的妥投/退回 |\n\n## 关键：HarnessStatus × LoopPhase 是正交的，不是重复\n\n一个 run 在同一时刻只有一对 `(status, phase)`,关系是**一对多**：\n\n```\nRUNNING              期间,phase 在 build_context → plan → execute_tool → … 之间反复移动\nWAITING_CONFIRMATION 时,phase 恒为 wait_confirmation\n终态(completed 等)   时,phase 恒为 finalization\n```\n\n这正是你刚看过的 `HarnessStateSnapshot.validate_combination` 在做的事：交叉校验非法组合(如“终态必须用 finalization 阶段”、“waiting_confirmation 状态必须停在 wait_confirmation 阶段”)。如果合并成一个扁平枚举，就得枚举 6×10 的合法组合，爆炸还丢信息。\n\n**EventType 则根本不是状态**：一个 run 会发出几十条事件，它是时间线上的流水，回放用的——把日志和状态混为一谈才会觉得“太多”。\n\n所以真正的设计是：**状态(是什么)× 位置(在哪)× 流水(发生过什么)× 局部结果(单次成败)**，各管一段。`HarnessStatus` 现在还光着，把层次分工补进去："},{"id":"call_478ee70c195c445e84675b2d","type":"TOOL","toolName":"edit_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/state_result_store/contracts.py","new_string":{"$blob":"sha256:00a15516c36f920991229534ce9a9ae8735413d6968a401122a5da5cae1f2588","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":807,"compression":"none"},"old_string":{"$blob":"sha256:c0a7e857104b99a41893990ae1f695fb2dc703e8ba7a99fe35bb6e2e8f60937f","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":205,"compression":"none"},"replace_all":"false"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"relativePath":"app/agent/state_result_store/contracts.py","absolutePath":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/state_result_store/contracts.py","resolution":"absolute","content":{"$blob":"sha256:cb7b15d696d993811f4fd95e44c83d8cc99fe47b405d84562750c2099e867962","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":21217,"compression":"none"},"originalContent":{"$blob":"sha256:eba6849cbd47eef2d83a4e77d9d49b6aded8575a63a1506fbb5068b9aa6ae459","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":20615,"compression":"none"},"askReview":false,"diff":{"add":12,"remove":6},"runMode":"yolo"}},"accepted":true,"isRebuilt":true}]},{"id":"6ab0ec2552c86817577f8c5c","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":5691},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"call_7e5064147b994586a223ecaf","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"uv run python -m py_compile app/agent/state_result_store/contracts.py && git add app/agent/state_result_store/contracts.py && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nHarnessStatus 注释：宏观状态与 LoopPhase 微观位置正交，交叉校验指路 validate_combination\nEOF\n)\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Compile and commit HarnessStatus hierarchy comments"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Command executed successfully.\nExit code