ror 保持原语义。\n  Line 303:             if self._remaining_seconds(state) is not None and self._remaining_seconds(state) <= 0:\n  Line 304:                 raise HarnessDeadlineExceeded(\"Harness 运行已超过 deadline_at\") from exc\n  Line 305:             raise\n  Line 306: \n  Line 307:     async def _prepare_interruption_state(\n  Line 308:         self,\n  Line 309:         *,\n  Line 310:         command: StartRunCommand,\n  Line 311:         state: HarnessGraphState,\n  Line 312:         code: str,\n  Line 313:         message: str,","metadata":{"pattern":"def _check_deadline","relevantFiles":[{"path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/loop_controller/controller.py","startLine":283,"endLine":313}]}}},{"id":"call_56ce1ec1b8ae434c91c567b2","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"grep -n \"run_timeout_seconds\\|deadline\" /Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/config.yaml | head -5","description":"Check deadline config"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Command executed successfully.\nExit code: 0\nOutput:\n18:  run_timeout_seconds: 1800\n","metadata":{"cwd":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis","autoRun":true,"state":"completed","runMode":"yolo","taskId":"3a6emu","output":"18:  run_timeout_seconds: 1800\n","exitCode":0,"inBackground":false}}}]},{"id":"6ab10f2123332500531b5917","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":30365},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"576ab8eb-a2c0-470d-935b-395483efc332","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"Now I have the full picture:\n\n- `deadline` = 截止时刻/死线: the absolute point in time by which the run must stop.\n- In this codebase: run starts → `_new_state` sets `deadline_at = now + run_timeout_seconds` (config: 1800s = 30 min). So the run has a 30-minute budget, stored as an absolute timestamp `deadline_at` in the harness state (persisted in PG).\n- `_check_deadline(state)`: computes remaining = deadline_at - now; if <= 0 → raise HarnessDeadlineExceeded → the run gets wrapped up as TIMEOUT terminal status.\n- Called at loop boundaries: top of `_run` and each `while True` iteration — \"在每个循环边界阻止已过期运行继续调用 Planner 或工具\" (its docstring).\n- `_await_with_deadline`: per-external-call version — wraps each await (context build, planner, tool execution) with `asyncio.wait_for(timeout=remaining)`, so a single long call can't blow past the deadline mid-call. It also distinguishes: only converts TimeoutError into deadline-exceeded if the run deadline actually passed (component's own timeout keeps its original semantics).\n- Why absolute timestamp instead of a countdown: deadline_at is persisted, so even after a crash+restore the budget is still anchored to the original start time — a restored run doesn't get a fresh 30 minutes. Also `validate_combination` checks deadline_at >= started_at.\n\nWhere it's caught: HarnessDeadlineExceeded → probably caught in `start()`/`resume()` and finalized as TIMEOUT. We saw in _run: max iterations → TIMEOUT. The deadline path: `_prepare_interruption_state` handles interruptions (cancel/timeout?). I saw earlier in _run test names: test_harness_d_deadlines. Good enough to explain without tracing everything.\n\nMeaning of the word: deadline = 截止时间(死线), originally printing \"beyond the deadline line\". In this project: run_timeout_seconds=1800 → started_at + 30min = deadline_at. It's the run's total time budget, distinct from per-component timeouts (LLM timeout, tool timeout, etc.).\n\nExplain concisely with the chain. No code change needed (functions already have docstrings). Pure concept answer. Maybe a small diagram:\n\n创建时: deadline_at = now + 1800s(存进现场)\n每次循环边界: _check_deadline → 剩余时间 <= 0 ? 抛 HarnessDeadlineExceeded → 运行按 TIMEOUT 收口\n每次外部调用: _await_with_deadline → asyncio.wait_for(剩余时间)\n\nPoint out the three-layer timeout system: 组件超时(LLM/tool 自己的 timeout) < 调用级 deadline 包装(_await_with_deadline) < 运行级 deadline(deadline_at). The docstring of _await_with_deadline says exactly this: \"让单个外部调用服从运行级 deadline,而不是只依赖组件超时\".\n\nWhy persisted as absolute time: 恢复后不重置预算.","startTime":1791428023754,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023754},{"id":"344cb589-f61c-4f7a-8c5a-eb8247cf8e4b","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"**deadline = 截止时刻**(绝对时间点)，本项目里指**一次 run 的最长存活时间**。词源就是印刷业的“死线”——超线即停。\n\n在这个项目里的具体机制，三步：\n\n**1. 创建时定死**(`_new_state` → state.py):\n\n```python\ndeadline_at = now + timedelta(seconds=self.run_timeout_seconds)\n# config.yaml: run_timeout_seconds: 1800 → 开跑瞬间,30 分钟后的那个时刻被写进现场\n```\n\n存的是**绝对时间戳**(`deadline_at`),随现场一起落库。\n\n**2. 循环边界检查**(`_check_deadline`,controller.py:283):\n\n```python\nremaining = deadline_at - now\nif remaining <= 0:\n    raise HarnessDeadlineExceeded   # → 运行按 TIMEOUT 终态收口\n```\n\n`_run` 的 ① 和 ④(每轮 while 开头)各调一次——docstring 说得准：“在每个循环边界阻止已过期运行继续调用 Planner 或工具”。\n\n**3. 单次调用也罩住**(`_await_with_deadline`,controller.py:289):循环边界之间还有长调用(建上下文、Planner、工具)，每次外部 await 都包 `asyncio.wait_for(timeout=剩余时间)`——防止单个调用把 30 分钟一口气耗穿。\n\n所以整个体系是**三层超时，内小外大**：\n\n| 层 | 谁管 | 例 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 组件超时 | 各组件自己 | LLM 响应超时、工具 `timeout_seconds` |\n| 调用级 deadline | `_await_with_deadline` | 单次调用不许越过运行 deadline |\n| **运行级 deadline** | `_check_deadline` / `deadline_at` | 整个 run 最多 30 分钟 |\n\n两个设计点：\n\n- **存绝对时刻而不是倒计时**：现场恢复(run 崩了重新拉起)后，预算不会重新给 30 分钟——deadline_at 还锚定在原始起点，该超时还是超时\n- **和组件超时不混淆**:`_await_with_deadline` 里有个精确判断——只有确实触及运行 deadline 才转换成 `HarnessDeadlineExceeded`,组件自己的 TimeoutError 保持原语义(该重试的走重试)，两个超时体系不串线"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1789988672005},{"id":"8ccae29e-1624-4014-97c2-a2f454bb96de","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"就是检查是否超时？","payload":{"query":"就是检查是否超时？","rawMessage":"就是检查是否超时？","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"app/agent/loop_controller/controller.py","name":"controller.py","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurr