nd PRODUCTION implementation? (e.g., in-memory store for tests/dev?) Let me search.\n\nLet me also check how MemoryContextReader is handled — because runtime.manager is passed as memory_reader. If the user's logic were applied consistently, ALL 11 constructor params would become concrete types, and the engine would become untestable and rigid. This is the \"slippery slope\" concrete example: store is just one of many interface-typed deps. Pointing that out concretely is the strongest argument: `memory_reader: MemoryContextReader` — production value is `runtime.manager` (MemoryManager). Should that become MemoryManager? And planner ContextPlanner → concrete planner? Then the engine's __init__ imports ~11 concrete modules, and tests can't fake any of them.\n\nSo my answer structure:\n1. 先给事实:ContextStore 是什么(ABC in interfaces.py)、有几个实现、测试有没有 fake。\n2. 与 ContextBuilder 案例的关键差异:那是\"层与层之间的缝,单方法\";这是\"引擎内部的依赖,而且是 11 个接口型依赖之一\"。如果把 store 换成 PostgresContextStore,同样的问题会出现在 memory_reader/ planner/ compiler/ token_counter... 上——每个都是\"生产只有一个实现\"。全部换完,engine 的 __init__ 直接 import 11 个具象模块,任何单测都必须起真 PG/真 ES。\n3. tests 证据(次要但具体):列出注入 fake 的测试文件。\n4. 结论:这个不建议换,理由是生产侧的(引擎的可组装性),然后——按照记忆的教训——明确说\"决定权在你,你说换我就换\"。\n\nLet me gather the facts.","startTime":1791428023756,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023756},{"id":"080915e8-6be9-4d56-a9e5-20a0a17bd1ed","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"先核对事实，再给论证："},{"id":"call_3124dd07f4d742ff82874efa","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"grep -n \"class ContextStore\" app/agent/context_engine/interfaces.py && sed -n \"$(grep -n 'class ContextStore' app/agent/context_engine/interfaces.py | cut -d: -f1),+20p\" app/agent/context_engine/interfaces.py; echo \"=====\"; grep -rn \"ContextStore)\" app/ tests/ --include=\"*.py\" | grep -v __pycache__ | grep \"class \" | head; echo \"=====\"; grep -rln \"store=\\|ContextStore\" tests/ --include=\"*.py\" | grep -v __pycache__ | head","description":"查 ContextStore 定义、实现与测试注入","working_directory"