ote — this is a QUESTION (\"不可以吗\"), not yet a decision (\"删除\"). They're asking for the reasoning. I should give a SHORT, honest answer — not a re-litigation essay. Key points, learned from the rounds:\n\n1. The honest answer: 可以,运行时毫无问题(Python 鸭子类型,协议只给类型检查器看)。你上轮删 ContextBuilder 已经证明这条路能走。\n2. 这一个和 ContextBuilder 有一个实质差异(我已经在 Store 轮讲过滑坡论):ContextRepository 是 engine 11 个接口依赖之一,而且 history.py 也用同一个协议。如果 engine.py 和 history.py 的签名都换成 PostgresContextRepository,那 InMemoryContextRepository(test_context_engine.py 里在跑的 fake)类型上就不再满足——运行时照常过(mypy 没接),所以实际代价=0,收益=少一个协议定义。\n3. 一致性问题:engine 的 __init__ 还有 10 个同样模式的接口参数(memory_reader、planner、token_counter...)。只换 context_repository 一个,文件里就出现两种风格;全换的话,InMemory fakes 全部类型失配,engine 与具体实现焊死。\n4. 但——按既定结论:你的项目你拍板。如果你要换,我就 engine.py + history.py 两个签名一起换,InMemoryContextRepository 保留(鸭子类型照跑)。我不重复长篇论证了。\n\nActually, let me think about what's genuinely the BEST advice here, being fully honest. The user has a consistent philosophy: minimal, no speculative abstraction, one source of truth, 名实一致. They've now deleted one protocol (ContextBuilder). They're eyeing ContextRepository.\n\nHonest engineering assessment:\n- ContextBuilder protocol: single method, single consumer pair (controller ← engine). Deleting was cosmetically fine, low cost.\n- ContextRepository protocol: 5 methods, 2 consumers (engine, history), 1 prod impl + 1 test impl. Replacing the TYPE with concrete in signatures: runtime cost zero today (duck typing), type-checking cost = InMemory fake becomes type-invalid (no mypy in project, so zero practical cost), consistency cost = mixed styles in engine __init__ (one concrete param among 10 interfaces).\n\nThe real question the user should decide: do they want the engine's dependency surface to be interface-based (all 11) or concrete-based (all 11)? Mixed = worst. All-concrete = engine loses fakes' type validity and binds to infra modules via imports. All-interface = current.\n\nGiven their philosophy and the fact that mypy isn't even running, the \"practical\" answer is: it works either way; the interface version is better engineering; the concrete version is fewer definitions. For THEIR project with no static type checking, the protocol definitions are documentation + IDE support.\n\nIDE support matters! With Protocol: engine's param type gives autocomplete for the 5 methods + click-through to contract. With concrete PostgresContextRepository: autocomplete on the concrete class (same 5 methods + session internals). Not much difference.\n\nI'll answer concisely:\n1. 直接回答:可以。运行时零差别(上次删 ContextBuilder 就是这么走的)。\n2. 但这次的账和 ContextBuilder 那次不一样,差异一条:它有 5 个方法、两个消费方(engine + history),且 InMemoryContextRepository 是在跑的第二实现——换具象后它类型失配但运行照跑(mypy 未接,零实际代价)。\n3. 真正要拍板的是风格:engine __init__ 的 11 个依赖,接口风 vs 具象风。只换一个会混风。要换就换全(11 个签名),InMemory fakes 保留,运行时照常。\n4. 我的倾向(一句):留着,理由只有一条——5 个方法的合同是 engine 与持久化之间唯一的说明文档,删了就只剩实现源码;但这是风格选择不是对错。\n5. 你拍板:换/不换/换全,说一声我执行。\n\nWait — but do I even need to re-argue? The memory says \"先给生产侧论证,然后服从用户裁决\". This IS the production-side argument, compressed. Keep it SHORT. The user is probably tired of essays. Let me make it really tight.\n\nAlso worth one concrete note: the protocol docstring \"增量会话摘要和构建 trace 的持久化端口\" IS the documentation of what this dependency does — engine's code doesn't show it anywhere else. And PostgresContextRepository's own class is ~150 lines of SQL/session detail; clicking through from engine lands in SQL noise. With protocol, click lands on the 5-method contract. That's an IDE-level benefit that survives mypy absence. This is actually the strongest practical point for THIS user (they navigate by cmd-click constantly — that's how this whole session started!).\n\nFrame it that way:\n- cmd-click 的落点:协议 = 5 个方法一目了然的合同;具象 = 150 行 SQL 细节。engine 作者想看\"它给我什么能力\",不是\"SQL 怎么写\"。\n- 一致性:同文件 10 个兄弟参数。\n- 测试 fake:类型失配但运行照跑(无 mypy)。\n- 拍板权在你。\n\nKeep it under ~15 lines. No code changes. This is an opinion question again (\"不可以吗\").","startTime":1791428023756,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023756},{"id":"3cf0b705-92f4-472f-981c-91dcaebf9724","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"可以，运行时零差别——上次删 `ContextBuilder` 已经验证过这条路(鸭子类型，协议只给类型检查器和人看)。所以这次我不重复长篇论证，只给你三个决策输入：\n\n**1. cmd-click 的落点不同(你全程的工作方式)**\n\n协议是 engine 依赖面的一页说明书：5 个方法、签名、docstring,一眼看完“它给我什么能力”。具象类点进去是 ~150 行 SQL 会话管理——你只想知道“摘要存哪了、trace 记了什么”，却先撞见连接池细节。协议删了，engine 的代码里**再没有任何地方**能查到“这个依赖负责什么”，只能读实现反推。\n\n**2. 这次和 ContextBuilder 有一个数量级差异**\n\n| | ContextBuilder(已删) | ContextRepository |\n|---|---|---|\n| 方法数 | 1 个 | 5 个 |\n| 消费方 | engine 一处 | **engine + history 两处** |\n| 签名改动 | controller 一个参数 | engine、history 两个签名 |\n\n还有一个绕不开的现实：engine `__init__` 里还有 10 个同款接口参数(`memory_reader`、`planner`、`token_counter`…)。只换 `context_repository` 一个，同一个构造函数里两种风格；换就 11 个全换——我不推荐，但那是“换全”的代价。\n\n**3. 测试的 InMemoryContextRepository**\n\n换具象后它类型失配，但运行照跑(项目没接 mypy)——实际代价为零，这是实话。\n\n**我的倾向一句话**：留着——不是因为“架构该有”，而是因为它是 engine 与持久化之间唯一的能力清单，删了名实一致但少了自解释。**但这属于风格选择，不是对错，你的项目你拍板**：换/不换/连 11 个一起换，说一声我执行。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1790065235780},{"id":"24172019-d388-43bd-a377-c2111361e20b","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"ContextRepository 我不太理解为什么要创建这个，你创建了但是有没有和PostgresContextRepository关联起来，不感觉很畸形吗，用户跳转到这里ContextRepository看到没有时间代码内容","payload":{"query":"ContextRepository 我不太理解为什么要创建这个，你创建了但是有没有和PostgresContextRepository关联起来，不感觉很畸形吗，用户跳转到这里ContextRepository看到没有时间代码内容","rawMessage":"ContextRepository 我不太理解为什么要创建这个，你创建了但是有没有和PostgresContextRepository关联起来，不感觉很畸形吗，用户跳转到这里ContextRepository看到没有时间代码内容","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"app/api/routers/harness.py","name":"harness.py","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"eed808fe-4a5c-4729-8348-73dc09c7db17","requestedAt":1790065453077,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"sta