 And ⑦'s three-layer failure handling.","startTime":1791428023756,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023756},{"id":"88eca0a8-29ee-4891-a7eb-929442a27c04","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"提交完成(5e44536),7 步注释落位，test_context_engine 12 项全过：\n\n| 步 | 代码 | 要点 |\n|---|---|---|\n| ① | `_validate_request` | 身份/问题非空、预算为正、附件 ≤32 个且长度 ≤128 |\n| ② | `build_id` + `query_hash` | hash 是问题正文的 SHA256——**审计可比对但不落正文**，这是 trace 不含用户输入的源头 |\n| ③ | `token_budget or policy.max` | 请求没带预算就用策略默认 |\n| ④ | `start_build` | 审计开闸，build_id 从此可查 |\n| ⑤ | `_build(...)` | 真正的编排：resolve → plan → gather → select → compile(在私有方法里，想看哪段再进去) |\n| ⑥ | `finish_build` | 成功终态，完整 trace 落库后返回 |\n| ⑦ | except | 失败也必须有终态；三层纪律：栈只进日志、审计只留类型摘要、审计失败不吞原始异常 |\n\n一个贯穿的心智模型：**`build()` 的审计三态(④⑥⑦)与 controller `_build_context` 的事件三态(context.started / completed / failed)平行**——前者落库给运维查，后者广播给前端看，两套生命周期覆盖同一次构建，互不替代。你走查时从 `_build_context` ③(组装请求并编译)跳进来，正好落在 ⑤。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1790070824916},{"id":"5242d91c-ff76-4bda-97e5-6215c4638443","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"我有个疑问为什么我们一开始使用fastapi的时候，没有进行PostgresContextRepository的Annotated[xxx, Depends()]","payload":{"query":"我有个疑问为什么我们一开始使用fastapi的时候，没有进行PostgresContextRepository的Annotated[xxx, Depends()]","rawMessage":"我有个疑问为什么我们一开始使用fastapi的时候，没有进行PostgresContextRepository的Annotated[xxx, Depends()]","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"app/agent/context_engine/interfaces.py","name":"interfaces.py","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"d27b9158-fe02-4c0e-912a-463f1ce96b6d","requestedAt":1790074638778,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"5242d91c-ff76-4bda-97e5-6215c4638443"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"cc89f1bf6393a278da603fb8c6345718b0afff8a","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]}},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1790074638822},{"id":"fda6c60e-406c-4dc2-9174-4e6e63d20c68","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"5242d91c-ff76-4bda-97e5-6215c4638443","reportedId":"0578f93e-5789-482a-8e97-bdce8b0fc078","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Comate"},"role":"assistant","status":"cancelled","tokenUsage":{"usagePercentage":74.93,"contextUsed":191813,"contextLimit":256000,"needCompression":true,"savedPercentage":0},"performanceMetrics":{"firstTokenLatency":1540,"totalDuration":83742},"appliedRuleNames":[],"content":{},"elements":[{"id":"6ab25f1223332500531d5d07","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":51112},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"bbcc3922-ffa1-4224-b4ea-eb9fa52e3ab7","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"The user asks: \"为什么我们一开始使用 fastapi 的时候,没有进行 PostgresContextRepository 的 Annotated[xxx, Depends()]\" — why didn't we use FastAPI's Depends() for PostgresContextRepository like other repos?\n\nGood question. Let me look at the facts:\n- `MetaMetricsSemanticRepository` IS wired via FastAPI DI: dependencies.py has `get_meta_metrics_semantic_repository()` and harness.py injects it via Depends (harness.py:152 `meta_metrics_semantic_repository=MetaMetricsSemanticRepository(client=qdrant)` — hmm wait, actually harness.py:152 constructs it DIRECTLY, not via Depends? Earlier grep showed:\n  - app/api/dependencies.py:110: `async def get_meta_metrics_semantic_repository() -> MetaMetricsSemanticRepository:` + line 113 returns instance\n  - app/api/routers/harness.py:84: imports MetaMetricsSemanticRepository\n  - app/api/routers/harness.py:152: `meta_metrics_semantic_repository=MetaMetricsSemanticRepository(client=qdrant)` — direct construction!\n  \n  So even for MetaMetrics repo, harness.py constructs directly rather than via Depends? There may be TWO wiring paths: dependencies.py (FastAPI DI for some routes) and direct construction in harness.py's _build_controller.\n\n- PostgresContextRepository: created inside factory.py `build_context_engine(session_factory=...)` — session_factory comes from `runtime, session_factory, llm_client = _require_runtime()` (a plain function, not Depends). The whole harness assembly chain is: endpoint handler → _require_runtime() (manual) → _build_controller(...) (manual assembly) → build_context_engine → PostgresContextRepository(session_factory).\n\nWhy no Depends for PostgresContextRepository?\n1. **生命周期不匹配**:Depends() 管理的是\"每请求一次\"的依赖(每个 HTTP 请求进来,注入一次,请求结束销毁)。而 ContextEngine/PostgresContextRepository 是每次 run 组装一次,在一个请求里通过 factory 深度组装进 controller → engine → …,层级深达 3-4 层。Depends 适合\"路由参数层\"的浅注入;深层组装链里传的是 session_factory 这种工厂,而不是实例——因为一个 run 内部要在同一个事务/会话上下文里开合(meta_factory()/dw_factory() as session)。\n2. **注入点的位置**:Depends 只能出现在\"FastAPI 能看到的签名\"里(端点函数参数、或 dependencies=[...])。而 PostgresContextRepository 的诞生地在 factory.py 的 build_context_engine 内部——这不是 FastAPI 可见的作用域。要让它走 Depends,得把整条组装链搬到 dependencies.py,让 endpoint 通过参数树接收 controller——但 controller 依赖 run_ref(请求体数据),装配必须等请求体解析后才能进行,Depends 的参数能拿 request body?可以(依赖函数可声明 Body 参数),但那样装配函数会变得巨型、而且 run/stream/resume/reconcile 四个端点共享 _build_controller,手工工厂复用更直接。\n3. **现状里已经有\"半套 Depends\"**:dependencies.py 里有 get_meta_metrics_semantic_repository 之类(FastAPI DI 层),但 harness.py:152 直接 new——说明 harness 装配本来就走手工工厂路线,Depends 只服务那些\"无状态、纯读\"的依赖。\n4. **核心区别一句话**:Depends 解决\"谁需要一个依赖\"(拉取式,声明在消费者);harness 用的是\"工厂组装\"(推送式,装配根一次性 build 整棵对象树)。组装根模式(factory/_build_controller)的好处:整个 run 的组件图在一个函数里可见、事务边界可控(session 随 operation 开合)、测试时替换整棵子树(测试正是 patch build_context_engine)。\n5. Also — actual answer to \"为什么一开始没有\": because build_context_engine 内部才认识 PostgresContextRepository,session_factory 是运行级(不是请求级)资源;而且这些类构建成本高/带状态,不适合每请求重建…… wait, actually they ARE rebuilt per request (build_context_engine called per request in _build_controller). Hmm, per request? _build_controller is called per HTTP request (each /run request builds a fresh controller + engine). So it IS request-scoped, just assembled manually.\n\nSo the honest core: 不是\"不能用\",是\"没走 FastAPI 的注入通道,而是走手工组装根\"。两条路线并存:\n- dependencies.py Depends:给\"FastAPI 直接消费、结构简单\"的依赖(如记忆运行时?let me check what dependencies.py actually wires and whether endpoints use it)\n- harness 手工工厂:给\"深层对象树 + 请求体参数参与装配 + 事务边界随 operation 开合\"的依赖链\n\nWhy didn't \"we\"一开始 use Depends? (The \"我们\" = the project author(s).) Reasons:\na. run_ref/StartRunCommand 依赖请求体 payload → 装配必须发生在 body 解析之后、且每个端点变体略不同(stream vs non-stream 的 event_writer 不同)→ Depends 的声明式注入表达不了\"条件装配\"(event_writer None→Null 兜底、流式才建 sink)。\nb. 事务边界:operation() 里 `async with meta_factory() as meta_session, dw_factory() as dw_session` — 会话生命周期绑在\"后台任务执行期\",不是 HTTP 请求期(流式响应里 operation 在后台 task 跑,请求的 Depends 生命周期已在响应开始后结束——actually for streaming, Depends with yield would close after response completes? FastAPI closes yield-dependencies after response finish; but the operation runs during streaming… messy). The manual `async with` inside operation() gives explicit control.\nc. 测试策略:测试 patch 的是\"组装函数\"(build_context_engine、PostgresHarnessRunStore 等 patch 目标是 harness.py 模块属性)——手工工厂让 patch 点集中在 router 模块,一目了然。\n\nLet me quickly verify dependencies.py content to be accurate about what it does wire (and whether any harness endpoint uses Depends for repos). Check harness.py route signatures for Depends usage.\n\nKeep the answer honest and short-ish: \n1. Depends 的适用域:FastAPI 可见的签名,请求级,声明式拉取\n2. PostgresContextRepository 的诞生地:工厂深层,组装依赖请求体 + 运行级资源 + 条件分支(流式/非流式)\n3. 项目现状:两套并存——dependencies.py 服务简单依赖;harness 的 _build_controller 是\"组装根\"\n4. 如果硬要 Depends 会怎样:把整棵树搬到 dependencies.py、请求体传参、条件装配用 if 表达在依赖函数里 → 复杂度转移而非消失\n5. 一句话:Depends 适合\"浅、无状态、FastAPI 可见\";组装根适合\"深、有事务边界、按请求定制\"。这里属于后者。\n\nLet me verify the facts quickly (dependencies.py around line 110, harness endpoints' Depends usage).","startTime":1791428023756,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023756},{"id":"1b01b79d-cb25-4ef1-9a15-af72b70de53f","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"好问题——先看现状里两条装配路线各自管什么："},{"id":"call_fa02ec9317394e23afe2f2bc","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"grep -n \"Depends\" app/api/routers/harness.py | head -5; echo \"=====\"; sed -n '105,120p' app/api/dependencies.py; echo \"=====\"; grep -rn \"Depends(get_meta_metrics\\|Depends(get_\" app/api/routers/*.py | grep -v __pycache__ | head -6","description":"查 Depends 在 harness 与 dependencies 的实际使用","working_directory":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Command executed successfully.\nExit code: 0\nOutput:\n=====\n    \"\"\"创建 meta_columns_semantic 仓库。\"\"\"\n    client = _require_initialized(qdrant_client_manager.client, \"Qdrant 客户端\")\n    return MetaColumnsSemanticRepository(client=client)\n\n\nasync def get_meta_metrics_semantic_repository() -> MetaMetricsSemanticRepository:\n    \"\"\"创建 meta_metrics_semantic 仓库。\"\"\"\n    client = _require_initialized(qdrant_client_manager.client, \"Qdrant 客户端\")\n    return MetaMetricsSemanticRepository(client=client)\n\n\nasync def get_meta_dimension_values_semantic_repository() -> MetaDimensionValuesSemanticRepository:\n    \"\"\"创建 meta_dimension_values_semantic 仓库。\"\"\"\n    client = _require_initialized(qdrant_client_manager.client, \"Qdrant 客户端\")\n    return MetaDimensionValuesSemanticRepository(client=client)\n\n=====\napp/api/routers/agent.py:68:    agent_service: Annotated[AgentService, Depends(get_agent_service)],\napp/api/routers/agent.py:82:    agent_service: Annotated[AgentService, Depends(get_agent_service)],\napp/api/routers/conversations.py:32:    repository: Annotated[ConversationRepository, Depends(get_conversation_repository)],\napp/api/routers/conversations.py:49:    repository: Annotated[ConversationRepository, Depends(get_conversation_repository)],\napp/api/r