,"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"b0afbe01-cb5d-4339-ace7-28807d189743","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"Confirmed the two-lane reality:\n- **Depends 车道**:`conversations.py`、`agent.py` 用 `Annotated[Repository, Depends(get_xxx)]`——这些路由的消费是\"浅层\":端点函数直接拿 repository 用一两下。\n- **harness 车道**:harness.py 里 **零个 Depends**(grep 无结果)——整个装配走手工工厂 `_require_runtime()` → `_build_controller()` → `build_context_engine()`。甚至 MetaMetricsSemanticRepository 在 harness.py:152 是直接 new 的(同一条链里),而 dependencies.py 里的 get_meta_metrics_semantic_repository 服务的是其他 router(或暂无人用?)。\n\nWhy does harness not use Depends? The real reasons:\n\n1. **装配深度**:Depends 注入的是\"端点直接消费的依赖\"。而 PostgresContextRepository 藏在对象树第 3-4 层:endpoint → _build_controller → build_context_engine → ContextEngine(context_repository=...)/ConversationHistoryManager。Depends 没法声明\"我给一棵树的深层节点供依赖\"——除非把整棵树搬进 dependencies.py,让每个组件都变成一个 Depends 节点,复杂度转移而非消失。\n\n2. **装配输入里有请求体 + 条件分支**:run_ref 要 payload(请求体),event_writer 流式/非流式不同(None→Null 兜底),meta/dw 会话随 operation 开合。Depends 声明式表达\"if streaming then sink else Null\"这种装配逻辑很别扭(依赖函数里写 if 可以,但四个端点变体共享 _build_controller 的复用就没了)。\n\n3. **事务边界不在请求期**:operation() 里 `async with meta_factory() as meta_session` ——会话生命周期绑在**后台任务执行期**(流式响应开始后 operation 还在跑),不是 HTTP 请求期。Depends(yield) 的清理时机跟响应走,和这个模型对不上;手工 `async with` 给了精确控制。\n\n4. **测试的 patch 点**:测试 patch 的是 harness.py 模块属性(PostgresHarnessRunStore、build_context_engine...)——组装根集中在一个模块,patch 点一目了然。\n\n5. **一句话判据**:Depends 适合\"浅、无状态、FastAPI 可见签名\"的依赖;组装根适合\"深、有事务边界、按请求体定制\"的依赖树。harness 是后者,所以一开始就走了手工工厂——不是遗漏,是选型。\n\nAlso note the irony: dependencies.py has get_meta_metrics_semantic_repository but harness.py:152 news it directly — same repo class, two wiring paths coexist; the deps.py one likely serves other routers or is unused by harness. This mirrors the two-style split the user found earlier.\n\nKeep answer structured and tight. No code changes.","startTime":1791428023756,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023756},{"id":"cceb8afe-33f1-4729-85f8-68e1ca4c67ee","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"查清了——这个项目**两条装配车道并存**，而 harness 全程走的是另一条：\n\n```python\n# 车道一:Depends(conversations.py / agent.py)——浅层直接消费\nrepository: Annotated[ConversationRepository, Depends(get_conversation_repository)]\n\n# 车道二:手工组装根(harness.py)—— grep 确认零个 Depends\nendpoint → _require_runtime() → _build_controller() → build_context_engine()\n                                                      → PostgresContextRepository(session_factory)\n```\n\n`PostgresContextRepository` 没走 Depends,不是遗漏，是四个硬理由：\n\n**1. 装配深度**。Depends 只能给“端点函数签名里直接消费的依赖”供料。而它藏在对象树第 3 层:endpoint → `_build_controller` → `build_context_engine` → `ContextEngine(context_repository=...)`。要让它走 Depends,得把整棵树拆成十几个依赖函数搬进 dependencies.py——复杂度只是转移，没消失。\n\n**2. 装配输入含请求体 + 条件分支**。run_ref 要 payload,`event_writer` 流式才建 sink、非流式兜底 Null——这种 `if` 装配逻辑塞进依赖函数很别扭，而且会打散四个端点(run/stream/resume/reconcile)对 `_build_controller` 的复用。\n\n**3. 事务边界不在请求期**——这条最硬。看 `operation()`:\n\n```python\nasync with meta_factory() as meta_session, dw_factory() as dw_session:   # 会话活到后台任务结束\n```\n\n流式响应里，operation 在**后台任务**里跑，而 Depends(yield) 的清理跟着 HTTP 响应生命周期走——时机对不上。手工 `async with` 把会话边界精确绑在执行期，Depends 表达不了。\n\n**4. 测试的 patch 点**。测试 patch 的全是 harness.py 的模块属性(`build_context_engine`、`PostgresHarnessRunStore`…):组装根集中一个函数，patch 清单一目了然。\n\n**判据一句话**：Depends 适合“浅、无状态、FastAPI 可见”的依赖(比如 conversations 路由直接查库)；组装根适合“深、带事务边界、按请求体定制”的依赖树——harness 是后者。所以你看到同一层里两套并存:`dependencies.py` 服务前一种，`_build_controller` 服务后一种。\n\n顺带一个观察:`get_meta_metrics_semantic_repository` 在 dependencies.py 里有，但 harness.py:152 是直接 new 的——同一个类两条路，这正是你昨天发现“两种风格”的又一处体现，按“遇见了再改”的原则先记着。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1790074723446},{"id":"253cc826-5446-4269-8571-10df6fbc03fc","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"继续分析 async def _build(\n        self,\n        *,\n        build_id: str,\n        query_hash: str,\n        token_budget: int,\n        request: ContextRequest,\n    ) -> CompiledContext:  这个函数，添加注释步骤","payload":{"q