0f78","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"The user wants step-by-step comments for `_build()` in engine.py — the private orchestration method (lines ~127-216 in the current file). This is the \"resolve → plan → gather → select → compile\" pipeline I referenced in build() step ⑤.\n\nLet me look at the current content of _build (from the earlier full read, plus my commit added comments to build() so line numbers shifted by ~8):\n\n```python\n    async def _build(\n        self,\n        *,\n        build_id: str,\n        query_hash: str,\n        token_budget: int,\n        request: ContextRequest,\n    ) -> CompiledContext:\n        base_tokens = self.compiler.base_token_count(request)\n        if base_tokens > token_budget:\n            raise ValueError(\n                \"system_instructions 与当前问题已经超过本轮上下文 token 预算\"\n            )\n        working = await self.memory_reader.load_working(\n            user_id=request.user_id,\n            conversation_id=request.conversation_id,\n            limit=None,\n        )\n        resolution = await self.resolver.resolve(request, working)\n        plan = await self.planner.plan(request, working, resolution)\n\n        candidate_budget = max(\n            0,\n            token_budget - base_tokens - self.policy.format_reserve_tokens,\n        )\n        history_result = None\n        if plan.include_working and candidate_budget > 0:\n            history_result = await self.history.prepare(\n                user_id=request.user_id,\n                conversation_id=request.conversation_id,\n                query=plan.search_query,\n                working=working,\n                token_budget=int(candidate_budget * self.policy.working_history_ratio),\n            )\n        other_items = await self._gather_other_sources(\n            request=request,\n            plan=plan,\n            resolution=resolution,\n        )\n        candidates = [\n            *(history_result.items if history_result is not None else ()),\n            *other_items,\n        ]\n        deduplicated = self.deduplicator.deduplicate(candidates)\n        selection = await self.selector.select(\n            list(deduplicated.items), token_budget=candidate_budget\n        )\n        selected, source_decisions = await self._enrich_selected_sources(\n            selection, request.user_id\n        )\n        selection = replace(\n            selection,\n            items=selected,\n            decisions=source_decisions,\n        )\n        selection, messages, sections, final_tokens = await self._fit_compiled_budget(\n            request=request,\n            resolution=resolution,\n            selection=selection,\n            token_budget=token_budget,\n        )\n        decisions = (*deduplicated.decisions, *selection.decisions)\n        trace = ContextBuildTrace(\n            build_id=build_id,\n            ...\n        )\n        return CompiledContext(...)\n```\n\nSteps:\n① 基线预算复核:先算 system_instructions 等固定开销(base_tokens),超预算直接失败——后面所有召回都在剩余空间里进行。\n② 载入工作记忆:当前会话的近期消息(working memory),作为解析引用和规划的上下文。\n③ 解析引用 + 检索规划:resolver 把\"@附件/表\"等指代解析成具体 asset_ids;planner 决定本轮召回哪些来源(include_working/memory_types/use_rag)——这就是 trace.retrieval_plan 与 context.plan 事件的源头。\n④ 候选预算:总预算扣掉固定开销和格式保留,才是候选可用的空间;同时决定要不要准备历史(有候选空间且计划包含 working 时,由 history.prepare 压缩旧会话,可能顺带更新摘要)。\n⑤ 并行召回其他来源:_gather_other_sources 并行拉长期记忆(三类)、附件、可选 RAG。\n⑥ 合并候选去重:历史条目 + 其他来源合并,deduplicator 去重。\n⑦ 预算内选择:selector 按(相关性/重要性/新近度/优先级)打分,在 candidate_budget 内挑选。\n⑧ 补真实来源:只为最终选中的记忆读 source(避免无效查询),enrich 后合并 decisions。\n⑨ 编译与最终预算复核:_fit_compiled_budget 用真实消息 token 复核,超了就从最低分可选候选开始移除,循环直到 fit——产出 messages/sections/final_tokens。\n⑩ 汇总审计轨迹:去重决策 + 选择决策拼成完整 decisions;trace 不含问题正文(③的 plan 经 _trace_plan 清洗)。build_id/query_hash 从 build() 传进来对齐审计开闸。\n⑪ 返回 CompiledContext:messages(给 LLM)+ sections(给事件快照)+ trace(审计)。\n\nNumbering: ①-⑪ maybe too many; group some. Previous styles: build() got ①-⑦, _build_context ①-⑧. ~8-10 steps fine. Let me structure:\n\n① 基线复核(固定开销 vs 