quest.query})\n        frozen = tuple(messages)\n        return frozen, sections, self.token_counter.count_messages(frozen)\n```\n\nSo comments:\n- before `messages: list[dict] = []`: `# ③ system：身份指令。`\n- before runtime_background: `# ④ system：运行态背景——受控数据块，自带防注入声明。`\n- before supplemental: `# ⑤ system：证据背景——按 _section_titles 分区渲染，附未解析引用。`\n- before for working: `# ⑥ 历史多轮：working 消息按 message_index 排序、角色归一化后还原 user/assistant。`\n- before messages.append query: `# ⑦ 当前问题作最后的 user 消息收尾。`\n- before frozen: `# ⑧ 冻结并计数：token_count 供 _build ⑨ 真实复核裁剪。`\n\nHmm — that's a lot of numbered comments. The engine/controller style uses ①②③ per function. 8 steps might be too granular; consolidate:\n- ① 分流 (before grouped loop)\n- ② sections 快照\n- ③ 组装 messages：三段 system（身份 → 运行态 → 证据），块间注释可留一行行内或直接不加\n- ④ working 多轮还原\n- ⑤ 当前问题收尾 + 冻结计数\n\nLet me structure:\n\n```python\n        # ① 分流：working 消息留待按原始角色还原多轮，其余证据按来源类型进分区。\n        grouped: ...\n        working: ...\n        for item in selected:\n            ...\n\n        # ② sections 快照：五个语义分区 + 未解析引用——给事件快照与前端展示。\n        sections: ContextSections = ...\n\n        # ③ 组装最终 messages：system 三连在前（身份 → 运行态 → 证据），顺序即送达顺序。\n        messages: list[dict] = []\n        if request.system_instructions.strip():\n            ...\n        runtime_background = self._runtime_message(request.runtime_context)\n```\n\nthen before the working loop:\n```python\n        # ④ 历史多轮：working 消息按 message_index 排序、角色归一化（human→user / ai→assistant）。\n        for item in sorted(working, key=self._message_index):\n```\n\nthen before query append:\n```python\n        # ⑤ 本轮问题作最后一条 user 消息；冻结后计数，token_count 供 _build ⑨ 真实复核裁剪。\n        messages.append({\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": request.query})\n        frozen = tuple(messages)\n```\n\nWait but ③ comment placement before `messages:` covers system 三连 including runtime + supplemental. Good.\n\nEdit 3 — base_token_count: after docstring add why note:\n```python\n    def base_token_count(self, request: ContextReque