de":0,"inBackground":false}}}]},{"id":"6ab38ab5d0d0586a4a699a0e","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":55893},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"e780e56a-a77f-4af2-9164-2070231693f3","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"Rich inventory. Now I have everything for a comprehensive answer:\n\n**Custom exceptions in the project:**\n- `HarnessPersistenceError(ValueError)` — harness_run_repository.py:86\n- `FinalizationLedgerError(ValueError)`, `FinalizationDigestConflict(FinalizationLedgerError)` — finalization_repository.py\n- `MemoryGovernanceError(ValueError)` — governance.py:30\n- `ArtifactStoreError(RuntimeError)` — artifacts.py:46\n- `HarnessDeadlineExceeded(TimeoutError)` — controller.py:65\n- `ActionCommitFailure(Exception)` — action_commit.py:45\n- `FinalizationFailure(Exception)` — finalization/errors.py:8\n- `PlannerFailure(Exception)` — planning_agent/errors.py:6\n- (ErrorCategory is a StrEnum, not exception)\n\n**Built-in usage pattern in this codebase:**\n- ValueError = \"调用方给的数据不合法\"（参数/状态值校验）——绝大多数校验\n- RuntimeError = \"运行环境/装配状态不满足\"（客户端未初始化、事件循环限制、批量写入失败）\n- TypeError = 类型不对（config.yaml 不是字典、embedding 客户端缺方法）\n- TimeoutError = 超时（HarnessDeadlineExceeded 继承它）\n- asyncio.CancelledError / asyncio.TimeoutError\n- KeyError etc. caught defensively in harness_context.py projectors\n\n**Where ValueError/RuntimeError from context build get caught (\"我也没有看到引用\"):**\nengine.py `_validate_request` 的 ValueError → `build()` ⑦ `except Exception` 捕获 → fail_build 审计 → 原样上抛 → controller `_build_context` ③ `except Exception`（controller.py:920 附近）→ 补发 context.failed → 上抛 → `_run_guarded` `except Exception`（controller.py:241）→ `_finalize(FAILED)`。所以它们从不裸崩——被三层 except Exception 逐级收口。这就是\"没看到引用\"的原因：捕获方都写的是宽泛的 `except Exception`，不点名 ValueError/RuntimeError。\n\n**Common built-in exceptions table** (curated, with project examples):\n\n| 异常 | 语义 | 本项目用例 |\n|---|---|---|\n| ValueError | 值不合法（参数/状态值错，类型对） | engine._validate_request、MemoryManager/importance 越界、conversation_repository 幂等冲突 |\n| TypeError | 类型不对 | config.yaml 解析非字典、embedding 客户端缺方法 |\n| KeyError | 字典缺键 | harness_context 投影防御性捕获 |\n| RuntimeError | 运行环境/装配不满足 | clients 未初始化、Qdrant 同步调用进事件循环、ArtifactStoreError 基类 |\n| TimeoutError | 超时 | HarnessDeadlineExceeded 继承它 |\n| NotImplementedError | 未实现 | （本项目少用） |\n| asyncio.CancelledError | 任务被取消（BaseException！） | controller 214/233 cancelled 收口 |\n| asyncio.TimeoutError | asyncio 超时 | controller 308 _await_with_deadline |\n| Exception | 兜底基类 | 三层 except Exception 收口链 |\n| BaseException | 连 KeyboardInterrupt 都含 | controller 262（极端兜底） |\n\n**Custom exceptions:**\n\n| 自定义 | 继承 | 用途 | 捕获点 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| HarnessDeadlineExceeded | TimeoutError | deadline 到期 | _run_guarded → TIMEOUT |\n| FinalizationFailure | Exception | 收口 Ledger 失败，留给 reconcile | _run_guarded 特判：不降级 FAILED |\n| PlannerFailure | Exception | Planner 重试耗尽/不可重试 | 循环内 → FAILED |\n| ActionCommitFailure | Exception | 动作提交失败 | ... |\n| HarnessPersistenceError | ValueError | run 落库失败 | ... |\n| FinalizationLedgerError / DigestConflict | ValueError | Ledger 顺序/digest 冲突 | ... |\n| MemoryGovernanceError | ValueError | 记忆治理违规 | ... |\n| ArtifactStoreError | RuntimeError | artifact 读写 | ... |\n\nInteresting design observation: custom exceptions subclass built-ins (ValueError/TimeoutError) so callers can catch either specifically or broadly.\n\n**Comment deposit**: The user's confusion \"没看到引用\" = the catch chain is invisible (broad except Exception). Per pre-authorization, deposit one comment. Best location: engine.py `_validate_request` — explaining the fate of these ValueErrors. Also `_knowledge_items` RuntimeError same fate. One comment at _validate_request covering both:\n\n```python\n    @staticmethod\n    def _validate_request(request: ContextRequest) -> None:\n        \"\"\"入参快检：不合规当场拒绝，不浪费一次审计开闸。\"\"\"\n        # 抛出的 ValueError 不会裸崩：build() ⑦ 捕获→fail_build 审计→原样上抛→\n        # controller ③ 补发 context.failed→_run_guarded 兜底收口 FAILED 终态。\n```\n\nHmm — actually \"不浪费一次审计开闸\" isn't accurate: _validate_request runs BEFORE start_build (① in build() happens before ④ audit). So failing fast means no audit row is created. True: ① validate → ② id → ③ budget → ④ start_build. So ValueError from validate = no audit row, no build_id. And ValueError raised LATER (e.g. _build ① baseline overflow, _fit ⑨ required overflow) happens AFTER start_build → goes through ⑦ fail_build audit path. That's a meaningful distinction worth one line!\n\n_validate_request: 审计开闸前的快检——失败不留审计行\n_build ① / _fit ⑨: 开闸后的失败——走 ⑦ fail_build 留痕\n\nComment for _validate_request:\n```python\n        # 本方法在审计开闸（start_build）之前执行：校验失败不留 ContextBuildRunModel 行。\n        # 开闸后的 ValueError/RuntimeError 才走 build() ⑦ 的 fail_build 留痕路径，最终由\n        # controller 补发 context.failed、_run_guarded 收口 FAILED——两层 except Exception 都不点名具体异常。\n```\n\nKeep it 2-3 lines. Then test + commit.\n\nAlso RuntimeError sites in engine: _knowledge_items RuntimeError(\"检索计划要求 RAG，但没有配置知识检索器\") — raised inside _build ⑤ gather → same fate.\n\nAlso should mention: except Exception in engine ⑦ catches even ValueError — broad by design (审计必须闭合). And harness_context.py:92/109 defensively catches (KeyError, TypeError, ValueError) to skip bad rows — different style: expect-and-skip vs fail-fast.\n\nNow compose the final answer in Chinese with tables. Also run tests before commit (comment-only change; run test_context_engine quickly).\n\nLet me write the comment edit. Current code:\n\n```python\n    @staticmethod\n    def _validate_request(request: ContextRequest) -> None:\n        if not request.user_id.strip():\n```\n\nAdd docstring? It has none. Add short docstring + comment lines. Per style: docstring 几个字概括 + 行内细节.\n\n```python\n    @staticmethod\n    def _validate_request(request: ContextRequest) -> None:\n        \"\"\"入参快检：值不合法当场拒绝。\"\"\"\n        # 时机在审计开闸（start_build）之前：这里失败不留 ContextBuildRunModel 行；\n        # 开闸后的 ValueError/RuntimeError 才走 build() ⑦ fail_build 留痕，再由 controller\n        # 补发 co