ceptual, PerceptualMemory):\n            raise RuntimeError(\"记忆类型 perceptual 尚未启用\")\n        return await perceptual._register_asset(asset)\n```\n\n**Edit 6 — load_working:**\nold:\n```python\n        return await self._get(MemoryType.WORKING).load(\n            user_id=user_id,\n            conversation_id=conversation_id,\n            limit=limit,\n        )\n```\nnew:\n```python\n        if self._working is None:\n            raise RuntimeError(\"记忆类型 working 尚未启用\")\n        return await self._working.load(\n            user_id=user_id,\n            conversation_id=conversation_id,\n            limit=limit,\n        )\n```\n\nThen full test suite + commit.\n\nWait — one more check: are there OTHER `_get(` references in manager.py I haven't seen? Lines seen: 115 (search), 195 (register_asset), 208 (load_working), plus inside _get_long_term (74). Earlier grep showed `_get` at 52,54 and call sites 74,115,195,208... wait line 83 uses `_get_long_term` ✓. And line 168/183 (`forget`/`update`) use `_get_long_term` ✓. Let me do a final grep after edits to ensure no `_get(` or `_memories` remains.\n\nAlso the class docstring at 27-33 mentions \"四类记忆按类型注册\" — hmm, that's in the __init__ comment which I'm replacing. The class docstring itself (27-30): \"上层只依赖这个门面：长期记忆的形成、治理、投影同步和版本处理都在门面内部完成，ContextEngine 只使用本类的只读方法。\" — no mention of _memories. Fine.\n\nGo.","startTime":1791428023757,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023757},{"id":"b9d41aa1-9a80-4d57-820c-1579394f4f9f","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"方法面清楚了：`load` 只在 `WorkingMemory` 上，`_register_asset` 只在 `PerceptualMemory` 上，长期三类共享 `PersistentMemory` 基类。`_get() -> Any` 是 IDE 断链的根因——`Any` 会吞掉一切类型信息。优化方案：**具体类型单独成字段，动态分发表只装长期三类**，并顺手删掉 `Any`。开始改："},{"id":"call_57e8899c4319488fb6bf2da1","type":"TOOL","toolName":"edit_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/memory/manager.py","new_string":{"$blob":"sha256:b11777420b96fff2b99f5b351e95e89cd0acc7c72e29dbdff83e0b8f90119186","versi