a）给调用方自检 |\n\n## 两条值得记住的设计线\n\n**降级矩阵**——这个工厂的核心思想是“有什么用什么”：\n\n- Qdrant ✗ 或 Embedding ✗ → 向量检索关（记忆仍可写 PG、词法召回仍可用）\n- Neo4j ✗ → 图投影关（Semantic 退化为纯 PG+Qdrant）\n- LLM ✗ → 自动记忆形成关（人工“记住”保留）\n\n没有任何一个可选组件的缺席会让启动失败——除了 ①。\n\n**消费关系**——这个 `MemoryRuntime` 打包后被三处消费（呼应前两轮的链条）：\n\n- `runtime.manager` → harness.py 组装根 → `ContextEngine(memory_reader=...)`（只读端口）\n- `runtime.formation_service` → run 结束后形成长期记忆\n- `runtime.lifecycle` → 过期清理入口（当前没有消费者启动，注释里已标注）\n\n至此这条链的所有环节都有注释了：**harness 组装根 → factory（本文件）→ MemoryManager 门面 → WorkingMemory/PersistentMemory 各类型 → PG 表**，IDE 逐跳可达。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1790153158097},{"id":"5df7db06-f8aa-4f51-bb3a-a6f5d3af3c44","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"/api/harness/run/status  前端发送这个请求吗，不应该是/api/harness/run/stream这个吗？","payload":{"query":"/api/harness/run/status  前端发送这个请求吗，不应该是/api/harness/run/stream这个吗？","rawMessage":"/api/harness/run/status  前端发送这个请求吗，不应该是/api/harness/run/stream这个吗？","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"app/agent/memory/types/working.py","name":"working.py","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"4a748bba-9052-441e-891e-679d192e4f05","requestedAt":1790153962313,"localPermissionMode":"full-access","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false},"id":"5df7db06-f8aa-4f51-bb3a-a6f5d3af3c44"},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":21049217,"taskId":3511606,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"cc89f1bf6393a278da603fb8c6345718b0afff8a","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]},"taskReminderInjected":true},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1790153963484},{"id":"96fd0755-dd87-492f-b489-f489458c2442","v2":true,"quotaExceedMe