on，不返回完整上下文或工具结果。\n\n为什么 status 不能替代 stream：stream 是\"发起 + 实时推送\"（一次运行只发一次），status 是\"任意时刻的一次性快照读\"（可反复轮询）。刷新页面后 SSE 没了，靠 status + execution-trace 历史回放恢复界面。反过来 stream 也不能替代 status：运行中刷新连接重连不补历史。\n\nAlso note semantic-upload-review.tsx uses status too? It matched the grep -l for \"HarnessStatus\" maybe. The grep output listed it as containing \"HarnessStatus\" pattern (probably the type or helper). Not critical.\n\nIs a comment deposit needed here? The user asked a factual question about API usage. This is frontend/backend API semantics — the as-built doc §2.1 mentions 触发入口 but not /run/status. Hmm — as-built §2.1 lists POST /run and /run/stream only; status/resume/reconcile aren't in the doc's trigger section (§3.2 mentions resume endpoints). Should I deposit to as-built? The user asked \"前端发送这个请求吗\" — an understanding question. Per the established pattern, code-comment deposit is for source semantics; here the answer is cross-cutting (backend endpoint + frontend calls). A brief addition to as-built §2.1 could note the status endpoint's role in 恢复场景... but §2.1 is \"触发入口\" — /run/status is not a trigger. The resume endpoints are covered in §3. I could add one line to §2.1: \"另有 GET /harness/run/status（状态快照查询，前端刷新恢复时使用）\" — actually this fits the doc's incremental style. But the user didn't ask to update the doc; task #19 攒批归档 is about 主线问答写入文档步骤链 — this Q&A is harness API usage, which is part of the 主线. The pre-authorized pattern is 沉淀到源码注释; for doc, previous practice was user explicitly asking (\"把昨天学习的进度补充到 as-built\"). I'll answer in chat and offer optionally to add to as-built — no, don't ask questions, just answer. Keep it simple: answer thoroughly. Maybe mention I can add it to the doc if wanted... The guidance says act when able; but doc updates were explicitly user-driven. I'll answer and note the doc gap briefly without editing.\n\nAnswer structure:\n1. 直接回答：两个都发，不同用途——status 确实存在且前端在用（两处调用点）。\n2. 各自角色表格。\n3. 前端具体调用场景（两处 + stream 一处）。\n4. 为什么缺一不可（刷新恢复场景）。","startTime":1791428023757,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023757},{"id":"e103d967-3295-4b6a-88eb-1c451fca66a2","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"**两个请求前端都发，用途不同，不是二选一。** `/api/harness/run/status` 真实存在且有两处调用：\n\n## 各自的角色\n\n| 端点 | 方法 | 角色 | 前端调用点 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `/api/harness/run/stream` | POST + SSE | **发起一次运行**，实时事件流推送（run.started → context.* → … → run.completed） | `chat-session-view.tsx:973`，一次运行只调用一次 |\n| `/api/harness/run/status` | GET + Query | **任意时刻的一次性状态快照**（可反复查询） | `chat-session-view.tsx:530` 和 `:840` |\n\n## status 的两个真实使用场景\n\n1. **页面刷新后恢复 UI**（chat-session-view.tsx:530）：刷新后 SSE 连接早就断了，前端拿 `run_id` 查一次 status——返回当前状态（running / completed / `waiting_confirmation` / failed…）、待处理确认卡片数据、错误信息，用来重建界面。\n2. **切换会话时检查活跃 run**（chat-session-view.tsx:840）：发现 run 处于 `waiting_confirmation` 且带 `pending_confirmation`，就恢复“等待用户确认”的交互态。\n\n## 为什么缺一不可\n\n- **stream 替代不了 status**：SSE 是“发起 + 推送”，连接断了就断了——刷新页面后不会重放历史。恢复现场靠的是 `status`（查当前态）+ `POST /conversations/execution-trace`（历史事件回放，as-built §3.5 提过）。\n- **status 替代不了 stream**：它是快照，没有实时性；运行中的 token 流、tool.progress 都只能走 SSE。\n\n后端实现（`harness.py:894` `get_harness_status`）：从 PG run store 读**最后已持久化状态**，`_status_payload` 只返回状态摘要和待处理确认——不返回完整上下文或工具结果，天然适合前端随便轮询。\n\n顺带说明：as-built §2.1 目前只写了 `/run` 和 `/run/stream` 两个触发入口，`/run/status`（刷新恢复）没登记——要不要下次走查前端恢复链路时一起补进去？"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1790154147060},{"id":"6854842c-2eb5-4569-98f8-2340aa66359a","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"http://localhost:3000/api/harness/run/status?run_id=5172814a-6c27-4f3d-a3c9-f19fa28c53c1&user_id=dev-user\n","payload":{"query":"http://localhost:3000/api/harness/run/status?run_id=5172814a-6c27-4f3d-a3c9-f19fa28c53c1&user_id=dev-user\n","rawMessage":"http://localhost:3000/api/harness/run/status?run_id=5172814a-6c27-4f3d-a3c9-f19fa28c53c1&user_id=dev-user\n","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zul