uration":61684},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"14997f02-c26b-4627-8425-a7a341b86cf5","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"The user asks \"我怎么验证？\" — how do I verify? Context: the previous answer was about `/run/status` being used for refresh/switch-back scenarios. The user wants to verify this behavior themselves.\n\nWait — verify what exactly? The most recent thread of conversation:\n1. The orphan run diagnosis (5172814a...) — they may want to verify the fix\n2. The /run/status purpose (refresh/switch-back scenarios)\n\n\"我怎么验证？\" right after \"他的主要用途是在于刷新页面、切回会话？\" — they want to verify that /run/status behaves as described: refresh the page, see the status call, see the recovery.\n\nThe most practical verification steps:\n\n**验证 1：看前端真的在刷新时调 status**\n1. 打开浏览器 DevTools → Network → 过滤 \"status\"\n2. 刷新页面（或切换会话）\n3. 能看到 `GET /api/harness/run/status?run_id=...&user_id=dev-user`，正是 chat-session-view.tsx:530/:840 发出的\n\n**验证 2：status 的数据从 PG 来（跟 SSE 无关）**\n- 后端日志里看 SQL 或直接查库对比：`select run_id, status from harness_runs where run_id='...'`，返回的 status 与接口返回一致。\n\n**验证 3：SSE 断开 = 运行被取消（CANCELLED）**\n- 发起一个会跑一会儿的运行（比如让它查询数据），在工具执行中途刷新页面/关掉标签页\n- 查库：`select status, error_message from harness_runs where run_id='...'` → status 应变为 cancelled（§4.3 收口）\n- 同时前端 execution-trace 里显示\"中断\"\n\n**验证 4：waiting_confirmation 场景**\n- 触发一个需要确认的运行（ask_user/NEEDS_USER）\n- 等待确认时刷新页面 → status 返回 waiting_confirmation + pending_confirmation → 界面恢复确认卡片\n- 点确认 → /run/resume/stream 新连接继续\n\n**验证 5（呼应孤儿问题）**：那两条 9-21 的 running 孤儿——查库对比 status='running' 但没有 finalization 行；或在 UI 里切到那个会话看 status 返回 running 但实际啥也没跑。\n\nBut which one does the user want? The immediate context is verifying the \"刷新页面/切回会话\" claim. I should give a focused, practical verification recipe — concise, with concrete steps and expected outcomes. The most direct one: DevTools Network filter + refresh. Then optionally the deeper DB-level checks.\n\nKeep it 简洁 and actionable. Maybe 3 verification methods ordered by effort:\n1. 最直接：DevTools Network 过滤 status，刷新/切会话，看请求时机（挂载后立即一次）\n2. 对照代码：在 chat-session-view.tsx:530/:840 打断点/console.log\n3. 验证行为闭环：中途刷新 → 查库 status=cancelled（证明 SSE 断开即取消，status 查到的是收口后的终态）\n\nNo code changes needed. Pure guidance. Also I can offer: 我可以帮你跑 3（数据库侧验证）—— but the cancel test requires interactive browser action which only the user can do. The DB queries I can do.","startTime":1791428023757,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023757},{"id":"89385b14-fe4b-43c9-a041-1dc182dbbf2a","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"三种验证法，按代价从低到高：\n\n## 1. 最直接：抓 Network（30 秒）\n\n浏览器 DevTools → **Network** → 过滤框输 `status` → **刷新页面**、或**切换到另一个会话再切回来** → 立刻能看到 `GET /api/harness/run/status?run_id=...&user_id=dev-user`。\n\n- 刷新后**只发一次**（不是轮询）→ 证明它是“回头再看”用的\n- Initiator 指向 `chat-session-view.tsx` → 对应 ：530（恢复判定）/ ：840（待确认检查）两个调用点\n\n## 2. 验证它读的是 PG 而不是内存\n\n发起一次运行，等它完成后查库对比：\n\n```sql\nSELECT status FROM harness_runs WHERE run_id = '<run_id>';\n```\n\n返回值和 status 接口、前端显示的状态三者一致 → 证明快照来自落库数据，SSE 断了它照样答得上。\n\n## 3. 验证完整行为闭环（最有信息量）\n\n发起一个会跑一会儿的运行 → **在工具执行中途刷新页面** → 然后查库：\n\n```sql\nSELECT status, error_message FROM harness_runs WHERE run_id = '<run_id>';\n```\n\n预期 `status = 'cancelled'`——这同时验证了两件事：\n- **SSE 断开 ≠ 继续跑**：后端检测到断连直接收口 CANCELLED（harness.py:561-569 → controller:205-227）\n- **status 查到的是收口后的终态**：刷新后前端显示“中断”的依据就是这个落库状态\n\n顺带一提：库里那两条 9-21 的 `running`（`3f20190a…` / `ed5dcff1…`）就是反例——进程死了连收口都没有，status 会永远报 running。第 3 步如果做出来是 `cancelled`，正好和它们形成“干净断连 vs 脏死”的对照。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1790155764145},{"id":"1acef3b1-c496-4773-adaa-d7c3b169fb19","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":"关键现在已经影响到sse了，现在出现刚才的数据为空。我们需要处理吗，还是说就是脏数据","payload":{"query":"关键现在已经影响到sse了，现在出现刚才的数据为空。我们需要处理吗，还是说就是脏数据","rawMessage":"关键现在已经影响到sse了，现在出现刚才的数据为空。我们需要处理吗，还是说就是脏数据","model":{"displayName":"Auto","modelId":"auto","requestType":"COMATE_DEFAULT_MODE","mode":"NORMAL"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Comate","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowle