ry.strip(),\n        reason=decision.reason.strip() or \"LLM 上下文召回规划\",\n    )\n```\n\n注释要点（贴合\"LLM 意见处处被钳制\"这个设计主题——这是这个类的核心特征）：\n- ① 显式策略短路：不花 LLM 调用\n- ② 提示词组装：working 历史（reversed 截断 6000 字符）、resolution、schema\n- ③ 结构化校验：_extract_json 抠 {} 边界、Pydantic 强校验——模型自由文本不能直接执行\n- ④ 可预测降级：任何异常都走 fallback，不抛给上层\n- ⑤ WORKING 滤除+去重：与 DeterministicContextPlanner._long_term_only 同一规则\n- ⑥ LLM 决策的钳制：include_working 有 resolver 强制下限、use_rag AND 开关、search_query 兜底原问题、reason 兜底文案\n\n对照断点话题：这里是 planner.py:157 的函数，主路径。注释里可以点一句\"这里是生产主路径\"帮用户调试定位？不加调试相关内容，注释讲设计。\n\n写 Edit（精确匹配 157-186 行），然后全量+提交。","startTime":1791428023759,"lastModifiedTime":1791428023759},{"id":"d34fad15-125b-45c4-9f7b-8652461b006a","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"收到——给 `LlmContextPlanner.plan`（就是你上次断点没进去的 planner.py:157，生产主路径）加 ①-⑥ 步骤注释："},{"id":"call_7f967edf7ba7449b8759210c","type":"TOOL","toolName":"edit_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/context_engine/planner.py","new_string":{"$blob":"sha256:ec5c0e1425a0a20debfe389d294f4c9359e9ec045921d0a1e8f19c0a202be056","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":2394,"compression":"none"},"old_string":{"$blob":"sha256:c880116e755571d8df40284bf8ec3bb786eeb0948472537411165489c4944d84","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":1300,"compression":"none"},"replace_all":"false"},"toolState":"cancelled","result":{"output":"EDIT REJECTED: Stale context detected for /Users/z523/Desktop/zizhi/ai_Python/ai_data_analysis/app/agent/context_engine/planner.py.\nCause: This file's content changed after your last read.\n\nIMPORTANT: The change may have been made by the user, by another process,\nor by an earlier write of yours that has not fully synced to the editor\ndocument yet. Do not assume who caused it.\n\nMANDATORY ACTIONS:\n1) Re-read the latest file content.\n2) List the changes you found (line ranges + what changed).\n3) Infer the likely source and intent: user edit, concurrent process, or sync delay.\n4) If the change 